asr-000122
00:24:17.040 --> 00:24:21.620
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Good morning, Madam Speaker and distinguished members of this August Chamber.

asr-000123
00:24:21.620 --> 00:24:26.620
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: We are honored to sponsor today the proposed budget of the Metropolitan Manila

asr-000124
00:24:27.360 --> 00:24:31.820
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Development Authority, or the MMDA, for the fiscal year 2027.

asr-000125
00:24:32.380 --> 00:24:37.220
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: The State recognizes Metro Manila as a special development and administrative region.

asr-000126
00:24:37.800 --> 00:24:42.820
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: By reason of the complex and interrelated challenges of rapid urbanization in Metro Manila,

asr-000127
00:24:43.280 --> 00:24:49.900
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: such as those relating to traffic management, solid waste disposal, flood mitigation and sewerage management,

asr-000128
00:24:49.900 --> 00:24:57.320
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: urban renewal, health and sanitation, and public safety, the MMDA was established under RA No. 7924,

asr-000129
00:24:57.360 --> 00:25:08.720
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: with a mandate, among other things, to formulate, coordinate, regulate, and monitor the implementation of medium and long-term plans and programs for the delivery of Metro-wide services.

asr-000130
00:25:09.600 --> 00:25:20.000
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: It works in close partnership with the 17 local governments to develop and implement integrated, sustainable, and resilient metropolitan development strategies for Metro Manila.

asr-000131
00:25:20.240 --> 00:25:26.000
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Under House Bill No. 10858, or General Appropriations Bill for Fiscal Year 2027,

asr-000132
00:25:27.360 --> 00:25:34.940
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: the MMDA seeks the approval of its proposed national subsidy in the amount of Php 6,560,912,000.

asr-000133
00:25:35.440 --> 00:25:41.200
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: This allocation will provide the MMDA with the means and resources necessary to fulfill its mandate

asr-000134
00:25:41.200 --> 00:25:45.840
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: and fund and implement its core programs on solid waste and disposal management,

asr-000135
00:25:45.840 --> 00:25:50.600
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: traffic and transport management, flood mitigation and sewerage management,

asr-000136
00:25:51.220 --> 00:25:54.780
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Pasig River Ferry Service and MMDA Roadside Management Program.

asr-000137
00:25:55.360 --> 00:25:57.040
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: These are programs and services,

asr-000138
00:25:57.360 --> 00:26:01.680
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: essential to the millions of Filipinos who live, work, and travel throughout Metro Manila.

asr-000139
00:26:02.000 --> 00:26:11.900
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: In view of the foregoing, I respectfully urge my esteemed colleagues to support the immediate approval of the proposed budget of the MMDA for Fiscal Year 2027.

asr-000140
