Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Doon sa rule po na yan ng MMDA.

asr-000591
00:52:28.820 --> 00:52:37.600
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: But we will remind him kapag, and all his employees, kapag kung bumalik man siya after his leave.

asr-000592
00:52:39.380 --> 00:52:39.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000593
00:52:40.000 --> 00:52:49.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: However, aside from General Manager Torre, si Chairman Artes din po,

asr-000594
00:52:49.660 --> 00:52:53.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: meron din mga statement to the effect na after the incident,

asr-000595
00:52:53.940 --> 00:52:58.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi naman bawal kumuha ng footage in public.

asr-000596
00:52:59.040 --> 00:53:04.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, this was in defense or in reaction to the allegation na

asr-000597
00:53:04.000 --> 00:53:06.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: binayulate niyo yung data privacy right ng individual.

asr-000598
00:53:07.800 --> 00:53:10.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, could that be explained? Anong explanation po noon?

asr-000599
00:53:11.280 --> 00:53:18.780
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Ang, your honor, ang sinabi po ni Chairman, hindi po bawal kumuha kung public place.

asr-000600
00:53:18.780 --> 00:53:22.780
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Pero yung pagpo-post po is another matter entirely.

asr-000601
00:53:22.780 --> 00:53:23.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000602
00:53:23.780 --> 00:53:24.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000603
00:53:24.780 --> 00:53:32.780
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Kaya po, nagkakonsult po sila sa Data Privacy Commission ngayon dahil sa mga ganyang mga insidente po.

asr-000604
00:53:32.780 --> 00:53:33.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000605
00:53:33.780 --> 00:53:45.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now, so, malinaw ang policy mula 2025 na hindi pwede yung personal vlogging of official MMDA operations, tama po?

asr-000606
00:53:45.780 --> 00:53:46.780
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Yes, your honor.

asr-000607
00:53:46.780 --> 00:53:51.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yung kalakaran ni Mr. Goh na nakikita natin na habang nagkakonsult,

asr-000608
00:53:51.780 --> 00:53:52.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000609
00:53:52.780 --> 00:54:00.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nag-operation siya, meron pang parang private individual yun na sumusunod sa kanya at nag-be-video.

asr-000610
00:54:00.780 --> 00:54:01.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sama po ba?

asr-000611
00:54:02.780 --> 00:54:07.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: That is not officially sanctioned? Hindi po official na pinahihintulutan?

asr-000612
00:54:08.780 --> 00:54:11.780
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Your honor, again, institutional practice po yun.

asr-000613
00:54:11.780 --> 00:54:17.780
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Yun po yung record purposes na pinapayaga naman po for law enforcement, traffic violation.

asr-000614
00:54:17.780 --> 00:54:18.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000615
00:54:18.780 --> 00:54:28.780
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: So, mayroon talaga ng contention doon sa kung pwede po i-post, saan po yung hanggang saan po yung pagpo-post sa personal vlog po?

asr-000616
00:54:28.780 --> 00:54:30.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000617
00:54:30.780 --> 00:54:45.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The chair of the, the vice chair, sorry, the chair pala, sorry, I see him here.

asr-000618
00:54:45.780 --> 00:54:46.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000619
00:54:46.780 --> 00:55:14.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The chair of the House Committee on Metro Manila Development, Committee on Metro Manila Development, the honorable Dean Asistio, wrote to me, and enclosing a copy of the MMDA's position paper on the MMDA's official response to a copy of the House Resolution.

asr-000620
00:55:14.780 --> 00:55:15.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000621
00:55:15.780 --> 00:55:17.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Of the House Resolution that we filed on this incident.

asr-000622
00:55:18.780 --> 00:55:21.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: House Resolution 1370.

asr-000623
00:55:21.780 --> 00:55:32.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At the reply was in, was signed by, was prepared by and signed by Chairman Artes.

asr-000624
00:55:33.780 --> 00:55:34.780
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Correct.

asr-000625
00:55:35.780 --> 00:55:42.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At may mga, sagot po siya doon sa mga tanong, including some of those that you mentioned on the record in this interpolation.

asr-000626
00:55:43.780 --> 00:55:45.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Doon na lang po ako sa dulong bahagi.

asr-000627
00:55:45.780 --> 00:55:50.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sabi natin, kasi sa resolution sabi natin, may paglabag po,

asr-000628
00:55:51.300 --> 00:55:55.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi lang si Gabriel Go as an individual, kung hindi,

asr-000629
00:55:55.620 --> 00:56:03.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pati yung MMDA, nang pinost nila yung insidente at naging viral ito,

asr-000630
00:56:03.740 --> 00:56:07.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: despite the statements of the teacher.

asr-000631
00:56:07.980 --> 00:56:09.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And let me just go back.

asr-000632
00:56:15.780 --> 00:56:21.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para malagay ko rin on the record, yung sinabi nung teacher mismo na involved.

asr-000633
00:56:22.420 --> 00:56:26.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The teacher wrote a letter to the MMDA.

asr-000634
00:56:26.060 --> 00:56:27.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So let me just quote,

asr-000635
00:56:27.660 --> 00:56:32.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Despite my request, the encounter was later uploaded to social media

asr-000636
00:56:32.400 --> 00:56:35.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: where it generated widespread public attention

asr-000637
00:56:35.380 --> 00:56:40.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and subjected me to embarrassment, ridicule, and public judgment.

asr-000638
00:56:41.400 --> 00:56:41.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Unquote.

asr-000639
00:56:42.340 --> 00:56:43.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So yun po yung sinabi niya.

asr-000640
00:56:43.640 --> 00:56:45.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: He also requested the takedown.

asr-000641
00:56:45.780 --> 00:56:47.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: of the video of his apprehension,

asr-000642
00:56:48.240 --> 00:56:49.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: along with, quote,

asr-000643
00:56:49.700 --> 00:56:55.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: any other similar videos that unnecessarily demean individuals

asr-000644
00:56:55.060 --> 00:56:59.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: or violate their rights to privacy, dignity, and respectful treatment.

asr-000645
00:56:59.680 --> 00:57:00.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Unquote.

asr-000646
00:57:00.620 --> 00:57:08.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So yun po yung nasa sulat ng teacher na subject nung video na ito.

asr-000647
00:57:09.000 --> 00:57:11.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, bilang sagot po sa issue na yun,

asr-000648
00:57:11.620 --> 00:57:14.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sabi ng MMDA through Chairman Artes,

asr-000649
00:57:14.720 --> 00:57:15.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: wala pong paglabag.

asr-000650
00:57:15.780 --> 00:57:24.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na ginawa ang MMDA as an institution sa data privacy rights ng sinuman.

asr-000651
00:57:24.540 --> 00:57:26.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang sabi niya rito,

asr-000652
00:57:27.260 --> 00:57:38.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang sabi po rito, and this is where I want clarification,

asr-000653
00:57:39.200 --> 00:57:45.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the MMDA categorically denies that it has consented to,

asr-000654
00:57:45.780 --> 00:57:51.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: or allowed Mr. Goh to videotape any valid MMDA clearing operation.

asr-000655
00:57:53.700 --> 00:57:58.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And let me quote further,

asr-000656
00:58:02.900 --> 00:58:06.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the MMDA has not legitimized or planned to legitimize

asr-000657
00:58:07.520 --> 00:58:12.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: any of the online MMDA-related content

asr-000658
00:58:12.060 --> 00:58:15.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: published by the said

asr-000659
00:58:15.800 --> 00:58:16.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dada Ku channel.

asr-000661
00:58:20.300 --> 00:58:22.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Earlier, it was mentioned,

asr-000662
00:58:22.360 --> 00:58:27.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in fact, the videos were uploaded onto the channel of a certain Dada Ku,

asr-000663
00:58:27.920 --> 00:58:31.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: D-A-D-A, and then K-O-O,

asr-000664
00:58:31.540 --> 00:58:35.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: a channel that is neither connected nor authorized by the MMDA

asr-000665
00:58:35.700 --> 00:58:37.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to upload such footage.

asr-000666
00:58:38.220 --> 00:58:41.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, parang ang sinasabi po,

asr-000667
00:58:41.640 --> 00:58:43.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na yung video na yun,

asr-000668
00:58:43.860 --> 00:58:45.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kinuha at in-upload sa isang

asr-000669
00:58:45.780 --> 00:58:47.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: private channel called Dada

asr-000670
00:58:47.740 --> 00:58:49.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ku. Yes.

asr-000671
00:58:49.860 --> 00:58:50.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And therefore,

asr-000672
00:58:51.420 --> 00:58:53.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: walang sabit

asr-000673
00:58:53.660 --> 00:58:56.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang MMDA. Tama po ba?

asr-000674
00:58:56.600 --> 00:58:57.660
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes, the Honorable

asr-000675
00:58:57.660 --> 00:58:59.880
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Representative Tino, it is a

asr-000676
00:58:59.880 --> 00:59:01.000
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: private channel,

asr-000677
00:59:01.440 --> 00:59:03.940
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: it is a channel of a private

asr-000678
00:59:03.940 --> 00:59:05.700
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: person, and thus

asr-000679
00:59:05.700 --> 00:59:08.060
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: the MMDA will really have no control

asr-000680
00:59:08.060 --> 00:59:10.180
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: over the said private channel.

asr-000681
00:59:10.840 --> 00:59:11.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: However,

asr-000682
00:59:11.480 --> 00:59:11.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: however,

asr-000683
00:59:13.940 --> 00:59:15.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kung babalik natin yung

asr-000684
00:59:15.440 --> 00:59:16.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: video kanina,

asr-000685
00:59:17.580 --> 00:59:18.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung video na nag-viral po,

asr-000686
00:59:20.080 --> 00:59:21.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: a screenshot of which,

asr-000687
00:59:22.440 --> 00:59:23.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yan,

asr-000688
00:59:23.480 --> 00:59:25.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung video na yan, yan po nag-viral na yan,

asr-000689
00:59:27.140 --> 00:59:27.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: it is on

asr-000690
00:59:27.620 --> 00:59:28.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the MMDA page,

asr-000691
00:59:29.500 --> 00:59:31.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: on the MMDA Facebook

asr-000692
00:59:31.560 --> 00:59:32.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: page.

asr-000693
00:59:36.120 --> 00:59:37.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hanggang ngayon,

asr-000694
00:59:37.640 --> 00:59:38.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nandun pa rin po.

asr-000695
00:59:39.380 --> 00:59:40.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kagabi lang,

asr-000696
00:59:40.320 --> 00:59:42.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: chinek namin, and it is

asr-000697
00:59:42.960 --> 00:59:44.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: on the July 14,

asr-000698
00:59:45.440 --> 00:59:47.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: post, one of the

asr-000699
00:59:47.860 --> 00:59:49.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: posts on July 14

asr-000700
00:59:49.640 --> 00:59:51.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: of the MMDA page

asr-000701
00:59:51.680 --> 00:59:53.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: itself. So, in other words,

asr-000702
00:59:55.780 --> 00:59:57.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: institutional posting

asr-000703
00:59:57.860 --> 00:59:59.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: po ito. Hindi po ba?

asr-000704
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:11.360
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes. The said post is indeed institutional because it is part of the reporting of the institution to the public about clearing operations.

asr-000705
01:00:11.740 --> 01:00:17.520
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: But the video will not be found anywhere in that Facebook page of the institution.

asr-000706
01:00:18.260 --> 01:00:22.760
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: That video, that very video, no, it's not a picture.

asr-000707
01:00:22.760 --> 01:00:27.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: It's not a picture. It's the post itself.

asr-000708
01:00:27.720 --> 01:00:34.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No? Pakicheck nyo na lang po. Facebook account nyo yan.

asr-000709
01:00:35.200 --> 01:00:42.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I'm sure one of your social media persons will be able to confirm this.

asr-000710
01:00:43.480 --> 01:00:47.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hinanap po namin sa MMDA Facebook page.

asr-000711
01:00:47.520 --> 01:00:54.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At yung video mismo ng insidente na yun ay nananatili pa rin sa Facebook account.

asr-000712
01:00:56.060 --> 01:00:57.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Video po yan.

asr-000713
01:00:57.420 --> 01:00:57.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes.

asr-000714
01:00:57.720 --> 01:01:00.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I-winshot lang namin yun. Ayaw na namin i-play dito yung video.

asr-000715
01:01:01.840 --> 01:01:06.880
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes, the Honorable Tino. So the chairman is now double-checking and making sure.

asr-000716
01:01:07.420 --> 01:01:11.620
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And if such is the case, of course, this will be brought down right away.

asr-000717
01:01:12.440 --> 01:01:14.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Well, yun na nga po.

asr-000718
01:01:14.940 --> 01:01:19.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, at least nalinaw na natin yung policy.

asr-000719
01:01:20.100 --> 01:01:21.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So may malinaw na policy po talaga.

asr-000720
01:01:23.060 --> 01:01:27.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung mga operatives ng MMDA may document, may use video to document.

asr-000721
01:01:27.720 --> 01:01:29.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The incidents.

asr-000722
01:01:30.520 --> 01:01:36.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero, no posting to personal logs or accounts.

asr-000723
01:01:37.220 --> 01:01:38.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pwede ang institutional posting.

asr-000724
01:01:39.600 --> 01:01:40.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, that's clear.

asr-000725
01:01:41.300 --> 01:01:45.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And Mr. Goh is suspended from field operations.

asr-000726
01:01:46.260 --> 01:01:49.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: He is currently in the HQ, I suppose.

asr-000727
01:01:50.580 --> 01:01:56.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And he is undergoing certain administrative...

asr-000728
01:01:56.720 --> 01:01:57.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: administrative...

asr-000729
01:01:57.420 --> 01:02:05.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: cases or facing certain administrative cases related to the social media issue.

asr-000730
01:02:05.760 --> 01:02:06.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, klaro na po yun.

asr-000731
01:02:07.320 --> 01:02:13.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now, ang isang issue ko na lang po ay sa kabila nung policy ng MMDA

asr-000732
01:02:13.820 --> 01:02:22.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at yung pagkilala nila na dapat i-respeto ang right to privacy ng mga individual.

asr-000733
01:02:23.180 --> 01:02:25.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kahit pa sabihin mong violator, yes, violator.

asr-000734
01:02:25.920 --> 01:02:26.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero may right to privacy.

asr-000735
01:02:27.420 --> 01:02:28.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pa rin ang mga ito.

asr-000736
01:02:29.460 --> 01:02:29.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-000737
01:02:30.140 --> 01:02:34.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, unfortunately, ang nakita po natin,

asr-000738
01:02:35.920 --> 01:02:40.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: that very same video still remains on the website.

asr-000739
01:02:40.260 --> 01:02:48.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And, as has been pointed out by several institutions,

asr-000740
01:02:48.880 --> 01:02:53.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: notably the National Privacy Commission and the Commission on Human Rights,

asr-000741
01:02:54.120 --> 01:02:57.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kahit po nakablur yung mukha niya,

asr-000742
01:02:57.420 --> 01:03:02.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: eh yung kanyang komunidad, madali siyang makikilala.

asr-000743
01:03:02.240 --> 01:03:09.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Therefore, may paglabag sa rights, sa privacy rights ng individual.

asr-000744
01:03:09.580 --> 01:03:16.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil, hindi naman kailangang mapahiya ka sa madla

asr-000745
01:03:16.440 --> 01:03:24.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: para lang masita ka at managot sa iyong paglabag na nagmotor ka ng walang helmet.

asr-000746
01:03:24.700 --> 01:03:25.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Natutuon namang paglabag.

asr-000747
01:03:25.980 --> 01:03:26.620
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes.

asr-000748
01:03:26.620 --> 01:03:28.800
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes, the Honorable Madam Speaker.

asr-000749
01:03:28.980 --> 01:03:29.940
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes, the Honorable Tino.

asr-000750
01:03:30.740 --> 01:03:34.160
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And for this, the institution apologizes deeply

asr-000751
01:03:34.160 --> 01:03:38.260
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: and ensures that all measures will be taken

asr-000752
01:03:38.260 --> 01:03:40.720
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: so none of the same incident will be repeated.

asr-000753
01:03:41.820 --> 01:03:42.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000754
01:03:43.000 --> 01:03:44.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Maraming salamat po dun sa apology.

asr-000755
01:03:44.980 --> 01:03:48.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The apology is for the teacher, of course.

asr-000756
01:03:48.680 --> 01:03:53.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero para na rin po sana dun sa marami pang mga individual

asr-000757
01:03:53.020 --> 01:03:56.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na ginawang sample sa page ng...

asr-000758
01:03:56.620 --> 01:03:59.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: MMDA

asr-000759
01:03:59.140 --> 01:04:01.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: without their consent.

asr-000760
01:04:02.120 --> 01:04:03.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So siguro ganoon ang policy.

asr-000761
01:04:03.800 --> 01:04:07.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kung gusto nyo magkaroon ng lesson for others,

asr-000762
01:04:07.340 --> 01:04:10.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kailangan naman pumayag yung subject.

asr-000763
01:04:10.720 --> 01:04:13.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pag sinabi nung subject, katulad nung teacher,

asr-000764
01:04:13.720 --> 01:04:15.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sir, pwede po ba, huwag nyo ng ano?

asr-000765
01:04:16.520 --> 01:04:17.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: E di hindi pwede.

asr-000766
01:04:17.420 --> 01:04:18.400
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes, the Honorable Tino.

asr-000767
01:04:18.400 --> 01:04:20.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kano lang naman po kasimple yun, di ba?

asr-000768
01:04:20.460 --> 01:04:21.600
