asr-000847
01:08:38.810 --> 01:08:45.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you, Madam Speaker. Madam Speaker, distinguished colleagues, good morning po sa ating lahat.

asr-000848
01:08:45.160 --> 01:08:49.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: It is my honor to sponsor the budget of the DOJ, including its attached agencies,

asr-000849
01:08:49.160 --> 01:08:58.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: for fiscal year 2027, amounting to 46.435 billion pesos, inclusive of the automatic appropriations.

asr-000850
01:08:58.160 --> 01:09:04.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: In terms of new appropriations, which is subject for congressional approval,

asr-000851
01:09:04.160 --> 01:09:10.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: the total budget of the DOJ amounts to 43.305 billion pesos,

asr-000852
01:09:10.160 --> 01:09:18.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: which represents an increase of about 1.13 percent, or 485.028 million pesos higher,

asr-000853
01:09:18.160 --> 01:09:26.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: than the fiscal year 2026 level of 42.820 billion pesos.

asr-000854
01:09:26.160 --> 01:09:34.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: The proposed 46.435 billion pesos budget is broken down by agency as follows.

asr-000855
01:09:34.160 --> 01:09:38.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Office of the Secretary, 13.930 billion pesos.

asr-000856
01:09:38.160 --> 01:09:42.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Bureau of Corrections, 11.932 billion pesos.

asr-000857
01:09:42.160 --> 01:09:47.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Bureau of Immigration, 2.980 billion pesos.

asr-000858
01:09:47.160 --> 01:09:51.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Land Registration Authority, 3.279 billion pesos.

asr-000859
01:09:51.160 --> 01:09:56.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: NBI, 3.027 billion pesos.

asr-000860
01:09:56.160 --> 01:10:03.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Office of Alternative Dispute Resolution, 138.756 million pesos.

asr-000861
01:10:03.160 --> 01:10:08.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Office of the Government Corporate Counsel, 310.168 million pesos.

asr-000862
01:10:08.160 --> 01:10:12.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Office of the Solicitor General, 2.142 billion pesos.

asr-000863
01:10:12.160 --> 01:10:15.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Parole and Probation Administration, 1.254 billion pesos.

asr-000864
01:10:15.160 --> 01:10:25.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Philippine Commission on Good Government, 338.676 million pesos.

asr-000865
01:10:25.160 --> 01:10:31.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: And the Public Attorney's Office, amounting to 7.101 billion pesos.

asr-000866
01:10:31.160 --> 01:10:35.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: This budget will support the department's programs, projects, and its operation

asr-000867
01:10:35.160 --> 01:10:39.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: for the effective, efficient, and equitable administration of justice.

asr-000868
01:10:39.160 --> 01:10:45.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: DOJ, being the government's principal law agency, serves as the government's prosecution arm

asr-000869
01:10:45.160 --> 01:10:50.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and administers the government's criminal justice system

asr-000870
01:10:50.160 --> 01:10:55.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: by investigating crimes, prosecuting offenders, and overseeing the correctional system.

asr-000871
01:10:55.160 --> 01:11:00.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: It is also the government's legal counsel and representative in litigations and proceedings

asr-000872
01:11:00.160 --> 01:11:03.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: requiring the services of a lawyer.

asr-000873
01:11:03.160 --> 01:11:08.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: It implements the Philippine laws on the admission and stay of aliens within the territory

asr-000874
01:11:08.160 --> 01:11:14.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and provides free legal services to indigent and other qualified citizens.

asr-000875
01:11:15.160 --> 01:11:20.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: With its many responsibilities, the proposed budget is essential in ensuring

asr-000876
01:11:20.160 --> 01:11:26.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: that the DOJ and its attached agencies have the personnel, facilities, technology, and operational resources

asr-000877
01:11:26.160 --> 01:11:30.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: they need in order to effectively fulfill their respective mandates.

asr-000878
01:11:30.160 --> 01:11:37.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: This will allow the department to strengthen its services, improve the efficiency of case management and prosecution,

asr-000879
01:11:37.160 --> 01:11:42.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: modernize its systems, enhance our correctional and rehabilitation programs,

asr-000880
01:11:42.160 --> 01:11:45.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: continued access to legal assistance,

asr-000881
01:11:45.160 --> 01:11:51.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and strengthen its capacity to address emerging challenges in law enforcement and border security.

asr-000882
01:11:51.160 --> 01:11:56.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: This will ultimately translate into a justice system that is more accessible, efficient,

asr-000883
01:11:56.160 --> 01:11:59.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: meaningful, and responsive to the Filipino people.

asr-000884
01:11:59.160 --> 01:12:01.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

