asr-001797
01:57:32.740 --> 01:57:39.180
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: kasi kailangan po masertify nila na totoong may sakit yung isang individual, lalo na po yung ating PDL

asr-001798
01:57:39.180 --> 01:57:45.440
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: para po makapasok doon sa Executive Climacy na inaayos po ng ating Bureau of Correction.

asr-001799
01:57:45.780 --> 01:57:48.000
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-001800
01:57:48.220 --> 01:57:50.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, we understand.

asr-001801
01:57:50.920 --> 01:57:52.420
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Bago po ang leadership ngayon.

asr-001802
01:57:52.620 --> 01:57:56.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Department of Health at mahalaga na ipaalala sa kanila itong mga urgent matters na ito.

asr-001803
01:57:56.680 --> 01:58:02.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero just for the record, ganoon na po tayo katagal naghihintay sa firma ng Department of Health on this EO?

asr-001804
01:58:05.120 --> 01:58:08.480
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Last year pa po, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-001805
01:58:11.080 --> 01:58:17.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nakalulungkot, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, na last year pa pala dapat meron na tayong EO

asr-001806
01:58:17.340 --> 01:58:22.460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: para matulungan ang mga kababayan natin ng mga PDL sa nangangailangan.

asr-001807
01:58:22.620 --> 01:58:31.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nang window of service na ito, ng clemency, ng parol para sa kanilang health reasons

asr-001808
01:58:31.800 --> 01:58:33.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: or sa pagiging matanda na masyado.

asr-001809
01:58:34.600 --> 01:58:40.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero sa dulo, yung pa palang Department of Health na dapat nangangalaga sa kalusugan ng ating mga kababayan

asr-001810
01:58:41.180 --> 01:58:45.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ang walang ginagawa, ang dinededma ito.

asr-001811
01:58:45.120 --> 01:58:51.380
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano daw po ang dahilan na binigay ng DOH at dinededma nila ang napakahalagang EO na ito, Madam Speaker?

asr-001812
01:58:51.380 --> 01:58:52.380
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-001813
01:58:52.620 --> 01:59:05.920
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, we are not privy doon sa kung bakit po natatagalan on the part of the DOH.

asr-001814
01:59:06.780 --> 01:59:11.620
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ang nagagawa na lang po ng ating Bureau of Corrections is mag-follow up po ng mag-follow up.

asr-001815
01:59:12.300 --> 01:59:14.020
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-001816
01:59:15.760 --> 01:59:21.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Distinguished Sponsor, Madam Speaker, thank you very much for the very candid response of the agency on the matter.

asr-001817
01:59:21.920 --> 01:59:22.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero hindi.

asr-001818
01:59:22.620 --> 01:59:30.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Hindi po kasi tama na pinaghihintayin natin ng hindi lamang buwan kundi taon na yung ganitong napakahalagang polisiya.

asr-001819
01:59:30.780 --> 01:59:41.360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Still on this matter, paano po natin tinitiyak na ang ating mga mahihirap at indigent PDLs ay nabibigyan din ng pantay at mabilis na access sa ganitong medical interventions?

asr-001820
01:59:41.960 --> 01:59:47.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sigurado po ba tayo na hindi lang ito para sa mga may kakayahang kumuha ng private doctors?

asr-001824
02:00:00.740 --> 02:00:03.560
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-001825
02:00:04.560 --> 02:00:07.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: ang ginagawa po ng ating Bureau of Corrections,

asr-001826
02:00:07.280 --> 02:00:12.660
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: they are coordinating with hospitals that are willing to take in

asr-001827
02:00:12.660 --> 02:00:14.920
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: yung ating mga PDL na nangangailangan.

asr-001828
02:00:15.800 --> 02:00:21.680
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: For example, meron po silang coordination with East Avenue Medical Center.

asr-001829
02:00:22.340 --> 02:00:25.080
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Doon po nila dinadala, lalaan po sila ng pondo

asr-001830
02:00:25.080 --> 02:00:28.560
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: para po madala po yung ating mga PDL na nangangailangan ng medical care

asr-001831
02:00:28.560 --> 02:00:31.800
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: sa mga hospital katulad po ng East Avenue Medical Center.

asr-001832
02:00:32.940 --> 02:00:36.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maliban po sa East Avenue Medical Center, saan pa po yung iba pang mga facilities?

asr-001833
02:00:37.560 --> 02:00:38.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker.

asr-001834
02:00:47.060 --> 02:00:50.960
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Lahat po ng facilities naman daw po ay dinadalahan po nila.

asr-001835
02:00:52.040 --> 02:00:55.540
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: May mga LGU hospitals naman po silang kamowa,

asr-001836
02:00:55.540 --> 02:00:57.360
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: saan rin po nila dinadala.

asr-001837
02:00:57.360 --> 02:01:06.100
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: May mga times lang po siguro na dahil puno rin po siguro yung ating hospital,

asr-001838
02:01:06.340 --> 02:01:09.980
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: hindi po ma-accommodate, pero we know work out po ng ating Bureau of Corrections

asr-001839
02:01:09.980 --> 02:01:14.340
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: na madala po yung ating mga PDL sa tamang pangangalaga rin po

asr-001840
02:01:14.340 --> 02:01:16.320
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: ng ating mga medical professionals.

asr-001841
02:01:16.840 --> 02:01:18.360
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-001842
02:01:19.120 --> 02:01:21.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-001843
02:01:21.600 --> 02:01:24.700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: nakatutok ngayon ng publiko sa usapin ng medical releases

asr-001844
02:01:24.700 --> 02:01:26.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: dahil ginagamit ito ng ilang

asr-001849
02:01:27.360 --> 02:01:30.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: high-profile officials na may kasong plunder,

asr-001850
02:01:31.140 --> 02:01:34.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: paano po tindiyak ng DOJ na hindi maaabuso ang prosesong ito?

asr-001851
02:01:35.280 --> 02:01:38.360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano po ang mga safeguards o stringent monitoring mechanisms

asr-001852
02:01:38.900 --> 02:01:41.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na pwede ipatupad ng DOJ at Bucor tungkol dito?

asr-001853
02:01:42.100 --> 02:01:44.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-001854
02:02:17.130 --> 02:02:22.200
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-001855
02:02:22.200 --> 02:02:27.200
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: as of now, yung mga kilalang individual po kasi na tangkot or accused,

asr-001856
02:02:27.360 --> 02:02:30.340
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: ay nasa pangangalaga po ng BJMP.

asr-001857
02:02:31.600 --> 02:02:37.360
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Pero ang proseso daw po, as per sa ating DOJ,

asr-001858
02:02:37.760 --> 02:02:42.840
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: meron pong sariling medical examiner na nagkakondak para po sa BJMP

asr-001859
02:02:42.840 --> 02:02:50.480
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: para po masigurado or macertify na ito po yung estado or health status

asr-001860
02:02:50.480 --> 02:02:56.820
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: ng ating pong accused na sangkot sa ating pong investigation.

asr-001861
02:02:57.360 --> 02:03:01.120
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: And complaints, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-001862
02:03:01.520 --> 02:03:03.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-001863
02:03:03.180 --> 02:03:06.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: hindi po yung mga recently na nakasuhan yung nire-refer ko.

asr-001864
02:03:06.180 --> 02:03:09.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: May mga instances po in the past na nangyari ito.

asr-001865
02:03:10.100 --> 02:03:12.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: But let me just close by saying,

asr-001866
02:03:13.100 --> 02:03:17.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na usapin ang medical recognizance ay hindi dapat nakabatay sa pangalan,

asr-001867
02:03:17.460 --> 02:03:20.300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: posisyon o impluensya ng isang PDL.

asr-001868
02:03:20.880 --> 02:03:23.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang pamantayan ay dapat iisa lang para sa lahat.

asr-001869
02:03:24.220 --> 02:03:26.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Una, ang aktual na medical condition,

asr-001870
02:03:27.360 --> 02:03:29.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pangalaba, ang umiiral na batas.

asr-001871
02:03:29.960 --> 02:03:34.960
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pangatlo, ang pangangailangang pangalagaan ang karapatang pantao at due process.

asr-001872
02:03:35.680 --> 02:03:37.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya hinihiling po natin, Madam Speaker,

asr-001873
02:03:38.500 --> 02:03:42.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: sa Department of Justice, natiyaking ang anumang mekanismo

asr-001874
02:03:42.120 --> 02:03:47.060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: para sa medical recognizance, hospital confinement, or medical condition

asr-001875
02:03:47.060 --> 02:03:51.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ay malinaw, transparent, at pare-parehong pamantayan.

asr-001876
02:03:52.360 --> 02:03:57.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Dapat walang special treatment, dapat walang VIP lane.

asr-001877
02:03:57.360 --> 02:04:00.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-001878
02:04:00.480 --> 02:04:02.800
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you, Distinguished Colleague, Madam Speaker.

asr-001879
02:04:03.000 --> 02:04:07.920
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: They will comply with po sa ating mga requests rin po, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-001880
02:04:08.140 --> 02:04:08.520
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you po.

asr-001881
02:04:08.920 --> 02:04:09.420
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Salamat po.

asr-001882
02:04:09.780 --> 02:04:10.440
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

asr-001883
02:04:12.880 --> 02:04:15.520
Rep. Munir N. Arbison Jr.: Madam Speaker, move to suspended session for a few minutes.

asr-001884
02:04:15.720 --> 02:04:16.480
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Session is suspended.

asr-001887
02:04:57.360 --> 02:05:06.480
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Session is resumed.

asr-001888
02:05:07.300 --> 02:05:08.300
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

asr-001889
02:05:09.740 --> 02:05:14.280
Rep. Crispin Diego D. Remulla: Madam Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Edgar R. Erice

asr-001890
02:05:14.280 --> 02:05:18.780
Rep. Crispin Diego D. Remulla: from the 2nd District of Caloocan City to interpellate the said measure.

asr-001891
02:05:19.100 --> 02:05:22.420
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Edgar Erice is hereby recognized for his interpellation.

asr-001892
02:05:23.420 --> 02:05:25.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-001893
02:05:25.420 --> 02:05:27.100
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Thank you, Majority Leader.

asr-001894
02:05:27.360 --> 02:05:30.120
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: And to our Distinguished Sponsor, good morning.

asr-001895
02:05:30.480 --> 02:05:30.840
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Good morning.

asr-001896
02:05:31.380 --> 02:05:33.660
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: I have a very few questions.

asr-001897
02:05:34.900 --> 02:05:38.660
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: But this is all about the Bureau of Immigration.

asr-001898
02:05:41.600 --> 02:05:46.740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: And gusto ko lang po itanong yung tungkol dito sa biometric gates natin.

asr-001899
02:05:48.680 --> 02:05:53.480
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: May data po ako dito na for the last 4 years,

asr-001900
02:05:55.300 --> 02:05:57.120
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: kulang-kulang 4 billion na po.

asr-001901
02:05:57.120 --> 02:06:06.200
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung nagagagastos ng pamahalaan para sa purchase ng mga e-gates natin,

asr-001902
02:06:06.360 --> 02:06:07.700
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: including the cameras.

asr-001903
02:06:09.900 --> 02:06:12.600
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: And the Bureau of Immigration, confirm?

asr-001904
02:06:27.120 --> 02:06:36.740
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So, for the e-gates project po, yung total na kalaan pong pondo,

asr-001905
02:06:36.740 --> 02:06:40.080
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: for Phase 1, 1.5 billion.

asr-001906
02:06:41.140 --> 02:06:42.780
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Approximately, 1.5 billion.

asr-001907
02:06:42.880 --> 02:06:44.900
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 1.3 po ang Phase 2.

asr-001908
02:06:45.620 --> 02:06:51.600
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: And 536 million po ang Phase 3.

asr-001909
02:06:52.120 --> 02:06:53.740
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: More or less, mga...

asr-001912
02:06:57.120 --> 02:07:02.940
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: More than 2 billion na po yung nagagagastos po para po sa...

asr-001913
02:07:02.940 --> 02:07:07.560
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ang nagagagastos pa lang po talaga ay 1.528.

asr-001914
02:07:09.140 --> 02:07:11.080
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 869.957 billion po.

asr-001915
02:07:12.700 --> 02:07:14.120
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: There was a...

asr-001916
02:07:14.120 --> 02:07:19.780
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: How much is the total?

asr-001917
02:07:20.200 --> 02:07:24.040
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yung Phase 1 pa lang po yung nagagastos po.

asr-001918
02:07:24.040 --> 02:07:26.320
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker,

asr-001919
02:07:27.120 --> 02:07:34.120
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 1,528,869,957.

asr-001920
02:07:34.120 --> 02:07:39.440
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 1,528,869,957.

asr-001921
02:07:39.440 --> 02:07:45.360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: This includes e-gates, CCTV, and facial recognition monitoring?

asr-001922
02:07:46.100 --> 02:07:46.900
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes po.

asr-001923
02:07:46.900 --> 02:07:47.460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kasama lang po lahat to?

asr-001924
02:07:48.040 --> 02:07:49.440
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes po, Madam Speaker.

asr-001925
02:07:49.740 --> 02:07:51.460
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ito po yung Phase 1.

asr-001926
02:07:52.980 --> 02:07:54.340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ilang e-gates po ba ito?

asr-001927
02:07:54.940 --> 02:07:56.120
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yung Phase 1 po ay total of...

asr-001928
02:07:57.120 --> 02:07:59.060
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 47 e-gates po.

asr-001929
02:08:00.100 --> 02:08:04.880
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Distributed in Clark International Airport,

asr-001930
02:08:05.640 --> 02:08:07.220
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Mactan Cebu International Airport,

asr-001931
02:08:07.700 --> 02:08:09.100
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Davao International Airport,

asr-001932
02:08:09.300 --> 02:08:11.940
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and Bohol Panglao International Airport.

asr-001933
02:08:13.400 --> 02:08:14.560
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, 47 na po.

asr-001934
02:08:14.640 --> 02:08:16.660
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 47 po yung para sa...

asr-001935
02:08:16.660 --> 02:08:19.660
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: And the cost of the 47 e-gates is how much?

asr-001936
02:08:20.700 --> 02:08:21.440
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ito pong...

asr-001937
02:08:24.120 --> 02:08:27.100
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ito pong 1,500,000,000.

asr-001938
02:08:27.120 --> 02:08:30.320
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 128,869,957.

asr-001939
02:08:30.320 --> 02:08:31.240
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: This is Phase 1.

asr-001940
02:08:31.700 --> 02:08:32.580
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes po, Phase 1.

asr-001941
02:08:32.640 --> 02:08:33.740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung Phase 2 po, magkano po?

asr-001942
02:08:33.740 --> 02:08:38.980
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Phase 2 po ay 1.347,057 billion.

asr-001943
02:08:40.540 --> 02:08:41.100
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So...

asr-001944
02:08:41.100 --> 02:08:43.280
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 1,347,057,000.

asr-001945
02:08:43.280 --> 02:08:45.820
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: And how many e-gates po ito?

asr-001946
02:08:57.120 --> 02:09:18.020
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: We're just getting the figure po,

asr-001947
02:09:18.080 --> 02:09:19.700
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: this English colleague.

asr-001948
02:09:20.040 --> 02:09:21.900
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Medyo nagbago daw po kasi yung mga presyo.

asr-001949
02:09:22.640 --> 02:09:23.660
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pero nag-bid na po ito?

asr-001950
02:09:23.660 --> 02:09:24.540
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Hindi pa po.

asr-001951
02:09:25.460 --> 02:09:26.660
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: They are...

asr-001952
02:09:27.120 --> 02:09:29.100
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Undergoing procurement process pa lang po.

asr-001953
02:09:29.320 --> 02:09:30.840
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: September 14 lang po yung

asr-001954
02:09:30.840 --> 02:09:33.100
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: advertisement

asr-001955
02:09:33.100 --> 02:09:36.820
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: by the speaker and...

asr-001956
02:09:36.820 --> 02:09:38.840
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, hindi pa natin alam kung ilang units?

asr-001957
02:09:41.660 --> 02:09:44.960
