Rep. Javier Miguel Lopez Benitez: Madam Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Renee Louise M. Co of Kabataan Party-list to interpellate the proposed budget of the Department of Justice.

asr-002213-split-3
02:21:14.200 --> 02:21:19.250
