asr-002213-split-4
02:21:19.250 --> 02:21:26.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Madam Speaker, and good afternoon to the distinguished sponsor and the Department of Justice.

asr-002214
02:21:26.040 --> 02:21:37.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Will the gentleman yield to a couple of questions in relation to the budget and the policies by which the budget will be anchored on of the Department of Justice?

asr-002215
02:21:38.000 --> 02:21:39.020
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-002216
02:21:39.440 --> 02:21:40.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-002217
02:21:41.160 --> 02:21:48.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, tungkol po ito sa ang unang line of questioning natin, yung nasimula na natin noong budget briefing,

asr-002218
02:21:48.700 --> 02:21:56.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung tungkol po sa pag-transfer ng mga persons deprived of liberty ng

asr-002219
02:21:56.840 --> 02:21:58.910
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: New Bilibid Prison.

asr-002220
02:21:58.910 --> 02:22:06.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pwede po bang matanong na ilan ang current number of PDLs sa buong Pilipinas ang nasa Bucor?

asr-002221
02:22:07.020 --> 02:22:10.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ilan ang nababawas at nadaragdag ng mga PDLs annually?

asr-002222
02:22:26.880 --> 02:22:44.120
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: As of July 31, 2026, the PDL population is at 52,356.

asr-002223
02:22:45.800 --> 02:22:49.320
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ang narirelease po kada taon ay it varies.

asr-002224
02:22:50.260 --> 02:22:54.120
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So as for 2025 po, ang naririlis po ay...

asr-002226
02:22:59.600 --> 02:23:21.750
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 10,529. For the first half nitong taong ito, 4,979 po ang na-release. Ang na-admit po for 2025, 9,948. Ang na-admit rin po for 2026, this first half ng taon, ay 4,549.

asr-002227
02:23:24.990 --> 02:23:32.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So tama po ba? Parang halos equal or magkapantay yung pagdagdag at pagbawas ng mga PDLs sa New Bilibid Prison?

asr-002228
02:23:32.860 --> 02:23:39.180
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Halos magkapantay po. Looking at from 2022 to 2026, halos parehas.

asr-002229
02:23:39.180 --> 02:23:48.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung bang makahingi, Madam Speaker, good sponsor ng datos na ito, kung maari ay mag-span po siya ng pano,

asr-002230
02:23:48.180 --> 02:23:53.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: paano, ilan ang nababawas sa dagdagdag sa New Bilibid Prison in the past five years?

asr-002231
02:23:54.820 --> 02:23:58.780
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Okay. Yes, Madam Speaker. We will provide the data.

asr-002232
02:23:59.620 --> 02:24:04.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maraming salamat po. Yung unang mga tanong po natin kasi sa budget briefing ay,

asr-002233
02:24:04.360 --> 02:24:18.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yun nga po, paano yung pinaplano na pagkaroon ng pag-transfer ng mga PDLs given na may mga ibang planong gustong gawin?

asr-002234
02:24:18.180 --> 02:24:19.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Dito sa New Bilibid Prison.

asr-002235
02:24:20.180 --> 02:24:24.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But following up on my line of inquiry during the committee-level deliberations,

asr-002236
02:24:24.980 --> 02:24:30.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pwede po bang matanong if the BUCOR has a decongestion strategy or a master plan

asr-002237
02:24:30.420 --> 02:24:37.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: given yung mass transfer of PDLs from the New Bilibid Prison to the penal colonies?

asr-002238
02:24:41.160 --> 02:24:45.260
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: There is a master plan up to 2028.

asr-002239
02:24:46.020 --> 02:24:48.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So inaasahan po natin some 53.

asr-002240
02:24:48.180 --> 02:24:57.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 6,000 ay more or less makakompleto na yung pag-transfer by two years from now?

asr-002241
02:24:58.100 --> 02:24:59.180
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes, because...

asr-002242
02:25:00.540 --> 02:25:12.500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes, because magkaklose na nga po yung New Bilibid Prison, Madam Speaker, this is surely...

asr-002243
02:25:12.500 --> 02:25:16.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maaaring rin po bang ma-furnish ang representation na ito ng master plan?

asr-002244
02:25:18.180 --> 02:25:25.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa pinagbabatayan, timeline, at kung ano man, para po maisagawa yung mass transfer na ito?

asr-002245
02:25:25.560 --> 02:25:27.680
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes, Madam Speaker, we will comply po.

asr-002246
02:25:29.020 --> 02:25:35.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May I ask kung gaano po kadalas na si-check ng Department of Justice or yung BUCOR,

asr-002247
02:25:35.780 --> 02:25:44.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung pagsunod doon sa master plan na nakalaan para po sa mass transfer?

asr-002248
02:25:48.180 --> 02:26:02.940
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So, they're guided by the master plan.

asr-002249
02:26:03.940 --> 02:26:11.640
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yun po po yung goal po nila from 30,000 sa NBP, nabababa po nila ng 20,000.

asr-002250
02:26:11.640 --> 02:26:13.640
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: They are looking at...

asr-002251
02:26:13.640 --> 02:26:15.640
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Maaaring...

asr-002252
02:26:16.300 --> 02:26:17.640
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yung momentum po for...

asr-002253
02:26:18.180 --> 02:26:29.200
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: And pursuing the decongestion rate na ideal ay patuloy na hindi implementan naman po ng ating Bureau of Corrections.

asr-002254
02:26:29.600 --> 02:26:33.480
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yung master plan po yung naging guide nila sa pag-transfer,

asr-002255
02:26:33.480 --> 02:26:43.360
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: kung saan po dadalhin yung ating PDL at yung decongestion rate po ay doon rin po naka-alitsunod.

asr-002256
02:26:44.060 --> 02:26:46.760
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, this is Gish Coli.

asr-002257
02:26:47.660 --> 02:26:48.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker,

asr-002258
02:26:48.180 --> 02:26:48.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: good sponsor.

asr-002259
02:26:49.480 --> 02:26:54.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Napansin natin na sa budget ng Department of Justice,

asr-002260
02:26:54.980 --> 02:27:00.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: meron pong nakalaan na 519 million na capital outlay for BUCOR.

asr-002261
02:27:01.500 --> 02:27:09.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Magkano po dito ay para sa construction or rehabilitation of penal colonies and correctional facilities outside of NCR?

asr-002262
02:27:10.420 --> 02:27:11.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron po ba?

asr-002263
02:27:12.940 --> 02:27:14.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Or nakatayo na po ba ito?

asr-002264
02:27:14.280 --> 02:27:14.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So,

asr-002265
02:27:14.900 --> 02:27:16.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: so,

asr-002266
02:27:18.180 --> 02:27:19.180
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: ,

asr-002267
02:27:19.180 --> 02:27:27.460
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: roughly about 474 million po yung nakalaan para sa pagpapagawa po ng ating Bureau of Correction Facility.

asr-002268
02:27:27.800 --> 02:27:31.040
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Nakalaan po ito sa Nueva Ecija po.

asr-002269
02:27:31.040 --> 02:27:38.220
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Kasi doon po plano, ilagay po yung ating bagong Bureau of Correction Facility.

asr-002270
02:27:38.720 --> 02:27:40.360
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, this is Gish Coli.

asr-002271
02:27:40.760 --> 02:27:47.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At tama po na itatayo pa lang ito kung magtuloy-tuloy yung pag-uusap natin.

asr-002272
02:27:48.180 --> 02:27:51.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At maigrat po ito sa Department of Justice.

asr-002273
02:27:51.520 --> 02:27:53.440
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Itatayo pa lang po ito, Madam Speaker.

asr-002274
02:27:53.900 --> 02:28:01.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kailan po yung target completion date nitong new penal colony sa Nueva Ecija?

asr-002275
02:28:03.040 --> 02:28:09.000
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Hopefully po next year, may tayo na po itong facility na ito, Madam Speaker, at this is Gish Coli.

asr-002276
02:28:09.660 --> 02:28:18.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Inaasahan din po natin, gaya po ng sinabi sa committee, na maging up to standards ang lahat ng mga facilities at services.

asr-002277
02:28:18.180 --> 02:28:24.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na itatayo dito sa bagong penal colony sa Nueva Ecija.

asr-002278
02:28:25.040 --> 02:28:32.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero kailangan lang po natin i-check dahil po kung ang target completion, at sana hindi madelay, ay next year.

asr-002279
02:28:32.880 --> 02:28:40.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero may target na matapos yung pag-mass transfer by 2028,

asr-002280
02:28:40.360 --> 02:28:45.720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi po sana either maantala o magkaroon ng iba't ibang arrangements.

asr-002281
02:28:46.180 --> 02:28:48.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung saan, habang tinatayo,

asr-002282
02:28:48.180 --> 02:29:01.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pa yung Nueva Ecija penal colony ay baka ma-transfer sa ibang mga detention facilities ang mga dapat i-a-assign doon sa Nueva Ecija.

asr-002283
02:29:01.340 --> 02:29:12.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maybe can I get a guarantee from the Bureau of Corrections na kung ano man po yung pupuntahang mga destinasyon ng mga PDLs,

asr-002284
02:29:12.860 --> 02:29:17.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: gaya po ng sinabi sa committee level meeting, malapit sa pamilya.

asr-002285
02:29:18.180 --> 02:29:30.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hindi matatransfer ka sa kung saang penal colony nang walang paalam sa kanilang mga pamilya ng mga lawyers at lahat ng mga tumutulong sa mga kaso nila.

asr-002286
02:29:31.100 --> 02:29:32.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-002287
02:29:33.040 --> 02:29:44.500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes, Madam Speaker, the Bureau of Corrections guarantee na as much as possible kung saan po malapit yung pamilya ng PDL, doon po siya maidadala.

asr-002288
02:29:44.900 --> 02:29:46.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At sana po.

asr-002289
02:29:48.180 --> 02:29:59.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang pagbabago or update tungkol sa kung saan siya, ang isang PDL mapunta, ay ito po ay mapapaalam sa ating pamilya, sa kanilang mga lawyers at hindi mabibigla.

asr-002290
02:30:00.000 --> 02:30:02.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na nawala na lang po sila doon sa penal colony.

asr-002291
02:30:02.840 --> 02:30:06.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I assume, and I assume the B Corp is aware of this,

asr-002292
02:30:06.240 --> 02:30:09.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sensitibo din po yung hinahawak nilang matter.

asr-002293
02:30:10.100 --> 02:30:15.120
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes, we, the Bureau of Corrections guarantee po na ipapaalam rin po ito

asr-002294
02:30:15.120 --> 02:30:18.480
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: kung sakaling dumating po sa ganong punto.

asr-002295
02:30:19.340 --> 02:30:20.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-002296
02:30:20.720 --> 02:30:23.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: mangingina lang po ang representasyon na ito

asr-002297
02:30:23.200 --> 02:30:28.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng listahan ng balak ng B Corp

asr-002298
02:30:28.960 --> 02:30:34.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na magtayo or magpaayos ng penal colonies and correctional facilities

asr-002299
02:30:34.360 --> 02:30:37.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na pupuntahan ng iba't-ibang mga PDLs.

asr-002300
02:30:37.340 --> 02:30:40.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Can that be accomplished by next week, Madam Speaker, good sponsor?

asr-002301
02:30:41.460 --> 02:30:44.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-002302
02:30:44.680 --> 02:30:46.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay, maraming salamat po.

asr-002303
02:30:46.740 --> 02:30:49.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pupunta na ba po ako sa susunod na mga katanungan?

asr-002304
02:30:50.360 --> 02:30:54.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ito rin po ay follow-up doon sa tanong natin sa committee-level briefings

asr-002305
