asr-002307
02:31:03.760 --> 02:31:06.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: o pinamumunuan ng Department of Justice.

asr-002308
02:31:07.060 --> 02:31:08.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Can I confirm this?

asr-002309
02:31:08.540 --> 02:31:11.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Once again, on the floor, Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-002313
02:31:28.960 --> 02:31:55.600
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: There is no special task force under the DOJ po

asr-002314
02:31:55.600 --> 02:31:58.780
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: na regarding sa anti-terrorism.

asr-002315
02:31:58.960 --> 02:32:02.320
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: It falls under kung ano po yung General Commission of Crimes

asr-002316
02:32:02.320 --> 02:32:04.400
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: yung pag-investigate po dito.

asr-002317
02:32:05.000 --> 02:32:07.040
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Pero sila po ay miyembro ng

asr-002318
02:32:07.040 --> 02:32:16.180
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: regular member lang po sila ng Anti-Terrorism Council,

asr-002319
02:32:16.320 --> 02:32:17.840
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-002320
02:32:18.900 --> 02:32:21.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung nabanggit po natin na anecdote

asr-002321
02:32:21.840 --> 02:32:24.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung saan gusto natin manghingi ng explanation

asr-002322
02:32:24.820 --> 02:32:27.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa Department of Justice

asr-002323
02:32:27.040 --> 02:32:28.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay meron pong mga agents

asr-002324
