asr-002921
02:59:17.080 --> 02:59:18.800
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: dahil po dun sa...

asr-002922
02:59:19.400 --> 02:59:23.520
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: iba pong appointment ay kailangan ng presidential appointment.

asr-002923
02:59:24.860 --> 02:59:27.040
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Usually po, umabot ng isang taon.

asr-002924
02:59:27.180 --> 02:59:30.000
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Pero alam ko, from the DOJ themselves,

asr-002925
02:59:30.580 --> 02:59:33.900
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: medyo napapababa na po ng 4 to 5 months, 4 to 6 months,

asr-002926
02:59:34.460 --> 02:59:36.500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: yung pag-appoint po ng prosecutors.

asr-002927
02:59:38.280 --> 02:59:40.740
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yung iba naman po, lalo na po yung mga support staff,

asr-002928
02:59:41.080 --> 02:59:44.260
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: usually sa Secretary of Justice naman na po,

asr-002929
02:59:44.740 --> 02:59:45.840
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: dumadaan yung pag-appoint.

asr-002930
02:59:46.680 --> 02:59:49.380
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Pero malaki po yung pangailangan po para po sa ating...

asr-002931
02:59:49.400 --> 02:59:51.940
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: ating pong mga dagdag na prosecutors.

asr-002932
02:59:52.180 --> 02:59:57.200
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Kasi may ideal number po ang DOJ na at least sana po mapunan

asr-002933
02:59:57.200 --> 03:00:00.150
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: para po mas mabilis po yung pag-dispense ng ating pong mga kaso.

asr-002934
03:00:00.300 --> 03:00:21.680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Based on the CPBRD report, Distinguished Colleague, DOJ is projected to have 7,140 unfilled positions in 2027, including 1,740 in OSEC. Ano po ba ang target natin ngayon para ma-fill yung gap?

asr-002935
03:00:25.060 --> 03:00:26.960
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Actually, yun po yung kulang na ngayon.

asr-002936
03:00:26.960 --> 03:00:33.760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi this is substantial po eh. And this will definitely affect yung disposition of cases.

asr-002937
03:00:34.700 --> 03:00:40.960
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yun po yung hinihintay po yung karamihan po is pending presidential appointment.

asr-002938
03:00:41.380 --> 03:00:49.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ilan po ba ang pending due to the presidential appointment? Ilan ang pending dahil sa budgetary concerns?

asr-002939
03:00:56.960 --> 03:01:11.540
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: As of now po yung hinihintay po na appointment is 203 po na prosecutorial positions.

asr-002940
03:01:11.540 --> 03:01:12.540
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: As for...

asr-002941
03:01:19.540 --> 03:01:25.540
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: As for kung ano po yung ine-expect nila na additional positions po para...

asr-002942
03:01:26.960 --> 03:01:36.560
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Dumabi po yung ating mga prosecutors, as for 2026, 237 po. Hopefully yung madagdagan.

asr-002943
03:01:39.000 --> 03:01:45.380
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 2027, 227 and 2028, 237 prosecutorial positions.

asr-002944
03:01:45.800 --> 03:01:55.020
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yung iba pong delay sa pag-fill po ng ating mga positions, yung iba po ay dahil po sa approval naman po ng Civil Service Commission.

asr-002945
03:01:55.840 --> 03:01:56.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Of the 7,000...

asr-002946
03:01:56.960 --> 03:02:00.340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Of the 7,140 unfilled positions, ilan po ba dun ang prosecutorial?

asr-002947
03:02:20.300 --> 03:02:24.660
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 866 po yung unfilled prosecutors.

asr-002948
03:02:24.660 --> 03:02:28.700
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 866 po yung unfilled prosecutors dun sa 7,140 na unfilled.

asr-002949
03:02:30.700 --> 03:02:36.020
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And we are expecting 237 will be filled by 2027.

asr-002950
03:02:37.100 --> 03:02:40.320
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Additional 227 only.

asr-002951
03:02:40.320 --> 03:02:45.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So that still leaves us with a substantial amount of around 600 plus.

asr-002952
03:02:47.680 --> 03:02:50.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And ang problema po dun is mostly budgetary?

asr-002953
03:02:50.580 --> 03:02:53.760
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-002954
03:02:54.660 --> 03:02:56.260
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Adding to the...

asr-002956
03:03:08.460 --> 03:03:13.940
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yung budgetary constraints po rin po yung main problem po ng ating DOJ.

asr-002957
03:03:15.900 --> 03:03:19.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues.

asr-002958
03:03:21.380 --> 03:03:24.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: The DOJ has approximately...

asr-002959
03:03:24.660 --> 03:03:33.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: P15.3 billion in accumulated earmarked revenues, revenue balances, as of December 31, 2025.

asr-002960
03:03:37.080 --> 03:03:41.940
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pero hindi po ba pwedeng gamitin yung earmarked revenue?

asr-002961
03:03:45.160 --> 03:03:47.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Para dun sa mga kakulangan natin sa funding?

asr-002962
03:03:49.160 --> 03:03:51.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Or are these mostly...

asr-002963
03:03:52.370 --> 03:03:55.710
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Is this earmarked revenue including attached agencies po ba?

asr-002967
03:03:58.100 --> 03:04:00.100
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: The DOJ cannot use that.

asr-002968
03:04:00.260 --> 03:04:09.820
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: There are specific limitations per attached agency as to the allowed spending of that revenue po.

asr-002969
03:04:09.820 --> 03:04:14.120
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Lalo na po yung sa LRA, OSG, and...

asr-002970
03:04:14.120 --> 03:04:15.540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: How about yung non-tax revenues?

asr-003007
03:04:24.500 --> 03:04:28.760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Meron tayong P17.381 billion in non-tax collection.

asr-003008
03:04:30.640 --> 03:04:31.840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can't we use that?

asr-003009
03:04:37.420 --> 03:04:44.740
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Meron na pong limitasyon yung sa paggamit yung non-tax revenues po.

asr-003010
03:04:54.500 --> 03:04:58.800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ano yung... saan po natin siya...

asr-003011
03:04:58.800 --> 03:05:00.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: What is its intended use?

asr-003015
03:05:11.530 --> 03:05:15.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Sa Victim's Compensation Program po.

asr-003016
03:05:15.160 --> 03:05:17.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ah, so only for the Victim's Compensation?

asr-003017
03:05:17.640 --> 03:05:18.640
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes po.

asr-003018
03:05:18.640 --> 03:05:23.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, yan yung off-budget?

asr-003020
03:05:24.360 --> 03:05:25.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Na sinasabi?

asr-003021
03:05:25.360 --> 03:05:26.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yung off-budget?

asr-003023
03:05:27.360 --> 03:05:28.360
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker.

asr-003024
03:05:28.360 --> 03:05:34.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, off-budget specifically for awards to victims of unjust imprisonment or detention?

asr-003025
03:05:34.360 --> 03:05:37.360
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-003026
03:05:37.360 --> 03:05:43.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: In 2025 po, you had... ganung kalaki yung nakulekta natin?

asr-003027
03:05:43.360 --> 03:05:44.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: 17 billion ba?

asr-003028
03:05:44.360 --> 03:05:45.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yeah.

asr-003029
03:05:45.360 --> 03:05:48.360
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Including attached agencies po.

asr-003030
03:05:48.360 --> 03:05:49.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: No, no.

asr-003031
03:05:49.360 --> 03:05:52.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: How much is the total amount para dun sa... na nakulekta?

asr-003032
03:05:52.500 --> 03:05:53.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: As of now?

asr-003033
03:05:53.500 --> 03:05:55.500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yung off-budget account lang.

asr-003034
03:05:55.500 --> 03:05:56.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yung off-budget account lang.

asr-003035
03:05:56.500 --> 03:06:01.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yung for awards to victims of unjust imprisonment and detention.

asr-003036
03:06:01.500 --> 03:06:08.500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: As for... may I clarify if it's including all the attached agencies under the DOJ?

asr-003037
03:06:08.500 --> 03:06:09.500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Because...

asr-003038
03:06:09.500 --> 03:06:10.500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes.

asr-003039
03:06:10.500 --> 03:06:11.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yes.

asr-003049
03:06:20.500 --> 03:06:21.500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes.

asr-003052
03:06:23.510 --> 03:06:26.250
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ito ba yung 187?

asr-003053
03:06:29.000 --> 03:06:33.500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Kasi ang income po ay totaling... 2025 income po ay 17 million.

asr-003054
03:06:33.500 --> 03:06:50.500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: As per records po ng ating po department of DOJ, ng Department of Justice, 17,810,728 po yung actual income ng buong DOJ including the attached agencies.

asr-003055
03:06:50.500 --> 03:07:01.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: The BSF table in draft reports, ang nakalagay po doon in receipts and ang resibo na natanggap is 187.937 million.

asr-003056
03:07:02.840 --> 03:07:03.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Is that correct?

asr-003057
03:07:04.880 --> 03:07:05.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: As of 2025?

asr-003058
03:07:13.020 --> 03:07:16.700
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pero yung reported expenditure was only 19.3.

asr-003081
03:07:20.760 --> 03:07:24.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: May I ask why the utilization is so low?

asr-003082
03:07:28.500 --> 03:07:33.940
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: May we clarify, ano po yung 187?

asr-003083
03:07:34.260 --> 03:07:38.420
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ito yung off-budget account for awards to victims of unjust imprisonment.

asr-003086
03:07:52.500 --> 03:07:59.970
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: As per records po ng DOJ, ang non-tax revenue lang po talaga ay...

asr-003087
03:07:59.970 --> 03:08:10.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Hindi, meron kayong off-budget account based on the BSF for awards to victims of unjust imprisonment.

asr-003088
03:08:10.660 --> 03:08:21.240
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Based on yung 2025 data po, 187 million in receipts. Tapos 19.3 ang nagastos.

asr-003089
03:08:40.660 --> 03:08:55.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So my question is, why is the utilization so low? Is the problem lack of awareness, restrictive requirements, processing delays, or simply a low number of qualified claims?

asr-003090
03:08:55.860 --> 03:09:05.660
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: It depends on kung mag-claim po yung aplikante. And as you know, yung batas po natin regarding victims' compensation,

asr-003091
03:09:06.180 --> 03:09:09.860
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: yung amount po dun is limited pa rin po to 1,000 per...

asr-003092
03:09:10.660 --> 03:09:13.260
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: month? 10,000?

asr-003093
03:09:15.680 --> 03:09:16.660
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So basically...

asr-003094
03:09:17.680 --> 03:09:21.380
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Medyo maliit pa po. There is a need to update the Victims' Compensation Program.

asr-003095
03:09:23.700 --> 03:09:26.760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: When was this last updated, Distinguished Sponsor?

asr-003097
03:09:33.900 --> 03:09:40.640
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Last, ito pong batas na kung saan pinagbabasahan po natin itong Victims' Compensation Program ay 1992 pa po.

asr-003098
03:09:40.660 --> 03:09:45.660
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 34 years na po ang nakalipas. Kaya yung amounts...

asr-003099
03:09:46.240 --> 03:09:50.120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So ang binibigay pagka ikaw ay unjustly nakulong...

asr-003100
03:09:50.120 --> 03:09:51.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ganon pa rin po yung amount na...

asr-003101
03:09:51.500 --> 03:09:52.320
Rep. Roberto Nazal: 1,000 a month.

asr-003102
03:09:54.080 --> 03:09:55.300
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 10,000 a month.

asr-003103
03:09:55.980 --> 03:09:56.700
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: 1,000?

asr-003105
03:09:58.880 --> 03:10:00.580
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: One time 10,000 po.

asr-003106
03:10:00.700 --> 03:10:02.420
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: One time na 10,000?

asr-003107
03:10:05.180 --> 03:10:06.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tawawa naman po ba lang?

asr-003108
03:10:06.960 --> 03:10:08.980
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: That's why there is a need to update, dalo po.

asr-003109
03:10:08.980 --> 03:10:09.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So...

asr-003110
03:10:09.780 --> 03:10:09.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So this is...

asr-003111
03:10:10.660 --> 03:10:12.940
Rep. Roberto Nazal: This should be updated by Congress or...

asr-003113
03:10:14.000 --> 03:10:19.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can't it be initially po adjusted through a department order or an executive order?

asr-003114
03:10:19.340 --> 03:10:21.900
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: By law po, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003115
03:10:22.460 --> 03:10:25.820
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So hopefully po, ma-adjust na po itong amount na ito.

asr-003116
03:10:25.820 --> 03:10:28.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So Distinguished Sponsor, dapat po ayusin na natin ito.

asr-003117
03:10:28.820 --> 03:10:31.140
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kaya tawawa naman yung mga biktima.

asr-003118
03:10:31.680 --> 03:10:35.000
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: We're willing to work with your office po, Distinguished Colleague, Madam Speaker.

asr-003119
03:10:35.620 --> 03:10:39.540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Sige po. So this is one thing that we should take note of, we should adjust.

asr-003120
03:10:39.780 --> 03:10:40.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yes.

asr-003121
03:10:40.660 --> 03:10:41.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I-update na po natin yung batas.

asr-003122
03:10:44.260 --> 03:10:49.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: How about data po on overstaying prisoners?

asr-003123
03:10:51.000 --> 03:10:52.540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Meron po ba tayong data on that?

asr-003124
03:10:59.540 --> 03:11:05.540
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: No data and no overstaying data on...

asr-003125
03:11:05.540 --> 03:11:09.540
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Sa pagkakasabi po na atin pong Bureau of Corrections...

asr-003126
03:11:09.540 --> 03:11:13.400
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: There's no data because wala na rin pong overstaying.

asr-003127
03:11:13.800 --> 03:11:18.120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So lahat po ng supposed na overstaying ay napakawala na?

asr-003128
03:11:18.500 --> 03:11:32.540
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Everyone due to be released has been released naman daw po as per our DOJ and our Bureau of Corrections.

asr-003129
03:11:32.540 --> 03:11:35.420
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Do we have that data? Can you share that with the...

asr-003130
03:11:35.420 --> 03:11:39.520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: At least the reports on sino po yung mga overstaying, gano'ng katagal.

asr-003131
03:11:39.540 --> 03:11:41.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Na silang overstaying and then when were they released?

asr-003132
03:11:42.620 --> 03:11:46.080
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes. Madam Speaker, we will submit the data.

asr-003133
03:11:51.500 --> 03:11:56.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: On the Bucor, balik po tayo sa Bucor, Distinguished Sponsor, Madam Speaker.

asr-003134
03:11:57.400 --> 03:12:07.120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Bucor's authorized uniform positions increased from 9,133 in 2025 to 11,133 in 2027.

asr-003135
03:12:07.120 --> 03:12:09.120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But the staffing summaries...

asr-003136
03:12:09.540 --> 03:12:13.760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: It still shows only 8,464 field positions.

asr-003137
03:12:15.300 --> 03:12:21.280
Rep. Roberto Nazal: May I ask, Distinguished Sponsor, what is preventing Bucor from filling these positions?

asr-003138
03:12:21.280 --> 03:12:26.560
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Is it recruitment, training capacity, funding, or administrative processing?

asr-003139
03:12:27.700 --> 03:12:34.280
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, for the reasons kung bakit hindi pa field itong mga posisyon nito,

asr-003140
03:12:35.300 --> 03:12:39.280
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: it is primarily attributable to the additional...

asr-003141
03:12:39.540 --> 03:12:44.140
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Positions created pursuant to DBM-approved restructuring of the Bureau,

asr-003142
03:12:44.680 --> 03:12:47.720
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: including 1,000 new positions for correction officers.

asr-003143
03:12:48.720 --> 03:12:51.340
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: To facilitate the filling of these positions,

asr-003144
03:12:52.360 --> 03:12:59.860
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: the Bureau has requested the approval of a 3-year CSE-approved qualification standards for correction officers.

asr-003145
03:13:00.580 --> 03:13:05.680
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So ito pong qualification standards ay under review pa po ng ating pong CSE office.

asr-003146
03:13:06.200 --> 03:13:09.500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: In the meantime po, yung other vacancies naman,

asr-003147
03:13:09.540 --> 03:13:13.880
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: po ay na-address through recruitment and appointment ng processes.

asr-003148
03:13:15.360 --> 03:13:23.700
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Medyo lumaki lang po dahil po dito sa 1,000 new positions na na-restructure po na ating pong DBM.

asr-003149
03:13:24.200 --> 03:13:26.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you for that, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-003150
03:13:27.660 --> 03:13:29.320
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Let me go to my next question.

asr-003151
03:13:29.320 --> 03:13:39.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: In 2025, 33.9% of the 404,124 cases, decided cases, were dismissed by the trial.

asr-003152
03:13:39.540 --> 03:13:42.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: This is a substantial number.

asr-003153
03:13:43.420 --> 03:13:46.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: What are the major causes of these dismissals?

asr-003154
03:13:46.800 --> 03:13:53.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Insufficient evidence, witness problems, weaknesses in investigation, procedural issues, or something else?

asr-003155
03:13:54.560 --> 03:14:01.540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: What additional resources or reforms does the National Prosecution Service need to reduce avoidable dismissals

asr-003156
03:14:01.540 --> 03:14:04.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: and strengthen the cases brought before the courts?

asr-003157
03:14:09.540 --> 03:14:21.900
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So, there are a number of reasons kung bakit po nadidismiss ng RTC.

asr-003158
03:14:24.960 --> 03:14:34.040
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ang commitment po ng DOJ is that yung standard po na-impose po sa kanila,

asr-003159
03:14:34.320 --> 03:14:39.160
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: yung reasonable certainty of conviction na standard,

asr-003160
03:14:39.300 --> 03:14:39.400
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: yun po na-impose po sa kanila.

asr-003162
03:14:39.520 --> 03:14:46.260
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: At yung reasonable certainty po yung susundan nila para po maiwasan yung pag-dismiss po ng ating mga kaso sa Regional Trial Court.

