04:19:45.440 --> 04:19:49.520
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: They'll valsh because it would affect investigation of other activities rin po.

asr-004250
04:19:49.520 --> 04:19:50.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, okay.

asr-004251
04:19:50.060 --> 04:19:50.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So,

asr-004252
04:19:51.320 --> 04:20:00.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, noted po yung mga sagot niyo and then that informs our position and strengthens our position

asr-004253
04:20:00.020 --> 04:20:09.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: on the excesses in appropriations and use of confidential funds.

asr-004254
04:20:11.540 --> 04:20:16.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: But let me move on kasi pa maubos po ang oras natin.

asr-004255
04:20:16.800 --> 04:20:18.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I want to move on to the...

asr-004256
04:20:18.380 --> 04:20:21.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you po for answering questions.

asr-004257
04:20:21.320 --> 04:20:28.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Regarding the confidential expenses, nanatili yung posisyon natin na pambihira po ang paglobo ng confidential funds

asr-004258
04:20:28.460 --> 04:20:30.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: mula nung panahon ni...

asr-004259
04:20:30.840 --> 04:20:31.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng dating...

asr-004260
04:20:31.660 --> 04:20:38.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng nakarang administrasyon, pinagpatuloy at lalo pang dinagdagan ng Marcos Jr. Administration.

asr-004261
04:20:39.000 --> 04:20:39.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-004262
04:20:39.640 --> 04:20:50.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At sa ang paniniwala natin, the objectives of these funds may be accomplished without necessarily...

asr-004263
04:20:50.320 --> 04:20:51.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: without necessarily...

asr-004264
04:20:51.160 --> 04:20:51.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: without necessarily...

asr-004265
04:20:51.320 --> 04:20:53.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: giving it blanket confidentiality.

asr-004266
04:20:54.560 --> 04:21:00.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pinapakita ng nangyari sa Office of the Vice President kung gaano kadali ang pag-abuso nito.

asr-004267
04:21:00.780 --> 04:21:00.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-004268
04:21:01.600 --> 04:21:11.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Anyway, let me move on to the PCGG na attached agency po ng DOJ.

asr-004269
04:21:12.680 --> 04:21:20.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At alam po natin ang tanging mandato ng PCGG, Recovery of Marcos Ilgatenwell.

asr-004270
04:21:20.320 --> 04:21:21.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po?

asr-004271
04:21:21.940 --> 04:21:23.660
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Tama po, Madam Speaker.

asr-004272
04:21:23.960 --> 04:21:31.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At recently, of course, nagkaroon po ng ruling ang Sandigang Bayan.

asr-004273
04:21:34.140 --> 04:21:35.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sandigang Bayan po, no?

asr-004274
04:21:35.580 --> 04:21:42.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nagkaroon ng ruling ang Sandigang Bayan in the civil case number 0141.

asr-004275
04:21:43.260 --> 04:21:50.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: This is an omnibus civil case filed way back in 1991 by the PCG.

asr-004276
04:21:50.320 --> 04:21:59.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For the recovery of numerous properties from the Marcos family.

asr-004277
04:22:00.760 --> 04:22:05.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In fact, may mga partial na nabawi na, significant.

asr-004278
04:22:06.560 --> 04:22:17.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Like the Swiss bank deposits worth $658 million, the Arelma accounts, the jewelry, the famous jewelry collection,

asr-004279
04:22:18.440 --> 04:22:20.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at saka a number of...

asr-004280
04:22:20.160 --> 04:22:22.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: A number of paintings, and so on.

asr-004281
04:22:22.160 --> 04:22:24.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bahagi yun ang civil case na ito.

asr-004282
04:22:25.260 --> 04:22:35.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero recently po, ay may decision na i-dismiss to, at actually, yung gobyerno pa.

asr-004283
04:22:36.040 --> 04:22:37.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang nagsabi, pwede ba i-dismiss na natin?

asr-004284
04:22:38.540 --> 04:22:42.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Or hindi na namin i-pro-prosecute ang kaso?

asr-004285
04:22:43.200 --> 04:22:43.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

asr-004286
04:22:44.080 --> 04:22:46.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At pwedeng ipaliwanag kung anong nangyari dito?

asr-004287
04:22:46.320 --> 04:22:48.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Anong nangyari dito?

asr-004288
04:22:50.160 --> 04:23:20.140
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: The PCGG was required to manifest kung gusto pang magpresenta ng ebidensya for the rest of the assets po na alleged po doon sa complaint. So again, ang PCGG ay nag-manifest na...

asr-004290
04:23:22.880 --> 04:23:32.400
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: They manifested that they will still present evidence po.

asr-004291
04:23:33.360 --> 04:23:36.940
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: They will not present any evidence po.

asr-004292
04:23:37.340 --> 04:23:41.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Yun nga. Dahil nag-manifest ng PCGG,

asr-004293
04:23:42.120 --> 04:23:43.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi na sila makakapag...

asr-004294
04:23:43.180 --> 04:23:45.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: They will no longer present evidence.

asr-004295
04:23:46.060 --> 04:23:47.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The case was dismissed.

asr-004296
04:23:47.720 --> 04:23:49.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The civil case was dismissed.

asr-004297
04:23:49.040 --> 04:23:49.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-004298
04:23:50.140 --> 04:24:04.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Um, could the, uh, could the PCGG just, uh, place on the record how much of that civil case 0141, may partial recoveries,

asr-004299
04:24:04.200 --> 04:24:13.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: how much was, remained, has remained unrecovered because they said they would no longer present evidence?

asr-004300
04:24:15.480 --> 04:24:19.900
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: The chair would like to inform Rep. Inyo that his time has expired.

asr-004301
04:24:20.140 --> 04:24:20.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you.

asr-004302
04:24:21.880 --> 04:24:33.080
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: We'll just get the exact figure po, Madam Speaker, if we could give it also or provide it to our distinguished colleague.

asr-004303
04:24:33.920 --> 04:24:38.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. So, yun po yung isang tanong. Hindi po nila mabigay?

asr-004304
04:24:38.940 --> 04:24:41.500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: They're just getting the numbers po, Madam Speaker.

asr-004305
04:24:41.500 --> 04:24:42.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Getting the numbers.

asr-004306
04:24:42.120 --> 04:24:50.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then, um, during the budget hearings, I asked and I have been provided with...

asr-004307
04:24:50.140 --> 04:25:02.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ah, information on the total value of the remaining pending PCGG cases for recovery of ill-gotten wealth.

asr-004308
04:25:02.140 --> 04:25:17.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And here, ah, ah, the PCGG has said that there are a total of 67 pending cases pending before the Sandigan Bayan or lower courts.

asr-004309
04:25:17.140 --> 04:25:17.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 34.

asr-004310
04:25:17.920 --> 04:25:18.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 34.

asr-004311
04:25:18.260 --> 04:25:19.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: On appeal...

asr-004312
04:25:19.980 --> 04:25:28.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: With, ah, Supreme Court or CA 31, pending in foreign courts, 2, for a total of 67,

asr-004313
04:25:28.220 --> 04:25:39.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the total monetary value of ill-gotten wealth that should be recovered amounts to 76.773 billion.

asr-004314
04:25:40.720 --> 04:25:40.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-004315
04:25:41.500 --> 04:25:44.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, does the PCGG confirm that?

asr-004316
04:25:45.360 --> 04:25:49.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meron pa pong 67 cases na pending na...

asr-004317
04:25:49.980 --> 04:25:56.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ill-gotten wealth case na gusto pang bawiin ng gobyerno sa Pamilya Marcos.

asr-004318
04:25:56.760 --> 04:25:58.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 76.773 billion.

asr-004319
04:25:59.420 --> 04:25:59.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po?

asr-004320
04:26:00.080 --> 04:26:02.660
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes, there are still 67 pending cases po.

asr-004321
04:26:03.660 --> 04:26:04.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 67 pending cases.

asr-004322
04:26:05.160 --> 04:26:09.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pakiklaro lang po yung on appeal with, ah, SE, SE 31.

asr-004323
04:26:09.740 --> 04:26:18.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Recently, there is a case where 7 of the, ah, corruption charges against...

asr-004324
04:26:19.980 --> 04:26:27.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ah, the former First Lady, ah, and member of the House, Imelda Marcos, was dismissed.

asr-004325
04:26:28.740 --> 04:26:33.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ibig po ba sabihin, babawasan, yung 67, babawasan ng 7?

asr-004326
04:26:34.260 --> 04:26:36.420
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ah, Madam Speaker, hindi po kasama yun sa...

asr-004327
04:26:36.420 --> 04:26:37.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi po, hindi kasama.

asr-004328
04:26:38.440 --> 04:26:39.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, so, klaro po yun.

asr-004329
04:26:39.780 --> 04:26:40.140
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes, ma'am.

asr-004330
04:26:40.320 --> 04:26:40.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-004331
04:26:40.580 --> 04:26:41.540
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Kindly wrap up.

asr-004332
04:26:42.040 --> 04:26:42.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wrapping you.

asr-004333
04:26:42.680 --> 04:26:42.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-004334
04:26:43.380 --> 04:26:43.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you.

asr-004335
04:26:43.860 --> 04:26:49.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Um, let, I will wrap up then, ah, Madam Speaker.

asr-004336
04:26:49.980 --> 04:26:55.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, the PCG, para rin ma-place on the record yung accomplishments ng PCGG.

asr-004337
04:26:55.900 --> 04:27:06.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meron pong binanggit dito na tatlong, ah, dalawa pala, na significant recent, ah, victories or accomplishments of PCGG.

asr-004338
04:27:06.780 --> 04:27:11.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para huwag naman po isipin na walang ginagawa ang, wala nang ginagawa ang PCGG.

asr-004339
04:27:12.580 --> 04:27:19.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Na ipanalo raw yung kaso kaugnay sa Malacanang of the North, in Paway, Ilocos Norte.

asr-004340
04:27:19.980 --> 04:27:38.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, in other words, nagrulang Supreme Court na pag-aari ng gobyerno, hindi ng, ah, Pamilya Marcos, yung, ah, 576,000 square meters of, ah, the Malacanang of the North.

asr-004341
04:27:39.100 --> 04:27:39.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba yun?

asr-004342
04:27:41.100 --> 04:27:42.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, sa gobyerno yun.

asr-004343
04:27:42.580 --> 04:27:47.460
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: The Chair would like to inform again, Representative Pino, that his time has expired.

asr-004344
04:27:47.460 --> 04:27:48.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Last na po, last na po.

asr-004345
04:27:49.100 --> 04:27:49.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then, finally...

asr-004346
04:27:49.980 --> 04:27:50.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, this is important.

asr-004347
04:27:51.360 --> 04:27:58.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nanalo din po sa Supreme Court kaugnay sa Payanig sa Pasig Property.

asr-004348
04:27:59.580 --> 04:28:03.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Again, ruling that this is property of the government.

asr-004349
04:28:04.940 --> 04:28:12.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: These victories affirm the Republic's ownership and control over significant properties, more or less 50 billion in value.

asr-004350
04:28:12.160 --> 04:28:19.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, napakahalaga po na panalo na hindi ito sa Pamilya Marcos.

asr-004351
04:28:19.660 --> 04:28:23.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kung hindi, sa gobyerno ng Pilipinas, 50 billion.

asr-004352
04:28:23.960 --> 04:28:25.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No joke po yan.

asr-004353
04:28:25.700 --> 04:28:25.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-004354
04:28:26.620 --> 04:28:31.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, however, meron pang 76 billion na hinahabol.

asr-004355
04:28:32.020 --> 04:28:32.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-004356
04:28:33.040 --> 04:28:39.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ah, with that, Madam Speaker, ah, ubos na po ang aking oras.

asr-004357
04:28:40.000 --> 04:28:41.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, maraming salamat po.

asr-004358
04:28:42.080 --> 04:28:42.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you.

asr-004359
04:28:42.780 --> 04:28:45.080
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Thank you, Representative Tinio, Majority Leader.

asr-004360
04:28:45.080 --> 04:28:49.080
Rep. Crispin Diego D. Remulla: Madam Speaker, I move to recognize the Honorable...

asr-004361
04:28:49.660 --> 04:28:51.060
Rep. Crispin Diego D. Remulla: Honorable Marcelino C. Libanan.

asr-004362
04:28:51.960 --> 04:28:57.560
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Marcelino Libanan, our Minority Floor Leader, is hereby recognized for his interpellation.

asr-004363
04:29:01.460 --> 04:29:02.880
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-004364
04:29:04.000 --> 04:29:09.980
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Madam Speaker, bago po ako patuloy, gusto ko munang i-greet ang aking family,

asr-004365
04:29:10.580 --> 04:29:13.940
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: former family, the Department of Justice. Magandang hapon po sa inyong lahat.

asr-004366
04:29:13.940 --> 04:29:18.940
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At, Madam Speaker, sila wala nang mag-i-interpellate.

asr-004367
04:29:19.660 --> 04:29:23.520
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Sa hanay ng minorya sa Kongreso,

asr-004368
04:29:24.600 --> 04:29:27.560
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: kaya, on behalf of the minority,

asr-004369
04:29:28.460 --> 04:29:34.000
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: I would like to move, terminate the period for interpellation and debate

asr-004370
04:29:34.000 --> 04:29:39.380
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: on the Department of Justice, including its attached agencies, Madam Speaker.

asr-004371
04:29:39.700 --> 04:29:40.880
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: What does the House say?

asr-004372
04:29:41.640 --> 04:29:44.780
Rep. Crispin Diego D. Remulla: Madam Speaker, on the part of the majority, we join the minority

asr-004373
04:29:44.780 --> 04:29:49.640
Rep. Crispin Diego D. Remulla: in the motion to terminate the period of interpellation on the proposed budget of the DOJ.

asr-004374
04:29:49.660 --> 04:29:54.960
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: There is a joint motion to terminate interpellations on the proposed budget of the Department of Justice,

asr-004375
04:29:55.100 --> 04:29:58.400
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: including its attached agencies. Is there any objection?

asr-004376
04:29:59.000 --> 04:30:00.000
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: The Chair hears none.

asr-004377
04:30:00.000 --> 04:30:06.800
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: The interpellations on the proposed budget of said department and its attached agencies is hereby terminated.

asr-004378
04:30:10.340 --> 04:30:11.360
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader?

asr-004379
04:30:13.140 --> 04:30:27.400
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, under the budgetary support of the government corporations, I move to consider the proposed budget of the Philippine Center for Economic Development.

asr-004380
04:30:27.400 --> 04:30:31.840
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Is there any objection? The chair hears none. The motion is approved.

asr-004381
04:30:32.420 --> 04:30:35.240
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, I move to suspend session for a few minutes.

asr-004382
04:30:35.460 --> 04:30:36.240
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Session is suspended.

asr-004391
04:35:12.000 --> 04:35:16.800
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Session is resumed. Majority Leader?

asr-004392
04:35:17.940 --> 04:35:20.860
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, I would like to reiterate my earlier motion.

asr-004393
04:35:21.700 --> 04:35:27.260
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Under the budgetary support of the government corporations, I move to consider the proposed budget of the Philippine Center for Economic Development.

asr-004394
04:35:27.260 --> 04:35:33.280
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Is there any objection? The chair hears none. The motion is approved.

asr-004395
04:35:33.780 --> 04:35:34.500
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader?

asr-004396
04:35:34.920 --> 04:35:40.380
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, may we acknowledge the heads and officials of the Philippine Center for Economic Development.

asr-004397
04:35:41.440 --> 04:35:46.840
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: They are the following. Executive Director, Maria Joy V. Abrinica. Madam Speaker.

asr-004398
04:35:47.460 --> 04:35:52.640
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: We will acknowledge the presence of the heads and staff of Philippine Center for Economic Development.

asr-004399
04:35:53.060 --> 04:35:55.420
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Welcome to the House of Representatives. Majority Leader?

asr-004401
04:35:56.400 --> 04:35:57.120
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker?

asr-004402
04:35:57.260 --> 04:36:09.940
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Vice Chair from the Committee on Appropriations, Vice Chair Maria Isabel L. Zagarbaria to sponsor the proposed budget for the Philippine Center for Economic Development.

asr-004403
04:36:09.940 --> 04:36:21.800
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Is there any objection? The chair hears none. Representative Maria Isabel Zagarbaria, Vice Chairperson of the Committee on Appropriations, is hereby recognized to begin the sponsorship of House Bill No. 10858.

asr-004404
04:36:22.840 --> 04:36:23.480
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader?

asr-004405
04:36:24.000 --> 04:36:26.620
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues,

asr-004406
04:36:27.260 --> 04:36:40.980
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: I respectfully seek the support of this Honorable House for the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget for the Philippine Center for Economic Development. Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-004407
04:36:41.980 --> 04:36:42.660
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader?

asr-004408
04:36:44.120 --> 04:36:48.140
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, I move to recognize the Honorable Presley de Jesus.

asr-004409
04:36:50.700 --> 04:36:55.360
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Presley de Jesus of Eureka Partidos is hereby recognized for his interpellation.

asr-004410
04:36:55.840 --> 04:36:57.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-004411
04:36:57.260 --> 04:37:15.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Madam Speaker, there being no more members for the minority who wishes to interpolate, I move to terminate the budget, the period of sponsorship and debate for the budget of the Philippine Center for Economic Development. So move, Madam Speaker.

asr-004412
04:37:15.480 --> 04:37:16.440
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: What does the House say?

asr-004413
04:37:16.800 --> 04:37:27.120
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, on the part of the majority, we join the minority in the motion to terminate the period of interpolations on the proposed budget of the Center for Economic Development.

asr-004414
04:37:27.120 --> 04:37:33.240
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: There is a joint motion to terminate the interpellation of the proposed budget of the Philippine Center for Economic Development.

asr-004415
04:37:33.380 --> 04:37:39.380
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Is there any objection? The chair hears none. The interpellation on the proposed budget of said agency is hereby terminated.

asr-004416
04:37:40.380 --> 04:37:41.240
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

asr-004417
04:37:43.520 --> 04:37:54.040
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, I move to consider the proposed budget of the Philippine Postal Corporation.

asr-004418
04:37:54.040 --> 04:37:57.380
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Is there any objection? The chair hears none. The motion is approved.

asr-004419
04:37:57.700 --> 04:37:58.540
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

asr-004420
04:37:59.320 --> 04:38:03.760
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, before we proceed, may we acknowledge the heads and officials of the Philippine Postal Corporation.

asr-004421
04:38:04.060 --> 04:38:04.680
