Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker.

asr-004459
04:40:34.060 --> 04:40:38.100
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: We acknowledge the presence of the heads and officials from the Philippine Reclamation Authority.

asr-004460
04:40:38.440 --> 04:40:39.880
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Welcome to the House of Representatives.

