Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

asr-004467
04:41:05.640 --> 04:41:06.180
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Go ahead.

asr-004468
04:41:06.420 --> 04:41:06.600
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Sorry.

asr-004469
04:41:12.220 --> 04:41:15.460
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: The Honorable Taliado may now proceed with her sponsorship speech.

asr-004470
04:41:15.460 --> 04:41:19.000
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues,

asr-004471
04:41:19.520 --> 04:41:24.020
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: I rise today to present for the consideration of this august chamber,

asr-004472
04:41:24.060 --> 04:41:33.980
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: the proposed 5 billion budgetary support for the Philippine Reclamation Authority for Fiscal Year 2027.

asr-004473
04:41:34.840 --> 04:41:43.840
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Intended for the continued implementation of the Philippine International Exhibition Center, PIEC.

asr-004474
04:41:44.940 --> 04:41:52.660
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: PRA is the government instrumentality mandated not only to regulate and undertake reclamation,

asr-004475
04:41:52.920 --> 04:41:53.820
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: but

asr-004476
04:41:53.820 --> 04:41:54.380
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: also

asr-004477
04:41:54.380 --> 04:41:55.140
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: to

asr-004478
04:41:55.140 --> 04:41:55.540
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: pursue

asr-004479
04:41:55.540 --> 04:42:04.360
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: infrastructure development and the development and management of public estate in the national interest.

asr-004480
04:42:05.720 --> 04:42:15.860
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: In furtherance of this mandate, the PIEC is envisioned as a national flagship infrastructure project

asr-004481
04:42:15.860 --> 04:42:23.040
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: that will strengthen the country's capacity to host major international meetings,

asr-004482
04:42:23.040 --> 04:42:30.480
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: conventions, and exhibitions, support tourism, and related industries,

asr-004483
04:42:31.280 --> 04:42:38.360
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: and enhance the productive use and value of government-owned properties in the area.

asr-004484
04:42:38.980 --> 04:42:45.200
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: With this, Madam Speaker, I am ready for the interpellation and in advance,

asr-004485
04:42:45.200 --> 04:42:51.740
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: I thank our distinguished colleagues for their consideration and support

asr-004486
04:42:51.740 --> 04:42:52.700
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: for the

asr-004487
04:42:53.040 --> 04:42:57.020
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: proposed budget of the Philippine Reclamation Authority.

asr-004488
04:42:57.240 --> 04:42:57.980
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Maraming salamat po.

asr-004489
04:42:58.380 --> 04:42:59.320
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader?

asr-004490
04:43:00.900 --> 04:43:05.900
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, I move to recognize the Honorable Presley de Jesus to interpellate the sponsor.

asr-004491
04:43:06.500 --> 04:43:10.900
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Presley de Jesus of [unclear] is hereby recognized for his interpellation.

asr-004492
04:43:11.380 --> 04:43:15.340
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Madam Speaker, and to the distinguished sponsor.

asr-004493
04:43:17.580 --> 04:43:21.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The 5 billion Philippine International Exhibition Center allocation

asr-004494
04:43:23.040 --> 04:43:30.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: provides the Philippine Reclamation Authority with 5 billion pesos

asr-004495
04:43:30.460 --> 04:43:35.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: for the Philippine International Exhibition Center, or PIEC.

asr-004496
04:43:35.360 --> 04:43:41.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: This is a substantial new appropriation for a government-owned or controlled corporation

asr-004497
04:43:41.960 --> 04:43:49.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: that ordinarily undertakes proprietary and revenue-generating activities.

asr-004498
04:43:50.160 --> 04:43:50.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Question.

asr-004499
04:43:51.540 --> 04:43:52.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Why is an additional appropriation?

asr-004500
04:43:53.040 --> 04:43:55.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Why is an additional 5 billion in national government support

asr-004501
04:43:55.360 --> 04:43:59.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: being coursed through the PRA for the PIEC

asr-004502
04:43:59.420 --> 04:44:03.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: considering that the project is being implemented

asr-004503
04:44:03.480 --> 04:44:06.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: by the Department of Public Works and Highways

asr-004504
04:44:06.560 --> 04:44:08.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: for the Office of the President?

asr-004505
04:44:12.980 --> 04:44:14.420
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Madam Speaker,

asr-004506
04:44:15.500 --> 04:44:17.380
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Your Honor,

asr-004508
04:44:17.580 --> 04:44:20.820
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ang project po natin.

asr-004509
04:44:23.040 --> 04:44:30.200
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ang unang dalawang SARO po kasi ng project ay

asr-004510
04:44:30.200 --> 04:44:35.600
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: nanggaling na sa Office of the President.

asr-004511
04:44:36.520 --> 04:44:37.380
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Pero ngayon po

asr-004512
04:44:38.480 --> 04:44:40.220
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: humihingi po kami

asr-004513
04:44:40.480 --> 04:44:41.020
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: siyempre

asr-004514
04:44:41.140 --> 04:44:42.220
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: ng kaukulang pondo

asr-004515
04:44:42.220 --> 04:44:44.180
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: dito na sa atin.

asr-004516
04:44:44.180 --> 04:44:45.280
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Dahil po

asr-004517
04:44:45.280 --> 04:44:50.320
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: ang DPWH naman po

asr-004518
04:44:50.320 --> 04:44:51.040
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: siyempre

asr-004519
04:44:51.040 --> 04:44:52.480
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: nagkaroon tayo ng

asr-004520
04:44:52.480 --> 04:44:55.880
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: MOA

asr-004521
04:44:55.880 --> 04:45:02.160
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: dahil sila ang mas higit na nakakaalam sa implementation ng proyekto.

asr-004522
04:45:02.680 --> 04:45:08.380
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Kaya po, nararapat lang na ang DPWH ang mag-implement ng project.

asr-004538
04:45:13.120 --> 04:45:25.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Madam Speaker, my follow-up question is, what is the precise financial responsibility of the PRA, the Department of Public Works and Highways, and the Office of the President for the project?

asr-004539
04:45:25.380 --> 04:45:33.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And which entity will own, operate, maintain, and receive revenues from the completed facility?

asr-004540
04:45:35.080 --> 04:45:50.220
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Madam Speaker, Your Honor, PRA handles the government asset and project side, while DPWH handles the procurement, design, and construction.

asr-004541
04:45:51.840 --> 04:45:55.220
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ang project naman po ay para sa nasyonal.

asr-004542
04:45:55.380 --> 04:46:01.580
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Government under the Office of the President.

asr-004543
04:46:02.680 --> 04:46:10.380
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: At ito po ay sinama sa list of infrastructure project, flagship project ng pamahalaan.

asr-004544
04:46:11.560 --> 04:46:17.700
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Kapag natapos na po ang PIEC, pangangasiwaan po ito ng PRA.

asr-004545
04:46:18.360 --> 04:46:24.700
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: So, ang revenue po na makukuha dito ay makakadagdag

asr-004546
04:46:25.380 --> 04:46:28.360
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: sa dibidendo na ibinibigay ng PRA sa pamahalaan.

asr-004547
04:46:28.360 --> 04:46:36.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, in short, Madam Speaker, once the project has been completed, PRA na po ang magpapatakbo. Tama ho ba yun?

asr-004548
04:46:37.000 --> 04:46:37.560
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yes po.

asr-004549
04:46:39.060 --> 04:46:53.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Next, what alternative financing arrangements including PRA corporate funds, land development, revenues, borrowings, or private participation were evaluated before additional national government funding was sought?

asr-004550
04:46:53.860 --> 04:46:55.100
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito po ba

asr-004553
04:46:55.360 --> 04:46:59.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pinag-aralang mabuti bago po kayo humingi ng national government funding?

asr-004554
04:47:00.680 --> 04:47:08.320
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ah, yes po. Ito po ay pinag-aralang mabuti bago po kami humingi ng pondo.

asr-004555
04:47:10.320 --> 04:47:24.500
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ayon po kasi sa CAVCOM approval, NEDA board confirmation at RDC approval, ang national government ang gagastos ng project cost.

asr-004556
04:47:24.500 --> 04:47:28.480
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: At ang PRA naman, ang contribution niya ay yung lupa.

asr-004557
04:47:31.880 --> 04:47:42.740
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay. What return, whether through revenue, employment, tourism receipts, or appreciation of public land, should taxpayers expect from this investment?

asr-004558
04:47:42.740 --> 04:47:57.240
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ang financial and economic benefits po ay evaluated ng NEDA.

asr-004559
04:47:57.240 --> 04:48:11.980
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ah, 1.33 trillion pesos, absolute peso value of total net economic benefits over 50 years based on conservative assumption.

asr-004560
04:48:12.740 --> 04:48:29.900
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: And 377.7 billion pesos, absolute peso value of total net financial benefit over 50 years based on conservative assumptions.

asr-004561
04:48:29.900 --> 04:48:42.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, Madam Speaker, if the PIEC eventually generates a profit, will the national government recover its 5 billion contribution before revenues are retained?

asr-004562
04:48:42.500 --> 04:48:50.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Or distributed elsewhere? Ito po ba ibabalik sa gobyerno o i-dedistribute po sa iba-ibang departamento?

asr-004563
04:48:51.740 --> 04:48:52.380
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yes po.

asr-004564
04:48:53.680 --> 04:49:02.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Which particular department po or agencies ang makikinabang dito once na-recover po itong 5 billion contribution ng national government?

asr-004565
04:49:04.920 --> 04:49:11.660
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Siyempre po, ang makikinabang dito, ang ating unang-una, ang BIR.

asr-004566
04:49:12.500 --> 04:49:15.900
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Kasi, siyempre, yung papasok na profit sa atin.

asr-004567
04:49:17.180 --> 04:49:26.200
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: And ikalawa po, inaasahang lilikha ito ng trabaho, negosyo para sa mga, especially yung sa mga hotels po.

asr-004568
04:49:26.820 --> 04:49:30.800
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Kasi napapaikutan siya ng establishment.

asr-004569
04:49:31.800 --> 04:49:39.420
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Of course, pag may convention, so yun po ang papasok na income sa gobyerno.

asr-004570
04:49:39.780 --> 04:49:42.460
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: At ang ikatlo po, lalaki.

asr-004571
04:49:42.500 --> 04:49:50.360
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ang turismo sa Pilipinas, dahil tayo po ay, alam natin, napag-iiwanan na rin natin.

asr-004572
04:49:50.600 --> 04:50:01.280
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Napag-iiwanan na tayo kasi wala nga tayong mapagdausan ng malaking mga events sa Pilipinas.

asr-004573
04:50:02.340 --> 04:50:03.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-004574
04:50:04.320 --> 04:50:08.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The PIEC is reported to cost approximately 27 billion.

asr-004575
04:50:08.720 --> 04:50:09.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Tama ho ba ito?

asr-004576
04:50:10.500 --> 04:50:12.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: 27 billion ang total na...

asr-004577
04:50:12.120 --> 04:50:12.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yes.

asr-004578
04:50:12.500 --> 04:50:15.180
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: 27 billion.

asr-004579
04:50:16.340 --> 04:50:27.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And then your target will be this year, 40% lang po ang completion and the rest will be on 2027 by the end of 2027.

asr-004580
04:50:28.120 --> 04:50:33.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito ba yung makukumpleto natin before the end of 2027? Itong project na ito?

asr-004581
04:50:33.960 --> 04:50:38.360
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Hindi pa po natin makukumpleto ang proyekto ngayong 2027.

asr-004582
04:50:40.020 --> 04:50:42.360
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ang inish, ang inaasahan po natin makukumpleto.

asr-004583
04:50:42.500 --> 04:50:45.560
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ito ang proyekto ay sa April 2028.

asr-004584
04:50:46.120 --> 04:50:46.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: April?

asr-004585
04:50:47.720 --> 04:50:48.520
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: 2028 po.

asr-004586
04:50:48.540 --> 04:50:49.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: 2028.

asr-004587
04:50:49.500 --> 04:50:50.020
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yes po.

asr-004588
04:50:53.980 --> 04:51:06.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, my next question, what is the complete funding and implementation plan for the PIEC from initial design through construction, equipment procurement, testing, and opening?

asr-004589
04:51:06.020 --> 04:51:14.940
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: So, ang kalahatang pondo nga po natin is 27 billion.

asr-004590
04:51:16.940 --> 04:51:20.740
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Again, it's related to my first question.

asr-004591
04:51:21.140 --> 04:51:26.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What portion of the estimated 27 billion cost remains unfunded?

asr-004592
04:51:27.380 --> 04:51:29.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Magkano po yung kailangan nyo pa po?

asr-004593
04:51:29.860 --> 04:51:29.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-004594
04:51:33.020 --> 04:51:34.860
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ang kakulangan pa po natin...

asr-004595
04:51:36.020 --> 04:51:45.040
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Pondo ay yung 5 billion at saka yung 10 billion para po makumpleto natin ang ating PIEC.

asr-004596
04:51:46.700 --> 04:51:57.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, while phase 1 reached only 90% completion by the end of 2027, kasama doon po ba yung 5 billion na i-appropriate na?

asr-004597
04:51:57.860 --> 04:51:59.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: O ito po'y kukulangin pa?

asr-004598
04:52:01.700 --> 04:52:02.600
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Kumpleto po.

asr-004599
04:52:02.840 --> 04:52:04.820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasama na yung 5 billion by 2027.

asr-004600
04:52:04.820 --> 04:52:05.820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, the...

asr-004601
04:52:06.020 --> 04:52:11.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The 5 billion additional fund, ito na po ang magtatapos o kukumpleto yun?

asr-004602
04:52:11.860 --> 04:52:12.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: No, hindi po.

asr-004603
04:52:12.920 --> 04:52:14.460
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Phase 1 pa lang po yun.

asr-004604
04:52:14.700 --> 04:52:16.740
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, yung phase 1 kasama yung 5 billion.

asr-004605
04:52:16.920 --> 04:52:17.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, yung phase 2 po...

asr-004606
04:52:17.980 --> 04:52:27.600
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yung phase 2 po, yun yung magtatapos po ng ating construction building, yung PIEC ng 10 billion pa po.

asr-004607
04:52:27.800 --> 04:52:28.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And that's the remaining?

asr-004608
04:52:29.180 --> 04:52:29.540
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yes.

asr-004609
04:52:29.540 --> 04:52:30.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung sinama nyo na ba?

asr-004610
04:52:30.460 --> 04:52:33.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pinaktor na po yung inflation rate, lahat po kasama na dyan.

asr-004611
04:52:34.000 --> 04:52:35.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pati yung dollar po natin habang ngayon.

asr-004612
04:52:36.020 --> 04:52:36.840
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Tumataas pa?

asr-004613
04:52:37.840 --> 04:52:38.360
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yes po.

asr-004614
04:52:38.700 --> 04:52:39.640
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Anticipated na po.

asr-004615
04:52:39.900 --> 04:52:40.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-004616
04:52:42.560 --> 04:52:47.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: My next question, climate resilience of a facility built on a reclaimed land.

asr-004617
04:52:47.780 --> 04:52:49.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi ito po lagi problema natin, no?

asr-004618
04:52:49.680 --> 04:52:51.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pag the property is being reclaimed.

asr-004619
04:52:52.280 --> 04:52:55.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The PIEC is being built on reclaimed land in Manila Bay.

asr-004620
04:52:56.140 --> 04:53:02.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: An area exposed to typhoons, storm surge, sea level rise, land subsidence,

asr-004621
04:53:04.140 --> 04:53:04.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: liquefaction,

asr-004622
04:53:06.020 --> 04:53:06.520
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and flooding.

asr-004623
04:53:07.180 --> 04:53:14.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: A facility expected to operate for several decades must be designed for future climate conditions

asr-004624
04:53:14.280 --> 04:53:17.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: rather than only historical averages.

asr-004625
04:53:18.400 --> 04:53:18.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Question.

asr-004626
04:53:19.580 --> 04:53:27.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What climate and geotechnical standards were used in designing the PIEC and its reclaimed site?

asr-004627
04:53:27.820 --> 04:53:29.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito po kasi nagiging problema ngayon.

asr-004628
04:53:29.700 --> 04:53:33.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pag ano, sa Japan nga po, yung airport nila, every year po,

asr-004629
04:53:33.860 --> 04:53:35.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: nag-ano, nag-a...

asr-004630
04:53:36.020 --> 04:53:37.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Magsisig, bumababa po.

asr-004631
04:53:37.780 --> 04:53:38.840
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi ito po, malaki.

asr-004632
04:53:38.980 --> 04:53:41.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: We're talking about 27 billion plus 10 billion pa.

asr-004633
04:53:42.000 --> 04:53:45.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kung sakali po lumabog to or magka-problema.

asr-004634
04:53:45.960 --> 04:53:50.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Alam niyo po, ang ating bansa, tayo po yung pinakapaborito ng mga...

asr-004635
04:53:50.300 --> 04:53:51.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ng typhoons.

asr-004636
04:53:51.820 --> 04:53:56.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Lagi nilang every year, not less than 20 typhoons na dumatid po sa atin.

asr-004637
04:53:57.320 --> 04:53:57.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Your comment?

asr-004638
04:53:58.940 --> 04:54:00.520
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Madam Speaker, Your Honor,

asr-004639
04:54:00.520 --> 04:54:05.340
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: hindi po ako naniniwala, nalulubog.

asr-004640
04:54:05.340 --> 04:54:08.680
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Kasi po, pinag-aralan natin, pinag-aralan ito.

asr-004641
04:54:09.120 --> 04:54:11.860
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Hindi lang naman po ang DNR ang nag-aral dito.

asr-004642
04:54:12.360 --> 04:54:17.000
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: So, una po, sa climate resilient design,

asr-004643
04:54:17.920 --> 04:54:24.080
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: nagsasagawa po ng risk assessment upang matukoy ang climate related risk.

asr-004644
04:54:25.560 --> 04:54:28.780
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yun na nga po, particular ang flooding, storm,

asr-004645
04:54:28.780 --> 04:54:35.320
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: ay sinasagawa po at kinakailangan ng resilient measures sa design ng pasis.

asr-004646
04:54:35.340 --> 04:54:38.820
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: At ikalawa po, para sa flood protection,

asr-004647
04:54:39.480 --> 04:54:46.760
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: ang structure po ay disinenyong elevate above the applicable base flood levels

asr-004648
04:54:46.760 --> 04:54:53.640
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: at magkakaroon ng flood barriers upang mabawasan ang exposure sa potential flood.

asr-004649
04:54:55.020 --> 04:54:58.120
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: At ikatlo po, para sa heat mitigation,

asr-004650
04:54:59.120 --> 04:55:02.660
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: kasama sa design ang passive cooling strategies

asr-004651
04:55:03.180 --> 04:55:05.120
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: gaya ng natural ventilation.

asr-004652
04:55:05.340 --> 04:55:17.840
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Shading, reflective roofing materials, at urban greening upang mabawasan ng heat gain at energy consumption.

asr-004653
04:55:18.840 --> 04:55:20.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, in short, sino ang contractor dito?

asr-004654
04:55:20.780 --> 04:55:24.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Is it foreign or local po ang nanaro?

asr-004655
04:55:24.280 --> 04:55:26.240
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Actually po, hindi pa naman po.

asr-004656
04:55:29.240 --> 04:55:31.520
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yung phase 1 po is EEI.

asr-004657
04:55:31.520 --> 04:55:34.320
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: So, itong second phase po natin,

asr-004658
04:55:34.460 --> 04:55:35.320
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: hindi pa naman po,

asr-004659
04:55:35.340 --> 04:55:36.240
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: nabibid.

asr-004660
04:55:37.120 --> 04:55:39.080
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Kung mabibigyan po ng pagkakataon nga

asr-004661
04:55:39.080 --> 04:55:41.100
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: para matuloy ang proyekto natin na ito,

asr-004662
04:55:42.220 --> 04:55:43.700
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: ay saka pa lang po ibibid

asr-004663
04:55:43.700 --> 04:55:45.240
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: pag may pera na itong hawak.

asr-004664
04:55:46.740 --> 04:55:48.840
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito ang kasi karamihan tinatanong,

asr-004665
04:55:49.220 --> 04:55:55.260
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: is the project undergone an independent climate risk stress test.

asr-004666
04:55:57.620 --> 04:56:01.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Meron mo ba kayo na-hire na independent na very familiar

asr-004667
04:56:01.440 --> 04:56:04.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: or ito po talagang kanilang forte

asr-004668
04:56:04.420 --> 04:56:10.260
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: sa mga ganitong reclaimed site or area or land po

asr-004669
04:56:10.260 --> 04:56:13.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: na climate risk stress test?

asr-004670
04:56:13.400 --> 04:56:13.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sino po?

asr-004671
04:56:14.000 --> 04:56:17.100
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Meron mo kayong independent na kinuha na mag-survey?

asr-004672
04:56:17.580 --> 04:56:18.220
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Meron po.

asr-004673
04:56:18.360 --> 04:56:22.200
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Meron po siyempre independent agency na survey po.

asr-004674
04:56:22.200 --> 04:56:23.220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: O kung ilan po sila?

asr-004675
04:56:23.340 --> 04:56:23.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Isa lang ho ba?

asr-004676
04:56:23.900 --> 04:56:25.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ano?

asr-004680
04:56:44.420 --> 04:56:49.320
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Anong survey po niya na yung Royal Asconis?

asr-004681
04:56:49.880 --> 04:56:55.360
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Royal Asconis.

asr-004682
04:56:55.840 --> 04:56:58.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: From, siguro, I guess from Europe to, no?

asr-004683
04:56:59.600 --> 04:57:00.120
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yes po.

asr-004684
04:57:00.400 --> 04:57:01.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Which particular?

asr-004685
04:57:01.880 --> 04:57:02.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Dutch.

asr-004686
04:57:02.200 --> 04:57:03.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay, Dutch.

asr-004687
04:57:04.420 --> 04:57:06.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, my follow-up question is also related, no?

asr-004688
04:57:07.320 --> 04:57:07.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Alam nyo, no?

asr-004689
04:57:07.800 --> 04:57:10.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Once na matapos na natin itong proyektong to,

asr-004690
04:57:11.400 --> 04:57:16.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: hindi lang po dyan nagtatapos yung ating pagbabantay, no?

asr-004691
04:57:16.640 --> 04:57:18.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Although maganda yung project,

asr-004692
04:57:18.760 --> 04:57:21.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: nagkaroon ng independent stress test,

asr-004693
04:57:21.200 --> 04:57:24.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: pero alam nyo po, ang climate natin, every year, nagbabago.

asr-004694
04:57:25.380 --> 04:57:27.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Who will pay for the future seawalls,

asr-004695
04:57:28.260 --> 04:57:31.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ground stabilization or elevation works

asr-004696
04:57:31.320 --> 04:57:34.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: if climate conditions exceed,

asr-004697
04:57:34.420 --> 04:57:35.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the original assumption?

asr-004698
04:57:35.880 --> 04:57:36.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Alam po natin, eh,

asr-004699
04:57:37.220 --> 04:57:38.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: pabago-bago po ating panoon.

asr-004700
04:57:38.820 --> 04:57:41.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, the good thing that we did today,

asr-004701
04:57:41.980 --> 04:57:43.260
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: pagdating 10 years from now,

asr-004702
04:57:43.360 --> 04:57:44.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: magbabago na naman yan.

asr-004703
04:57:44.600 --> 04:57:47.000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, sino po yung magmamonitor,

asr-004704
04:57:47.100 --> 04:57:49.220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: yung tinatag nating operating,

asr-004705
04:57:49.720 --> 04:57:51.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: operation and maintenance,

asr-004706
04:57:51.060 --> 04:57:54.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: sino po ang mag-aalaga nito?

asr-004707
04:57:54.240 --> 04:57:56.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kairin mo po ba sa PRA

asr-004708
04:57:56.480 --> 04:57:59.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: o meron mo kayong independent na kukunin

asr-004709
04:57:59.480 --> 04:58:02.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: just to maintain itong ating facility?

asr-004710
04:58:02.940 --> 04:58:04.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: We're talking about 27 billion.

asr-004711
04:58:04.420 --> 04:58:05.480
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: PRA pa rin po, siyempre.

asr-004712
04:58:06.180 --> 04:58:06.680
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yes po.

asr-004713
04:58:06.880 --> 04:58:07.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sila pa rin po.

asr-004714
04:58:07.820 --> 04:58:08.180
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yes po.

asr-004715
04:58:08.180 --> 04:58:11.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, do you have enough technical people

asr-004716
04:58:11.580 --> 04:58:15.000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: to maintain itong seawall natin

asr-004717
04:58:15.000 --> 04:58:17.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: o ano man lang itong kailangan gawin dito?

asr-004718
04:58:17.520 --> 04:58:19.100
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Meron po, kasi, di ba,

asr-004719
04:58:19.580 --> 04:58:21.560
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: nagsimula pa naman po ang reclamation,

asr-004720
04:58:21.740 --> 04:58:23.140
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: 1973.

asr-004721
04:58:23.480 --> 04:58:24.520
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ako po nun ay,

asr-004722
04:58:25.100 --> 04:58:26.000
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: hindi ako magkakamali,

asr-004723
04:58:26.120 --> 04:58:27.480
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: apat na taong pa lang ako nun.

asr-004724
04:58:28.360 --> 04:58:29.700
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: So, nabukin nyo ang edad ko.

asr-004725
04:58:29.940 --> 04:58:32.620
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: So, wala naman po, di ba,

asr-004726
04:58:32.620 --> 04:58:34.240
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: wala naman tayong nabalitaan.

asr-004727
04:58:34.420 --> 04:58:36.040
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ganong mga incident.

asr-004728
04:58:36.340 --> 04:58:38.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: That's very enlightening, no?

asr-004729
04:58:39.120 --> 04:58:41.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: For how many years na nireclaim natin,

asr-004730
04:58:41.420 --> 04:58:42.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: not even one,

asr-004731
04:58:42.980 --> 04:58:46.220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: na talagang sinabi na tinamaan

asr-004732
04:58:46.220 --> 04:58:48.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: or nagsubside

asr-004733
04:58:48.560 --> 04:58:49.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: or nawala.

asr-004734
04:58:49.960 --> 04:58:51.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Naging tubig ulit.

asr-004735
04:58:51.320 --> 04:58:52.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Siguro wala pa nangyayaring ganyan, no?

asr-004736
04:58:53.240 --> 04:58:54.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: In the history of PRA.

asr-004737
04:58:55.200 --> 04:58:57.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, congratulations sa inyo, PRA, no?

asr-004738
04:58:57.540 --> 04:58:58.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: For doing a good job.

asr-004739
04:58:58.600 --> 04:59:01.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Now, I want to go to my second to the last question.

asr-004740
04:59:01.860 --> 04:59:03.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Status of Manila Bay reclamation

asr-004741
04:59:04.420 --> 04:59:05.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: moratorium.

asr-004742
04:59:06.400 --> 04:59:07.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The President suspended

asr-004743
04:59:07.800 --> 04:59:10.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Manila Bay reclamation projects

asr-004744
04:59:10.280 --> 04:59:11.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: in 2023.

asr-004745
04:59:12.300 --> 04:59:13.000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pending review.

asr-004746
04:59:13.900 --> 04:59:15.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The suspension was later lifted

asr-004747
04:59:15.760 --> 04:59:18.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: for certain PASAY projects

asr-004748
04:59:18.600 --> 04:59:20.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: after compliance review

asr-004749
04:59:20.440 --> 04:59:21.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: while other projects

asr-004750
04:59:21.800 --> 04:59:24.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: remained suspended pending assessment.

asr-004751
04:59:25.320 --> 04:59:25.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Question.

asr-004752
04:59:26.340 --> 04:59:28.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What is the exact status of every

asr-004753
04:59:28.580 --> 04:59:30.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: reclamation project

asr-004754
04:59:30.200 --> 04:59:32.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: covered by the Manila Bay suspension?

asr-004755
04:59:32.760 --> 04:59:33.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ilan ho ba yung

asr-004756
04:59:33.540 --> 04:59:34.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: until now?

asr-004757
04:59:34.420 --> 04:59:37.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Suspended po

asr-004758
04:59:37.180 --> 04:59:38.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ng mga projects po?

asr-004759
04:59:41.960 --> 04:59:43.260
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Your Honor,

asr-004760
04:59:43.740 --> 04:59:45.720
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: noong August 4,

asr-004761
04:59:45.940 --> 04:59:46.940
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: 2023,

asr-004762
04:59:47.820 --> 04:59:49.000
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: pinatasan ng Pangulo

asr-004763
04:59:49.000 --> 04:59:50.720
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: ang DNR at PRA

asr-004764
04:59:50.720 --> 04:59:52.480
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: na isuspende ang lahat

asr-004765
04:59:52.480 --> 04:59:54.340
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: ng reclamation projects

asr-004766
04:59:54.340 --> 04:59:56.280
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: at activities sa Manila Bay.

asr-004767
04:59:56.980 --> 04:59:58.260
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Habang nire-review po

asr-004768
04:59:58.260 --> 05:00:00.000
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: ang compliance ng BAU.

asr-004769
05:00:00.000 --> 05:00:06.980
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Bawat proponents sa existing laws, rules, regulation, at environmental requirement.

asr-004770
05:00:07.540 --> 05:00:12.480
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Kasabay po ng pagsasagawa ng cumulative impact assessment.

asr-004771
05:00:12.480 --> 05:00:25.400
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: And sa status po ng Manila Bay Reclamation Moratorium, batay po sa kasalo po yung status or matrix na nasa aming records.

asr-004772
05:00:26.320 --> 05:00:28.120
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Sandali lang po at masyadong maliit.

asr-004773
05:00:28.120 --> 05:00:30.120
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Tayo po yung...

asr-004774
05:00:33.740 --> 05:00:47.260
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Apat po yung nalip na yung suspension. So meron pa pong sampo na ten na hindi pa po nalilip yung suspension.

asr-004775
05:00:47.820 --> 05:00:49.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So all in all, fourteen.

asr-004776
05:00:49.680 --> 05:00:50.320
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yes po.

asr-004777
05:00:50.320 --> 05:00:52.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Fourteen. How many were granted?

asr-004778
05:00:54.200 --> 05:00:57.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Na nagtuloy pa rin. Remember there was a suspension in the...

asr-004779
05:00:57.960 --> 05:01:00.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Under review. And then tunuloy po. Diba?

asr-004780
05:01:00.800 --> 05:01:02.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So ilan po yung ongoing projects ngayon?

asr-004781
05:01:03.320 --> 05:01:03.920
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Apat po.

asr-004782
05:01:04.140 --> 05:01:04.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Apat?

asr-004783
05:01:04.840 --> 05:01:05.280
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yes po.

asr-004784
05:01:05.500 --> 05:01:09.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So hindi pala fourteen. Four at ten yung suspension.

asr-004785
05:01:09.540 --> 05:01:10.380
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Four at ten po.

asr-004786
05:01:10.540 --> 05:01:15.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay. So in totality, ilan po ang total hectares natin sa Manila Bay ngayon?

asr-004787
05:01:16.540 --> 05:01:19.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung ginagawa at saka yung dati na nagawa?

asr-004788
05:01:38.980 --> 05:01:48.160
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Your Honor, ang ating pong ongoing projects ay 625 hectares.

asr-004789
05:01:50.340 --> 05:01:57.800
