asr-004808
05:03:17.780 --> 05:03:25.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: on water circulation, flooding, fisheries, sediment, movement, and coastal ecosystem.

asr-004809
05:03:26.280 --> 05:03:26.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Question.

asr-004810
05:03:27.480 --> 05:03:27.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What?

asr-004811
05:03:27.940 --> 05:03:34.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What is the present status of the government's cumulative impact assessment for Manila Bay reclamation?

asr-004812
05:03:35.240 --> 05:03:37.280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What has been completed to date?

asr-004813
05:03:37.860 --> 05:03:40.880
