asr-004814
05:03:54.880 --> 05:03:57.920
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Your Honor, yung phase one po natin is,

asr-004815
05:03:57.940 --> 05:03:59.460
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: completed na po yun.

asr-004816
05:04:00.660 --> 05:04:10.680
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: So, ang status po ay ongoing po yung iba kasi sinasagawa ng DNR.

asr-004817
05:04:13.060 --> 05:04:17.080
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: May mga regulatory options ang government.

asr-004818
05:04:18.040 --> 05:04:24.840
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: And ito po ay may mga additional mitigation, redesign, or modification imposed strictly condition.

asr-004819
05:04:26.240 --> 05:04:27.800
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: So, Your Honor,

asr-004820
05:04:27.940 --> 05:04:37.820
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: as I said, completed na po ang phase one ng cumulative impact assessment or CIA na ay sinasagawa ng DNR

asr-004821
05:04:37.820 --> 05:04:44.280
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: sa pamamagitan ng Marine Environmental and Resources Foundation Incorporated.

asr-004822
05:04:45.180 --> 05:04:50.700
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ang resulta po ng phase one CIA study para sa Manila Bay reclamation project

asr-004823
05:04:50.700 --> 05:04:55.680
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: ay tinalakay na rin po ng DNR noong December 2025.

asr-004824
05:04:55.680 --> 05:05:06.680
