asr-005004
05:13:45.980 --> 05:13:46.480
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Your Honor.

asr-005005
05:13:47.740 --> 05:13:48.060
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Or

asr-005006
05:13:48.060 --> 05:13:52.060
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: EEC

asr-005007
05:13:52.060 --> 05:13:53.820
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: required by DNR,

asr-005008
05:13:53.880 --> 05:13:55.700
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: DNR, EMB po, Your Honor.

asr-005009
05:13:56.180 --> 05:13:57.860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Alam po ba natin kung ano

asr-005010
05:13:57.860 --> 05:14:00.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ang frequency ng kanilang inspection?

asr-005011
05:14:00.140 --> 05:14:02.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: I'm sure dapat po may sinasabit ding report

asr-005012
05:14:02.140 --> 05:14:03.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: sa ating ahensya, ang mga ahensya

asr-005013
05:14:03.980 --> 05:14:05.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ang gumagawa nito as PRA.

asr-005014
05:14:07.920 --> 05:14:09.780
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: The water spray

asr-005015
05:14:09.780 --> 05:14:11.180
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: today po yun.

asr-005016
05:14:11.880 --> 05:14:13.140
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: And then we have a regular

asr-005017
05:14:13.140 --> 05:14:15.040
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: multi-part type monitoring

asr-005018
05:14:15.040 --> 05:14:17.320
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: ng DNR tsaka other states.

asr-005019
05:14:18.100 --> 05:14:19.020
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Your Honor,

asr-005020
05:14:19.840 --> 05:14:21.980
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: every day po, ini-inspect

asr-005021
05:14:23.880 --> 05:14:25.720
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: ang construction site,

asr-005022
05:14:25.800 --> 05:14:26.180
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Your Honor.

asr-005023
05:14:29.100 --> 05:14:31.420
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Can we get the assurance of the PRA

asr-005024
05:14:31.420 --> 05:14:33.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na kung every day po ini-inspect at sana

asr-005025
05:14:33.720 --> 05:14:35.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: nakaka-comply yung mga

asr-005026
05:14:35.820 --> 05:14:37.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: gumagawa ng proyektong ito ay hindi na po

asr-005027
05:14:37.840 --> 05:14:39.560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: mauulit yung ganitong klase

asr-005028
05:14:39.560 --> 05:14:41.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng dust cloud, lalo na po

asr-005029
05:14:41.900 --> 05:14:43.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: sa areas na marami tayong

asr-005030
05:14:43.780 --> 05:14:45.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: mga kababayan ang dumadaan

asr-005031
05:14:45.340 --> 05:14:47.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: o kaya naman po nagtatrabaho

asr-005032
05:14:47.080 --> 05:14:49.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: o naninirahan sa mga lugar na iyon?

asr-005033
05:14:50.180 --> 05:14:51.880
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yes po, Your Honor.

asr-005034
05:14:51.880 --> 05:14:53.800
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Rest assured po na hindi

asr-005035
05:14:53.800 --> 05:14:55.400
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: na mauulit yung ganong mga

asr-005036
05:14:55.400 --> 05:14:56.280
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: pangyayari.

asr-005037
05:14:57.280 --> 05:15:00.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Marami pong salamat Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-005038
05:15:00.220 --> 05:15:05.940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Balikan ko lang po yung nabanggit kanina na pronouncement ng Pangulong Marcos noong 2023

asr-005039
05:15:05.940 --> 05:15:10.640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: regarding the suspension of reclamation projects in the Manila Bay.

asr-005040
05:15:11.180 --> 05:15:15.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Earlier, binanggit po ninyo, the suspension has been lifted. For the record po, tama po ba?

asr-005041
05:15:17.120 --> 05:15:24.620
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yes po. Apat po yung na-lifted. Meron pa po tayong sampung suspended.

asr-005042
05:15:24.620 --> 05:15:30.860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, apat po ang lifted. Mayroon pang sampo na suspended pa.

asr-005043
05:15:31.320 --> 05:15:35.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, ano po ang mangyayari dito po sa sampung projects na suspended pa?

asr-005044
05:15:36.600 --> 05:15:42.620
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Hanggat hindi po sila nakakapagpasa ng requirements na nire-require ng DNR,

asr-005045
05:15:43.540 --> 05:15:49.560
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: hindi po sila mabibigyan, hindi po malilip yung kanilang suspension.

asr-005046
05:15:49.840 --> 05:15:54.440
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, maliban po sa nabanggit ninyo na isang requirement,

asr-005047
05:15:54.880 --> 05:15:59.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: para matanggal ang kanilang suspension o ma-lift ang suspension nila ay yung submission

asr-005048
05:15:59.900 --> 05:16:06.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng requirements mula sa DNR. Ano pa po yung dahilan? Bakit suspended ang sampung projects na ito?

asr-005049
05:16:11.120 --> 05:16:17.200
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yung result po kasi ng cumulative impact ay hindi pa po lumalabas.

asr-005050
05:16:17.200 --> 05:16:21.500
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Kaya po, hindi pa nalilip yung kanilang suspension, Your Honor.

asr-005051
05:16:22.320 --> 05:16:24.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Doon naman po. Maraming salamat, Madam Sponsor.

asr-005052
05:16:24.620 --> 05:16:31.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, doon naman po sa apat na na-lift yung suspension, maaari po bang pangalanan natin?

asr-005053
05:16:31.520 --> 05:16:36.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano-ano itong apat na proyektong ito? At sino po ang nag-apply ng permiso?

asr-005054
05:16:46.960 --> 05:16:53.460
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Your Honor, ang lifted na po ang suspension ay ang Manila Waterfront City.

asr-005055
05:16:54.620 --> 05:17:07.880
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Pasay SM Reclamation Project, Pasay Harbor City, at ang Bacoor City na 90 hectares inner island.

asr-005056
05:17:08.440 --> 05:17:12.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pwede rin po bang pangalanan, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, kung sino ang proponent?

asr-005057
05:17:12.760 --> 05:17:17.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Yung mga kumpanya behind. Kasi po, alam ko, conglomerate yung ilan dito sa apat na proyektong ito.

asr-005067
05:17:54.620 --> 05:18:13.880
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Your Honor, ang may-ari po ng Manila Waterfront City ay ang Manila Waterfront Corporation.

asr-005068
05:18:14.640 --> 05:18:21.440
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ito naman pong PASAIS SM ay SM Corporation po.

asr-005069
05:18:21.440 --> 05:18:35.880
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: And ang PASAIS Harbor City po, ang nagmamay-ari po ay ang PASAIS City Local Government, PASAIS Harbor City Corp.

asr-005070
05:18:37.060 --> 05:18:46.320
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: And yung pong Bacoor City na 90 hectares ay pag-aari po ng Probel and Robinson, Your Honor.

asr-005071
05:18:46.800 --> 05:18:49.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Yung pong sa huli, yung sa Bacoor po, sino po muli?

asr-005072
05:18:51.440 --> 05:18:53.120
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Probel and Robinson.

asr-005073
05:18:54.000 --> 05:18:58.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat. Thank you, Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker.

asr-005074
05:18:59.860 --> 05:19:09.700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Doon naman po sa mga suspended na mga permits, ano po ang ginagawa ng PRA dito sa sampu na ito?

asr-005075
05:19:09.780 --> 05:19:16.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Meron po ba tayong follow-through o hinaya-alaman po natin silang makakompleto ng kanilang mga requirements?

asr-005076
05:19:16.740 --> 05:19:19.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ano po yung timeline natin para sa sampu ito?

asr-005077
05:19:21.440 --> 05:19:42.320
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: About po sa mga suspended natin, depende po yun kung kailan nila matatapos yung ma-comply yung mga requirements na kailangan ma-submit po nila.

asr-005078
05:19:43.120 --> 05:19:46.720
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: So, wala po talaga siyang timeline.

asr-005079
05:19:47.560 --> 05:19:51.320
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Depende po yun kung mapapaaga nila na makapag-aaral.

asr-005080
05:19:51.440 --> 05:19:54.800
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Makakomply sila. Nasa sa kanila po yun, Your Honor.

asr-005081
05:19:55.500 --> 05:20:04.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Hindi po ba napapaso, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, yung mga ganitong application kung sakali pong hindi nakakakomply fully yung applicant?

asr-005082
05:20:06.440 --> 05:20:12.120
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Your Honor, depende po yun sa ECC kung papayagan nilang ma-extend.

asr-005083
05:20:13.560 --> 05:20:20.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, halimbawa po itong sampu na ito, hanggang kailan po natin naasahan na po pwede silang makakomply doon sa requirement?

asr-005084
05:20:21.440 --> 05:20:41.700
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ang live po ng ECC ay five years. So, after five years po at hindi pa sila nakapag-comply, pwede po silang i-apply for extension, Your Honor.

asr-005085
05:20:42.440 --> 05:20:45.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

asr-005086
05:20:45.560 --> 05:20:51.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakahalaga po kasi itong suspension na binanggit originally ng Presidente, which was eventually lifted.

asr-005087
05:20:51.440 --> 05:20:58.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi meron ding apat na malalaking kumpanya na natanggalan din ng suspension at nag-proceed yung kanilang mga proyekto.

asr-005088
05:20:59.240 --> 05:21:05.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At sa panahon po ngayon na tumitingin talaga ang pagbaha sa Metro Manila at karating pong mga probinsya natin,

asr-005089
05:21:05.600 --> 05:21:15.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: talaga pong isa sa tinitingnan ng ating mga kababayan na maaaring dahilan kung bakit ang baha ay hindi ganun kabilis mawala tulad dati na pagbumaha after a few hours

asr-005090
05:21:15.540 --> 05:21:20.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: or matagal na yung a few days ay bababa dahil po sa nangyayari yung mga developments na ito.

asr-005091
05:21:21.440 --> 05:21:31.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang tanong po natin ay, how can dredging and reclamation affect the worsening of flooding episodes in the country, particularly in NCR and our nearby provinces?

asr-005092
05:21:51.440 --> 05:22:05.080
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Kaya nga po, nire-require namin na subject po ay for hydrodynamic modeling, flooding studies, and hydraulic studies.

asr-005093
05:22:06.120 --> 05:22:11.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So ito pong studies na ito, sino po ang nagko-commission?

asr-005094
05:22:13.240 --> 05:22:15.100
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: UP po, Your Honor.

asr-005095
05:22:15.520 --> 05:22:17.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sino po ang nagko-commission sa UP?

asr-005096
05:22:20.320 --> 05:22:21.420
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yung proponent po.

asr-005097
05:22:21.440 --> 05:22:21.980
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Your Honor.

asr-005098
05:22:23.460 --> 05:22:31.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sige po, mukhang mahalaga po na sa sitwasyon po natin ngayon, hindi dapat sapat na mayroon lamang study na kinomission yung proponent.

asr-005099
05:22:31.680 --> 05:22:41.940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: The PRA should exercise due diligence in ensuring na ito po ay hindi makaka-apekto sa pagpapalala lalo ng baha sa Metro Manila at mga karating na po.

asr-005100
05:22:42.640 --> 05:22:50.940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Yung sumunod ko naman po ang tanong, Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker, ay paano po ang coastal defense ng mga reclaimed areas?

asr-005101
05:22:51.440 --> 05:23:02.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi po sila na ngayon yung bago na nasa coast natin. So ano po ang coastal defense mechanisms na mayroon, kung mayroon man, itong mga proyektong ito?

asr-005102
05:23:04.280 --> 05:23:11.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi baka po sa dulo, sila naman yung susunod na maging problema natin pagdating ng mga storm surge mula po sa area na yan.

asr-005111
05:23:25.000 --> 05:23:32.500
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Ah dati po kasi ang seawall natin ay 3 meters lang. So ngayon po, ginawa na po natin siyang 7 meters.

asr-005112
05:23:32.600 --> 05:23:40.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So sino po ang magkoconstruct ng seawall dito po sa mga reclaimed areas na ito? Sino po ang gagastos?

asr-005113
05:23:41.900 --> 05:23:45.220
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yung proponent na po, kasi po part po ito ng project.

asr-005114
05:23:45.600 --> 05:23:49.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kumusta po yung compliance nila dito po sa provision na ito ng kontrata?

asr-005115
05:23:49.340 --> 05:23:53.400
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Um, ongoing po, Your Honor.

asr-005116
05:23:56.160 --> 05:23:59.240
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: And well, monitored po yun, Your Honor.

asr-005117
05:24:00.600 --> 05:24:13.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, may request the PRA to submit a report on the compliance on the coastal defense measures that are installed or are being implemented by the proponents of the project.

asr-005118
05:24:14.420 --> 05:24:15.440
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-005119
05:24:15.440 --> 05:24:17.860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you very much, Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker.

asr-005120
05:24:17.860 --> 05:24:23.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: I cannot overemphasize yung fear ng mga kababayan natin sa lumalalang pagbaha na naranasan natin ngayon.

asr-005121
05:24:24.200 --> 05:24:34.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maaring patikim pa lang ito nangyayari sa atin at alam natin na isa sa tinitindahan ng ating mga kababayan ay mga pagkarami-raming reclamation projects na nangyayari sa Manila Bay.

asr-005122
05:24:34.900 --> 05:24:41.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kailangan natin suriin ang kaugnayan ng mga reclamation projects sa lumalalang pagbaha sa Metro Manila at mga karating na probinsya.

asr-005123
05:24:42.400 --> 05:24:45.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: We need a comprehensive approach to flood mitigation and management.

asr-005124
05:24:45.720 --> 05:24:47.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Hindi dapat inaaprobahan ng maramigyan.

asr-005125
05:24:47.860 --> 05:24:53.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa mga reclamation projects na walang maayos na impact assessment sa flooding sa mga komunidad at walang proper drainage.

asr-005126
05:24:54.520 --> 05:25:05.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nakababahala na ang total approved reclamation projects sa Manila Bay, 13 in total ay around 5,000 hectares or about 8% of the total land area of the National Capital Region.

asr-005127
05:25:05.200 --> 05:25:17.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero hanggang sa ngayon, wala tayong nakikita maayos na integration program para ting sa flood management between these projects and the LGUs around the Manila Bay.

asr-005128
05:25:17.860 --> 05:25:27.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Speaker, gusto po natin magpasalamat sa ating butihing sponsor at sana po ay makapag-comply ang PRA doon po sa nire-request natin ng mga dokumento.

asr-005129
05:25:27.520 --> 05:25:28.360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Marami pong salamat.

asr-005130
05:25:28.780 --> 05:25:30.680
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Marami salamat po, Your Honor.

asr-005131
05:25:31.280 --> 05:25:32.040
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

asr-005132
05:25:37.940 --> 05:25:42.940
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, I move to recognize the Honorable Sarah Jane Elago to interpolate the sponsor.

