asr-006345
06:32:45.580 --> 06:32:47.060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you for that, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-006346
06:32:48.160 --> 06:32:51.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: May I ask, the DMW also is requesting

asr-006347
06:32:51.000 --> 06:32:54.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: 60 million for OFW Servicio Ban, Caravan,

asr-006348
06:32:54.880 --> 06:32:58.060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: 60 million for International Labor Affairs,

asr-006349
06:32:58.220 --> 06:32:58.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: 180 million for...

asr-006350
06:32:59.720 --> 06:33:03.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: G, General Administration and Support Services,

asr-006351
06:33:03.380 --> 06:33:06.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: and 700 million for Key Services.

asr-006352
06:33:06.380 --> 06:33:08.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: For each component,

asr-006353
06:33:08.380 --> 06:33:11.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: what exact 2027 output will be delivered?

asr-006354
06:33:11.380 --> 06:33:14.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: How many OFWs will benefit?

asr-006355
06:33:14.380 --> 06:33:17.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And which items are already procurement ready

asr-006356
06:33:17.380 --> 06:33:19.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: or implementation ready?

asr-006364
06:33:43.780 --> 06:33:47.240
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Lahat Distinguished colleague, Madam Speaker,

asr-006365
06:33:47.240 --> 06:33:50.100
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: lahat po ay implementation ready na man na po.

asr-006366
06:33:50.660 --> 06:33:53.160
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: At ang mga servisyo caravan,

asr-006367
06:33:53.800 --> 06:33:55.460
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: ang target po at ang kaya,

asr-006368
06:33:55.460 --> 06:33:57.460
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: ang capacity po na pwedeng ma...

asr-006369
06:33:58.620 --> 06:33:59.560
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: or ang...

asr-006370
06:33:59.720 --> 06:34:13.800
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Pwede pong mag-benefit dito ay up to 100,000 po na OFWs dahil 20 different government agencies rin po ang nagbibigay po ng servisyo.

asr-006371
06:34:20.080 --> 06:34:22.520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you for that, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-006372
06:34:22.520 --> 06:34:37.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Sponsor, DMW's verification fees, fee revenues are already authorized under a special account.

asr-006373
06:34:38.280 --> 06:34:46.220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: For fiscal year 2026, Congress has already provided the authority in the GAA. No new congressional action is needed for each release.

asr-006374
06:34:47.080 --> 06:34:52.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: What is required is for DMW to submit the proper budget request and for DBM to act on it.

asr-006375
06:34:52.520 --> 06:35:06.560
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, Madam Speaker, may I ask our Distinguished Colleague, how much did DMW request from DBM for the verification fee fund for fiscal year 2026?

asr-006376
06:35:07.140 --> 06:35:11.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: How much was actually released and how much remains pending or unreleased?

asr-006377
06:35:22.520 --> 06:35:47.440
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, para po sa verification fee fund,

asr-006378
06:35:47.440 --> 06:35:52.440
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: na bigyan po ang DMW ng P777 million.

asr-006379
06:35:52.520 --> 06:36:00.500
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Para po sa P777 million, ang requested po sana nila ay P826 million.

asr-006380
06:36:01.220 --> 06:36:15.120
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: At as far as the utilization po, 100% utilized na po ang verification fee fund and that's around P580 million po for P2026.

asr-006381
06:36:15.940 --> 06:36:22.340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kunti na lang pala po, Madam Sponsor, from the request to what was actually given.

asr-006382
06:36:22.520 --> 06:36:26.740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Was there any reason why they did not give what was actually requested?

asr-006383
06:36:35.840 --> 06:36:44.260
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, unfortunately, meron pong mga ceiling din na set by DBM.

asr-006384
06:36:45.300 --> 06:36:45.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ceiling?

asr-006385
06:36:46.820 --> 06:36:51.840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But if you are doing, actually, wala dapat ceiling kung 100% utilized.

asr-006386
06:36:51.840 --> 06:36:56.040
Rep. Roberto Nazal: You were able to utilize 100%, correct?

asr-006387
06:36:59.260 --> 06:37:04.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And these are earmarked funds specifically intended for this use.

asr-006388
06:37:04.540 --> 06:37:15.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So kung ito po ay na-utilize natin at 100%, there is no reason for DBM not to give you the requested amount.

asr-006389
06:37:15.080 --> 06:37:19.760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Actually, kung na-utilize po siya bago matapos yung fiscal year,

asr-006390
06:37:19.760 --> 06:37:23.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: pwede, ang alam ko, pwede po kayo mag-request ulit.

asr-006391
06:37:24.040 --> 06:37:27.460
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And dapat ibigay po nila yun kasi yung earmarked funds are intended for you.

asr-006392
06:37:29.300 --> 06:37:39.820
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Yes po. Kaya po, tumaas rin po ng P777 million po from P580 million po last year.

asr-006393
06:37:40.080 --> 06:37:44.420
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: For 2027, P777 million naman po.

asr-006394
06:37:44.420 --> 06:37:49.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But are you aware, Madam Sponsor, that the DMW, once na-utilize,

asr-006395
06:37:49.760 --> 06:37:51.060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: you may request again?

asr-006396
06:37:58.220 --> 06:38:02.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kailan po nyo na-utilize at 100%?

asr-006397
06:38:19.760 --> 06:38:26.760
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: As of July, or sorry, August 2026 po, utilized na po.

asr-006398
06:38:27.460 --> 06:38:29.280
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: 100% utilized na po.

asr-006399
06:38:29.360 --> 06:38:34.340
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: And currently, yung ginagamit na lang po ay yung general fund, the P380 million.

asr-006400
06:38:34.480 --> 06:38:36.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Magkano pa po ang remaining sa earmarked funds ninyo?

asr-006401
06:38:38.720 --> 06:38:40.280
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: 100% utilized na po.

asr-006402
06:38:40.300 --> 06:38:44.140
Rep. Roberto Nazal: No, no, no. I mean, on the fund itself.

asr-006403
06:38:46.100 --> 06:38:48.120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Hindi yung nagamit nyo at saka yung binigay.

asr-006404
06:38:48.220 --> 06:38:49.600
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yung account.

asr-006405
06:38:49.760 --> 06:38:51.060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Nung earmarked funds yun.

asr-006423
06:39:21.060 --> 06:39:26.220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Parang as of 2025, tama po ba? Ang ending balance was 5.6 billion?

asr-006424
06:39:38.440 --> 06:39:44.900
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: With the indulgence of our distinguished colleague and our sponsor, please wrap up.

asr-006425
06:39:44.900 --> 06:39:58.440
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, currently po ang balance sa Treasury ay 4.36 billion po para po sa verification fee.

asr-006426
06:39:58.440 --> 06:40:04.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So yan po ang sinasabi natin, yung pera po under verification fees is sa inyo po yan.

asr-006427
06:40:05.620 --> 06:40:13.520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And if naubos nyo na by July, yung 100%, ang sabi po ng DBM, pwede po kayo mag-request ulit.

asr-006428
06:40:14.900 --> 06:40:21.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So you still have 4.6 billion, pwede po kayo mag-request ulit para lang magamit para sa ating mga OFWs.

asr-006429
06:40:21.860 --> 06:40:29.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So in closing, Madam Speaker, our questions are intended to establish the basis for supporting these requests,

asr-006430
06:40:31.380 --> 06:40:35.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: not to deprive the DMW and OWA of the resources they need.

asr-006431
06:40:37.740 --> 06:40:44.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Speaker, CPBRD's figures show that DMW and OWA substantially improved their obligation and disbursement

asr-006432
06:40:44.900 --> 06:40:51.220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: performance in 2025. The remaining audit and implementation issues are being addressed

asr-006433
06:40:51.220 --> 06:40:56.800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: through stronger controls and accountability. Madam Speaker, subject to the specific outputs,

asr-006434
06:40:56.940 --> 06:41:02.060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: implementation schedules, safeguards, and quarterly reporting commitments placed on record,

asr-006435
06:41:02.960 --> 06:41:10.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I manifest my support for OWA's revised 2 billion request and DMW's separate 2 billion priority package.

asr-006436
06:41:10.820 --> 06:41:13.220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Speaker, these are not luxuries.

asr-006437
06:41:14.900 --> 06:41:21.320
Rep. Roberto Nazal: They are needed for emergency repatriation, welfare and legal assistance, lawyers and doctors reintegration,

asr-006438
06:41:21.840 --> 06:41:29.340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: the OFW hospital, safer offices, frontline overseas operations, seafarer and airport facilities,

asr-006439
06:41:29.980 --> 06:41:33.840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: skills upgrading, and scholarships for OFW children.

asr-006440
06:41:34.720 --> 06:41:41.020
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So Madam Speaker, I respectfully urge the favorable consideration of these priority requests

asr-006441
06:41:41.020 --> 06:41:44.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: with the assurance that every peso must be translated.

asr-006442
06:41:44.180 --> 06:41:47.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: into actual service for OFWs and their families.

asr-006443
06:41:48.180 --> 06:41:48.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Maraming salamat po.

asr-006444
06:41:51.300 --> 06:41:52.360
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-006445
06:41:53.440 --> 06:41:58.520
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, I move to recognize the Honorable Sarah Jane Elago to interpolate the sponsor.

asr-006446
06:41:59.240 --> 06:42:05.760
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Sarah Jane Elago of Gabriela Women's Party List is hereby recognized for her interpolation.

asr-006447
06:42:08.260 --> 06:42:10.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat Madam Speaker.

asr-006448
06:42:10.960 --> 06:42:14.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: I'd like to start with the introduction.

asr-006449
06:42:14.780 --> 06:42:18.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Increase of minimum wages for Filipino domestic helpers.

asr-006450
06:42:19.940 --> 06:42:28.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: In August 2025, Madam Speaker, the DMW issued Advisory No. 25, Series of 2025,

asr-006451
06:42:29.300 --> 06:42:36.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: increasing the minimum wage for migrant domestic helpers from 400 U.S. dollars to 500 U.S. dollars.

asr-006452
06:42:36.760 --> 06:42:43.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Aside from incorporating the new minimum wage into the employment contracts processed by the DMW,

asr-006453
06:42:44.180 --> 06:42:51.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: the advisory also directed migrant workers' offices to engage with host governments and foreign recruitment agencies

asr-006454
06:42:51.940 --> 06:42:57.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: to ensure that the new minimum wage is implemented in their respective countries.

asr-006455
06:42:57.420 --> 06:43:05.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Aside from incorporating the increased minimum wage into the employment contracts processed by the DMW,

asr-006456
06:43:06.520 --> 06:43:13.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: may we know from the distinguished sponsor, how does the DMW ensure that migrant workers are actually paid,

asr-006457
06:43:13.480 --> 06:43:19.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at least the minimum monthly wage mandated under Advisory No. 25?

asr-006458
06:43:28.240 --> 06:43:30.600
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006459
06:43:31.300 --> 06:43:42.760
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: lahat po ng mga kontrata ay rinireview at meron din po tayo mga labor attaches on ground para po i-address po itong mga concerns ito.

asr-006460
06:43:43.480 --> 06:43:45.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat po.

asr-006461
06:43:45.280 --> 06:43:53.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kung meron po tayong active monitoring, listahan ng mga kaso at ang status nito, ay hihingin din po ng ating representasyon.

asr-006462
06:43:53.520 --> 06:43:58.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Madam Speaker, sa iba pong mahalaga din na concern,

asr-006463
06:43:58.840 --> 06:44:02.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang pagdademand ng child support from an OFW parent.

asr-006464
06:44:03.280 --> 06:44:12.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: The Philippines has been a party to the Convention on the International Recovery of Child Support and Other Forms of Family Maintenance.

asr-006465
06:44:13.480 --> 06:44:22.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, while the central authority of the Philippines for this particular convention is the Department of Social Welfare and Development,

asr-006466
06:44:22.740 --> 06:44:30.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: may we know what the role of the DMW is in implementing this obligation?

asr-006467
06:44:43.480 --> 06:44:52.060
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006468
06:44:52.060 --> 06:44:58.060
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: every time po meron claims for child support para po sa ating mga OFWs.

asr-006469
06:45:00.000 --> 06:45:20.340
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: CMW po, sinusummon po ang ating OFW at we direct them to our legal attachés or our labor attachés para po magampanan nila yung kailangan nilang ibigay na child support.

asr-006470
06:45:20.340 --> 06:45:34.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, what particular item in the budget is used for this assistance for those demanding child or spousal support from an OFW parent?

asr-006471
06:45:50.340 --> 06:46:03.960
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Distinguished Colleague, ito po ay nagagaling sa Labor Attachés Welfare Services Fund. Yun po nagagaling ang pondo.

asr-006472
06:46:04.680 --> 06:46:12.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat po. Paano naman po yung mga lugar na wala pong Migrant Workers Office? What about those jurisdictions?

asr-006473
06:46:12.720 --> 06:46:19.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: How do you coordinate with the Department of Foreign Affairs and other relevant agencies to help?

asr-006474
06:46:19.660 --> 06:46:21.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: With this matter.

asr-006475
06:46:23.420 --> 06:46:42.540
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, we work closely po with DFA at ang ating mga embassies sa mga lugar na wala po tayong mga MWOs with their assistance to nationals units.

asr-006476
06:46:43.440 --> 06:46:49.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat Madam Speaker. At nasilip din po natin sa DFA na mababa yung utilization.

asr-006477
06:46:49.660 --> 06:46:51.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nang assistance to nationals.

asr-006478
06:46:51.580 --> 06:46:59.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Samantalang sa amin din pong mga lumalapit sa ating office, marami din pong mga nangangailangan pa sana ng mga assistance.

asr-006479
06:46:59.640 --> 06:47:09.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po sana po, bukod dun sa close coordination, yung pondo na nandyan na at nakalaan para sa ganitong tipo ng mga assistance ay magamit natin para makatulong.

asr-006480
06:47:10.720 --> 06:47:19.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Now Madam Chair, under the Expanded Solo Parent Act, the spouse, family member, or guardian of the child of an OFW,

asr-006481
06:47:19.660 --> 06:47:25.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: who falls under low or semi-skilled worker category, is considered a solo parent.

asr-006482
06:47:26.060 --> 06:47:34.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: In supporting our migrant workers, does the DMW have programs that also assist solo parents?

asr-006483
06:47:34.760 --> 06:47:38.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Paari po ba natin malaman kung ano yung mga espesipiko na programa na ito?

asr-006484
06:47:41.820 --> 06:47:44.180
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006485
06:47:46.820 --> 06:47:49.500
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: currently the department addresses these cases.

asr-006486
06:47:49.660 --> 06:47:55.440
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Through a combination of family support, livelihood, employment, and referral services.

asr-006487
06:47:56.400 --> 06:48:04.980
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: And under Kalinga, solo parents and primary caregivers may access psychosocial and family-oriented interventions.

asr-006488
06:48:05.880 --> 06:48:14.040
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Under Kabuhayan, they may be matched with livelihood or employment pathways suited to their caregiving responsibilities.

asr-006489
06:48:14.040 --> 06:48:17.480
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Where additional social services are needed,

asr-006490
06:48:17.720 --> 06:48:19.240
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Kaagapay and the National Reintegration,

asr-006491
06:48:19.660 --> 06:48:25.840
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: allow DMW to refer the solo parent to appropriate partner agencies.

asr-006492
06:48:26.360 --> 06:48:35.940
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: So far, 78 beneficiaries po na bigyan sa 2025 at 326 beneficiaries po sa 2026.

asr-006493
06:48:36.480 --> 06:48:37.480
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Yan po ang mga programa.

asr-006494
06:48:38.120 --> 06:48:44.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang nabanggit ng mga programa, Madam Speaker, malaki din po yung hiningi ng DMW, ng OWA para sa mga ito.

asr-006495
06:48:44.320 --> 06:48:48.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit, hindi pa rin po sapat talaga dun sa laki ng pangangailangan,

asr-006496
06:48:48.600 --> 06:48:49.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung lalaan na pondo.

asr-006497
06:48:49.920 --> 06:48:55.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya, kung may pagkakataon na taasan yung pondo ng mga proyekto na ito,

asr-006498
06:48:55.200 --> 06:48:57.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay susuportahan ng ating representasyon.

asr-006499
06:48:57.840 --> 06:49:00.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman po, nabanggit din po kanina ng mga nauna sa atin,

asr-006500
06:49:01.200 --> 06:49:04.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung tungkol sa halaga ng ating mga reintegration programs.

asr-006501
06:49:05.460 --> 06:49:07.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May we know from the distinguished sponsor,

asr-006502
06:49:08.320 --> 06:49:13.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: what the particular programs are of DMW and OWA,

asr-006503
06:49:13.760 --> 06:49:17.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: specifically intended for older migrant workers.

asr-006504
06:49:18.600 --> 06:49:27.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: We have programs that specifically address a retirement and other post-employment support.

asr-006506
06:50:05.720 --> 06:50:08.120
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague,

asr-006507
06:50:08.120 --> 06:50:17.180
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: for older returnees, DMW combines financial literacy, livelihood support, skills transition, mentoring,

asr-006508
06:50:17.860 --> 06:50:18.220
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: employment,

asr-006509
06:50:18.600 --> 06:50:20.960
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: facilitation, and social protection referrals,

asr-006510
06:50:21.540 --> 06:50:24.100
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: depending on the worker's capacity and plans.

asr-006511
06:50:25.720 --> 06:50:32.200
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: The programs under Kaalaman can help the OFW acquire or adapt skills,

asr-006512
06:50:32.200 --> 06:50:37.220
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: while Kabuhayan offers livelihood and entrepreneurship pathways.

asr-006513
06:50:38.340 --> 06:50:43.240
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: FAS-SBMT, or Financial Awareness and Small Business Mentoring Training,

asr-006514
06:50:43.380 --> 06:50:48.340
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: is also relevant for older returnees who wish to manage

asr-006515
06:50:48.340 --> 06:50:51.460
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: savings or transition into small enterprise.

asr-006516
06:50:51.680 --> 06:50:56.700
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: And so far, it's served 4,100 beneficiaries in 2024.

asr-006517
06:50:56.700 --> 06:51:02.440
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: In 2025, 11,138 beneficiaries.

asr-006518
06:51:02.860 --> 06:51:10.040
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: And so far, from January to August of 2026, 7,309 beneficiaries po ito.

asr-006519
06:51:10.980 --> 06:51:12.400
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: At sa OWA naman po,

asr-006520
06:51:12.400 --> 06:51:12.460
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: ito po.

asr-006521
06:51:18.340 --> 06:51:21.680
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: At sa OWA naman po,

asr-006522
06:51:21.680 --> 06:51:24.140
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: ang mga reintegration services rin naman nila,

asr-006523
06:51:24.600 --> 06:51:38.060
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: nakapag-natulungan po ang 410,591 families in 2025.

asr-006524
06:51:39.140 --> 06:51:41.280
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: OFWs and their families po.

asr-006525
06:51:41.660 --> 06:51:44.660
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: So kasama po dyan ang Family Development Support Program,

asr-006526
06:51:45.120 --> 06:51:47.600
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Capacity Building for LG Europe Peso,

asr-006527
06:51:48.340 --> 06:51:52.800
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Enhanced EDT and Demo Farm Visitation,

asr-006528
06:51:53.140 --> 06:51:54.460
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: iba-iba po ang mga programa.

asr-006529
06:51:56.260 --> 06:52:00.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Now, Madam Speaker, kung meron po ang ating DMW at OWA

asr-006530
06:52:00.500 --> 06:52:04.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng detalye batay sa edad, sa kapasidad,

asr-006531
06:52:04.700 --> 06:52:05.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa profesyon,

asr-006532
06:52:05.620 --> 06:52:10.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay mainam po ito para makatulong po sa ating mga tinatalakay ngayon

asr-006533
06:52:10.060 --> 06:52:11.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng mga panukalang batas.

asr-006534
06:52:12.020 --> 06:52:15.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung isa dyan ay yung pagpapalakas ng mga reintegration program.

asr-006535
06:52:15.860 --> 06:52:18.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero meron po dyan isang probesyon na,

asr-006536
06:52:18.340 --> 06:52:22.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi pa naisama, na sa tingin ko po ay isa sa mga panawagan

asr-006537
06:52:22.760 --> 06:52:25.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng ating mga bumalik na mga OFWs.

asr-006538
06:52:26.260 --> 06:52:31.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May we know, Madam Speaker, what the positions of DMW and OWA are

asr-006539
06:52:31.060 --> 06:52:35.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: on establishing a retirement fund for OFWs

asr-006540
06:52:35.840 --> 06:52:38.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: who are no longer able to work

asr-006541
06:52:38.120 --> 06:52:44.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: or have reached a certain age at which they can no longer perform their jobs?

asr-006542
06:52:48.340 --> 06:53:01.880
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006543
06:53:01.880 --> 06:53:10.180
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: currently po ang DMW nagpapartner po with SSS

asr-006544
06:53:10.180 --> 06:53:14.540
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: para po makapag-establish ang mga pension funds

asr-006545
06:53:14.540 --> 06:53:17.780
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: para po sa ating mga retiring OFWs.

asr-006546
06:53:17.820 --> 06:53:18.320
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: And at the same time,

asr-006547
06:53:18.340 --> 06:53:21.340
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: they are also helping develop legislation

asr-006548
06:53:21.340 --> 06:53:28.340
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: para po may sa batas na ang ating retirement funds for our OFWs.

asr-006549
06:53:30.040 --> 06:53:34.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito ay sinusuportahan ng buong-buo ng DMW at OWA, Madam Speaker.

asr-006550
06:53:35.460 --> 06:53:35.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes.

asr-006551
06:53:36.780 --> 06:53:38.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ngayon naman, Madam Speaker,

asr-006552
06:53:38.840 --> 06:53:40.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: napakahalaga rin po nito sa atin

asr-006553
06:53:40.500 --> 06:53:42.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang mabalitaan tayo tungkol sa implementation

asr-006554
06:53:42.760 --> 06:53:47.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng Magna Carta for seafarers.

asr-006555
06:53:47.360 --> 06:53:47.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes.

asr-006556
06:53:47.440 --> 06:53:51.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Has DMW started implementing the Magna Carta?

asr-006557
06:53:51.640 --> 06:53:57.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: If yes, what has DMW changed in its policies and regulations

asr-006558
06:53:57.340 --> 06:53:58.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: because of this Magna Carta?

asr-006559
06:54:00.460 --> 06:54:04.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May we also know what the challenges are

asr-006560
06:54:04.640 --> 06:54:08.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: in terms of the implementation of this Magna Carta,

asr-006561
06:54:08.200 --> 06:54:13.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: especially now that we're in the first year of its implementation?

asr-006562
06:54:17.440 --> 06:54:21.380
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker,

asr-006563
06:54:21.580 --> 06:54:22.640
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006564
06:54:25.140 --> 06:54:29.220
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: so far po ang DMW nag-issue po ng sea-based

asr-006565
06:54:29.220 --> 06:54:32.960
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: or nag-update po ng pag-issue ng sea-based rules

asr-006566
06:54:32.960 --> 06:54:35.400
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: at na-standardize yun po ang mga kontrata

asr-006567
06:54:35.400 --> 06:54:38.420
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: ng ating mga seafarers at the same time,

asr-006568
06:54:38.460 --> 06:54:39.580
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: ang fisher folks po.

asr-006569
06:54:40.480 --> 06:54:42.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nag-update, ibig sabihin po,

asr-006570
06:54:42.840 --> 06:54:46.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ongoing yung ating shipping?

asr-006571
06:54:46.140 --> 06:54:46.880
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Yeah.

asr-006572
06:54:47.440 --> 06:54:48.600
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Issued last June po.

asr-006573
06:54:49.220 --> 06:54:51.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: It was issued June this year?

asr-006574
06:54:51.660 --> 06:54:51.980
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Yes.

asr-006575
06:54:52.200 --> 06:54:52.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alright.

asr-006576
06:54:52.580 --> 06:54:53.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: And has already been issued.

asr-006577
06:54:54.860 --> 06:54:55.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alright.

asr-006578
06:54:55.680 --> 06:54:58.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Now, mangingin na lang po tayo ng ulat,

asr-006579
06:54:58.740 --> 06:55:01.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng pinakauling ulat dito ng DMW

asr-006580
06:55:01.860 --> 06:55:05.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung kumusta na ang ating Magna Carta.

asr-006581
06:55:05.620 --> 06:55:06.720
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: We will provide the report.

asr-006582
06:55:07.220 --> 06:55:07.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes.

asr-006583
06:55:09.160 --> 06:55:12.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nais ko lang din pong maibahagi sa ating kapulungan.

asr-006584
06:55:13.080 --> 06:55:15.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Naging vocal din po ang aming representation

asr-006585
06:55:15.460 --> 06:55:17.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mula sa Gabriela Women's Party.

asr-006586
06:55:17.440 --> 06:55:20.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tungkol sa provision ng Magna Carta na ito,

asr-006587
06:55:21.340 --> 06:55:24.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung saan po yung monetary reward

asr-006588
06:55:24.240 --> 06:55:27.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: of the seafarers are put in escrow

asr-006589
06:55:27.480 --> 06:55:29.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pending the finality of judgment

asr-006590
06:55:29.400 --> 06:55:31.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: which can take years.

asr-006591
06:55:31.420 --> 06:55:33.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, that particular provision,

asr-006592
06:55:34.200 --> 06:55:35.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa tingin po natin,

asr-006593
06:55:35.560 --> 06:55:38.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dapat ding ma-review ng kapulungan na ito.

asr-006594
06:55:39.360 --> 06:55:43.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At makakatulong po yung inyong implementation so far

asr-006595
06:55:43.520 --> 06:55:46.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para makita ba natin kung dapat po itong tanggalin,

asr-006596
06:55:47.440 --> 06:55:51.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dito sa batas na ito.

asr-006597
06:55:52.640 --> 06:55:53.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Madam Speaker,

asr-006598
06:55:55.000 --> 06:55:58.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol po sa naiulat na blacklisting

asr-006599
06:55:58.940 --> 06:56:00.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng mga seafarers

asr-006600
06:56:00.900 --> 06:56:05.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kapag sila po ay nag-a-avail ng kanilang right to refuse sailing.

asr-006601
06:56:05.640 --> 06:56:08.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakarating po sa ating office na kapag sila daw po,

asr-006602
06:56:08.900 --> 06:56:09.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dalawang bagay, no.

asr-006603
06:56:11.280 --> 06:56:13.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Una, may mga pagkakataon daw po

asr-006604
06:56:13.940 --> 06:56:17.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na hindi nila ma-exercise itong kanilang karapatan,

asr-006605
06:56:17.440 --> 06:56:18.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng kanilang right to refuse sailing.

asr-006606
06:56:18.380 --> 06:56:21.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil pag majority daw po ng mga seafarer

asr-006607
06:56:21.820 --> 06:56:23.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay bumoto na tumuloy pa rin,

asr-006608
06:56:23.700 --> 06:56:25.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay tumutuloy pa rin sila

asr-006609
06:56:25.000 --> 06:56:31.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na hindi po nasasangalang yung kanilang karapatan na tumanggi.

asr-006610
06:56:32.220 --> 06:56:34.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, yung pangalawa naman po,

asr-006611
06:56:34.540 --> 06:56:35.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay kapag sila ay nag-a-avail,

asr-006612
06:56:36.500 --> 06:56:38.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nag-exercise po ng kanilang right to refuse sailing,

asr-006613
06:56:38.980 --> 06:56:41.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagbalik po nila dito sa Pilipinas at aalis na,

asr-006614
06:56:42.100 --> 06:56:45.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay nalalaman po nila na sila ay blacklisted na.

asr-006615
06:56:46.320 --> 06:56:47.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron pong,

asr-006616
06:56:47.440 --> 06:56:51.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: statement ang DMW tungkol dito

asr-006617
06:56:51.260 --> 06:56:53.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at wini-welcome naman po ng ating representation.

asr-006618
06:56:54.680 --> 06:56:57.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: The DMW called for Filipino seafarers

asr-006619
06:56:57.460 --> 06:57:00.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: who refuse to sail to high-risk areas

asr-006620
06:57:00.400 --> 06:57:04.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: not to be discriminated against in future employment.

asr-006621
06:57:05.220 --> 06:57:07.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: They must also receive proper compensation

asr-006622
06:57:07.580 --> 06:57:10.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: and free repatriation to the Philippines.

asr-006623
06:57:11.540 --> 06:57:17.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May we know po what the DMW has done so far.

asr-006624
06:57:17.440 --> 06:57:22.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: To ensure that the Filipinos won't be discriminated against

asr-006625
06:57:22.620 --> 06:57:26.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: when they exercise their right to refuse sailing.

asr-006626
06:57:27.460 --> 06:57:29.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Especially po in high-risk areas now.

asr-006627
06:57:29.700 --> 06:57:29.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Thank you.

asr-006628
06:57:45.280 --> 06:57:46.360
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker,

asr-006629
06:57:46.360 --> 06:57:47.980
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006630
06:57:47.980 --> 06:57:52.080
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: So for the manning agencies na meron pong mga violations,

asr-006631
06:57:52.080 --> 06:57:57.360
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: DMW would subject them to an investigation

asr-006632
06:57:57.360 --> 06:58:00.960
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: and also subject them to violation fees.

asr-006633
06:58:06.080 --> 06:58:06.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker,

asr-006634
06:58:06.580 --> 06:58:08.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pag meron ba silang violation,

asr-006635
06:58:08.020 --> 06:58:09.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ano pong mangyayari?

asr-006636
06:58:09.000 --> 06:58:10.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bawal na po silang pag-operate?

asr-006637
06:58:10.880 --> 06:58:12.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Masasara po ba?

asr-006638
06:58:12.260 --> 06:58:13.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Masususpend muna?

asr-006639
06:58:16.360 --> 06:58:21.460
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker,

asr-006640
06:58:21.460 --> 06:58:23.260
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006641
06:58:23.260 --> 06:58:26.500
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Pwede po masuspend ang manning agency

asr-006642
06:58:26.500 --> 06:58:28.500
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: at kung paulit-ulit po

asr-006643
06:58:28.500 --> 06:58:30.960
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: or patuloy pa rin po ang violation,

asr-006644
06:58:30.960 --> 06:58:33.580
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: pwede pong makancel po ang kanilang lisensya.

asr-006645
06:58:33.580 --> 06:58:35.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker,

asr-006646
06:58:35.060 --> 06:58:37.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ano po yung basis po natin

asr-006647
06:58:37.360 --> 06:58:38.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng ganitong tipo ng mga

asr-006648
06:58:38.940 --> 06:58:41.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: prov, penalties,

asr-006649
06:58:41.700 --> 06:58:45.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: standards at saka yung graduated penalties po

asr-006650
06:58:45.920 --> 06:58:48.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na nabanggit po ninyo.

asr-006651
06:58:48.360 --> 06:58:49.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Saan po natin yan makikita?

asr-006652
06:59:01.000 --> 06:59:02.120
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker,

asr-006653
06:59:02.340 --> 06:59:03.320
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: distinguished colleagues,

asr-006654
06:59:04.580 --> 06:59:05.840
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: ito po ay base sa

asr-006655
06:59:05.840 --> 06:59:07.820
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: sea-based rules po na

asr-006656
06:59:07.820 --> 06:59:09.560
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: in-issue natin noong

asr-006657
06:59:09.560 --> 06:59:11.820
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: June 2026 lang po.

asr-006658
06:59:12.340 --> 06:59:13.100
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: And so far,

asr-006659
06:59:13.100 --> 06:59:16.420
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: 1,300 po

asr-006660
06:59:16.420 --> 06:59:17.100
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Filipino seafarers

asr-006661
06:59:17.980 --> 06:59:20.080
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: refused to sail

asr-006662
06:59:20.080 --> 06:59:20.720
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: or traverse.

asr-006663
06:59:21.160 --> 06:59:22.520
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Ito po ang so far.

asr-006664
06:59:24.920 --> 06:59:26.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat po.

asr-006665
06:59:27.180 --> 06:59:28.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bukod po sa ganyang information,

asr-006666
06:59:28.640 --> 06:59:30.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nahihingin din po natin sa ating

asr-006667
06:59:30.360 --> 06:59:33.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga departamento, nandito rin po

asr-006668
06:59:33.120 --> 06:59:34.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung ulat na

asr-006669
06:59:34.380 --> 06:59:37.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung karapatan po ng mga seafarer

asr-006670
06:59:37.240 --> 06:59:39.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na malaman kung saan po yung

asr-006671
06:59:39.100 --> 06:59:40.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ruta na dadaanan ng kanilang

asr-006672
06:59:40.920 --> 06:59:42.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga vessels. Marami daw po

asr-006673
06:59:42.840 --> 06:59:45.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi binibigay sa kanilang information

asr-006674
06:59:45.020 --> 06:59:46.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: till nakasakay na sila.

asr-006675
06:59:47.340 --> 06:59:49.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: In fact po, nakatanggap din po

asr-006676
06:59:49.360 --> 06:59:50.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tayo na balita na

asr-006677
06:59:50.740 --> 06:59:51.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung

asr-006678
06:59:51.920 --> 06:59:55.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: masakit po sa loob na

asr-006679
06:59:55.120 --> 06:59:57.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: namatay, nasi-farers

asr-006680
06:59:57.000 --> 06:59:58.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na taga Calamba, Laguna,

asr-006681
06:59:59.660 --> 07:00:00.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi po

asr-006682
07:00:00.000 --> 07:00:05.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung nila alam ang ruta ng barko, nasa war zones, nasa high-risk areas po pala dadaan.

asr-006683
07:00:05.180 --> 07:00:08.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So yung ganito pong karapatan ng ating mga seafarer,

asr-006684
07:00:08.160 --> 07:00:16.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dapat matiyak po natin na masasakatuparan at hindi pangarap lamang para sa ating mga seafarers.

asr-006685
07:00:18.240 --> 07:00:20.520
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006686
07:00:21.200 --> 07:00:29.860
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: kung meron pong violations or kung meron pong mga sitwasyon na hindi po alam ng ating seafarer kung totoong ruta,

asr-006687
07:00:30.000 --> 07:00:38.760
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: ng kanilang pupuntuhan, pwede pong isubject po ng DMW into investigation, again, ang violators po.

asr-006688
07:00:40.600 --> 07:00:45.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, Madam Speaker, narinig po natin yung mga nag-exercise ng kanilang right to refuse sailing.

asr-006689
07:00:46.580 --> 07:00:53.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pwede niyo po ba kami i-update kung sa ngayon po, yung mga seafarers na gustong makauwi, ay nakauwi na po ba?

asr-006690
07:00:54.940 --> 07:00:57.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ilang request po yung inyong natanggap?

asr-006691
07:00:57.980 --> 07:01:03.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tapos po, yung bilang din po ng mga seafarers na nakauwi na,

asr-006692
07:01:05.020 --> 07:01:07.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ingin po sana ng representation na ito yung breakdown.

asr-006693
07:01:09.800 --> 07:01:12.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagkatapos po ng ating deliberation, ay yung hapon.

asr-006694
07:01:12.420 --> 07:01:13.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, we will oblige.

asr-006695
07:01:14.620 --> 07:01:16.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming maraming salamat po, Madam Speaker.

asr-006696
07:01:16.760 --> 07:01:24.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At muli, ang representation po na ito ay sumusuporta sa pagdadagdag ng pondo para sa Action Fund.

asr-006697
07:01:25.420 --> 07:01:27.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Noway yung mga hindi pa po nakakakuha.

asr-006698
07:01:27.440 --> 07:01:29.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang kanilang mga Action Fund ay makakuha na.

asr-006699
07:01:29.660 --> 07:01:35.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alam ko po, hindi madali ang sitwasyon, hindi lang dito sa bansa, kundi sa pandaig dito.

asr-006700
07:01:36.040 --> 07:01:43.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya nga, kinakailangan at maasam po natin, habang tinataasan yung suporta para sa mga migrant workers,

asr-006701
07:01:43.180 --> 07:01:49.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dapat higit natin tinataasan yung suporta para sa disenting trabaho dito sa Pilipinas,

asr-006702
07:01:49.400 --> 07:01:52.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nakabubuhay na sahod para sa ating mga manggagawang Pilipinas.

asr-006703
07:01:52.860 --> 07:01:56.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming maraming salamat, Madam Speaker. Maraming salamat sa ating distinguished sponsor.

asr-006704
07:01:57.440 --> 07:01:58.240
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Maraming salamat.

asr-006705
07:02:01.480 --> 07:02:02.460
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-006706
07:02:03.300 --> 07:02:08.180
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, I move to recognize the Honorable Dada Kiramizmula to interpolate the sponsor.

asr-006707
07:02:09.320 --> 07:02:14.880
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Dada Kiramizmula of Partilistak Bayan is hereby recognized for her interpolation.

asr-006708
07:02:17.180 --> 07:02:20.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

asr-006709
07:02:20.480 --> 07:02:23.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Assalamualaikum warahmatullahi wabarakatuhu.

asr-006710
07:02:23.800 --> 07:02:27.260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: I have a few questions on the mass deportations.

asr-006711
07:02:27.440 --> 07:02:29.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: of Filipinos in the United States.

asr-006712
07:02:30.780 --> 07:02:35.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, distinguished sponsor, my office has received reports

asr-006713
07:02:35.340 --> 07:02:42.200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ng ating mga Filipino seafarers na under sa Magsaysay Maritime Corporation

asr-006714
07:02:42.200 --> 07:02:49.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at nagtatrabaho sa Princess Cruises Limited ay sinearch ng walang warrant.

asr-006715
07:02:50.260 --> 07:02:53.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kinukuha ang kanilang mga gamit gaya ng cellphone

asr-006716
07:02:53.520 --> 07:02:57.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at inaakusahan ng krimen ng walang due process at ebidensya.

asr-006717
07:02:57.440 --> 07:03:06.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa parehong linggo, sila ay dinedeport, pabalik sa Pilipinas.

asr-006718
07:03:06.620 --> 07:03:14.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Paulit-ulit na nangyayari ito bilang bahagi ng operational tidal wave ng Trump government sa US.

asr-006719
07:03:15.500 --> 07:03:24.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, what is the DMW's response to the mass deportations of Filipino seafarers

asr-006720
07:03:24.540 --> 07:03:27.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: in the United States under operational tidal wave?

asr-006721
07:03:27.440 --> 07:03:41.900
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, habang rinerespeto po ng DMW ang sovereignty at mga batas ng ibang bansa,

asr-006722
07:03:42.600 --> 07:03:49.880
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: nananatiling pong committed ang ating Philippine government para protektahan ang mga karapatan,

asr-006723
07:03:49.980 --> 07:03:54.700
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: ang welfare and due process ng ating mga Filipino seafarers.

asr-006724
07:03:54.700 --> 07:03:57.140
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Lalong-lalo na po sa mga ganitong sitwasyon.

asr-006725
07:03:57.440 --> 07:04:06.600
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: We must also distinguish among an allegation, an immigration action, and a criminal filing.

asr-006726
07:04:07.240 --> 07:04:11.880
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: The department will not prejudge the cases of our returning seafarers,

asr-006727
07:04:12.200 --> 07:04:17.020
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: particularly when no criminal charge or conviction has been established.

asr-006728
07:04:18.360 --> 07:04:24.660
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: The DMW's responsibility is to ensure that affected workers receive appropriate assistance,

asr-006729
07:04:24.660 --> 07:04:27.420
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: that their cases are properly documented,

asr-006730
07:04:27.440 --> 07:04:34.440
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: and that the necessary coordination is undertaken with the relevant Philippine and foreign authorities,

asr-006731
07:04:35.160 --> 07:04:37.960
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: consistent with the applicable laws and procedures.

asr-006732
07:04:39.420 --> 07:04:47.740
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: We have also consulted the licensed manning agencies and their deported seafarers and provided them with assistance.

asr-006733
07:04:48.400 --> 07:04:49.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po dito.

asr-006734
07:04:50.280 --> 07:04:55.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Paano po kaya nakikipag-ugnayan ang DMW sa Philippine Embassy sa US

asr-006735
07:04:55.880 --> 07:04:59.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para matiyak na may legal aid ang ating mga kababayan?

asr-006736
07:05:01.560 --> 07:05:08.500
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Patuloy po ang pakikipag-ugnayan ng DMW with the Department of Foreign Affairs

asr-006737
07:05:08.500 --> 07:05:13.800
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: sa ating mga migrant workers offices at sa mga kaukulang US authorities

asr-006738
07:05:13.800 --> 07:05:21.000
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: upang mas maunawaan ang mga pangyayari at circumstances surrounding the removals.

asr-006739
07:05:21.660 --> 07:05:25.680
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Tinitiyak din po natin na ang mga affected seafarers ay,

asr-006740
07:05:25.880 --> 07:05:33.880
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: maayos na nare-refer para sa kinakailangan mga welfare, legal, at iba pang mga assistance.

asr-006741
07:05:34.720 --> 07:05:42.720
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Yun na po, ilan na po yan sa mga assistance at support na kaya pong ibigay ng DMW.

asr-006742
07:05:43.180 --> 07:05:46.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

asr-006743
07:05:46.960 --> 07:05:52.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nakakalungkot no na we've received reports from some of the seafarers.

asr-006744
07:05:52.020 --> 07:05:55.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Actually, dumaan po sila sa aking opisina kamakailan.

asr-006745
07:05:55.880 --> 07:06:01.580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Who were detained before deportation that when they called the Philippine Embassy to the US,

asr-006746
07:06:02.140 --> 07:06:07.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: the response was, okay lang yan, makakalaya ka naman, diba?

asr-006747
07:06:09.660 --> 07:06:12.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Does DMW share the same opinion?

asr-006748
07:06:25.880 --> 07:06:32.580
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, currently po tinatrabaho po ito ng DMW

asr-006749
07:06:32.580 --> 07:06:39.000
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: para po ma-make sure, or coordinated with, of course, the Manning Agency

asr-006750
07:06:39.000 --> 07:06:46.260
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: para po meron pang, merong legal assistance po, supports pa lang.

asr-006751
07:06:46.900 --> 07:06:49.600
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Yun po ang aksyon na ginagawa ng DMW.

asr-006752
07:06:49.600 --> 07:06:54.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat at naniniwala ako sa DMW na ito'y tutugunan nila.

asr-006753
07:06:54.760 --> 07:06:55.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nakakalungkot.

asr-006754
07:06:55.520 --> 07:07:02.760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kasi currently, nasa mahigit dalawang daang seafarers na po ang nagkaroon ng ganitong problema.

asr-006755
07:07:03.300 --> 07:07:06.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yung tinatawag nilang operational tidal wave.

asr-006756
07:07:07.740 --> 07:07:15.460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kamakailan ay naglabas na po sila ng kanilang press release patungkol dito sa nangyari sa kanila.

asr-006757
07:07:15.620 --> 07:07:19.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kasi wala po eh, walang nagre-report, hindi po ito lumalabas sa media.

asr-006758
07:07:19.400 --> 07:07:25.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At ang masaklap pa, sasabihan po sila ng ating embahada na nasa US na,

asr-006759
07:07:25.520 --> 07:07:28.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: okay lang yan, makakalaya ka naman.

asr-006760
07:07:29.220 --> 07:07:29.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Saklap, di ba?

asr-006761
07:07:30.680 --> 07:07:35.360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Umalis ako ng aking bansa, pupunta ako para maging isang seafarer,

asr-006762
07:07:36.020 --> 07:07:39.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: malalaman ko na lang na ako'y ipapababa at ako'y ipapadeport,

asr-006763
07:07:40.140 --> 07:07:45.200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pero idedetain pa ako at popusasan pa ako ng ilang oras, no?

asr-006764
07:07:45.480 --> 07:07:53.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, sana po ay matugunan po natin ito sa lalong madaling panahon, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

asr-006765
07:07:55.520 --> 07:08:01.740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, magkano po kaya ang na-dispersed na mula sa Action Fund

asr-006766
07:08:01.740 --> 07:08:06.860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para sa mga Pilipinong biktima ng mass deportations na walang due process?

asr-006767
07:08:09.060 --> 07:08:16.800
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, so far 222 seafarers have been deported

asr-006768
07:08:16.800 --> 07:08:24.980
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: and each were given 50,000 pesos in financial assistance under the Action Fund.

asr-006769
07:08:24.980 --> 07:08:31.720
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: So, total po, 11.1 million po ang na-dispersed galing sa Action Fund.

asr-006770
07:08:32.300 --> 07:08:33.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-006771
07:08:33.860 --> 07:08:43.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: My office also received reports that there are instances wherein six months since the seafarer has returned to the Philippines,

asr-006772
07:08:43.820 --> 07:08:47.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: hindi pa rin narirelease ang Action Fund sa nasabing seafarers.

asr-006773
07:08:47.920 --> 07:08:51.200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Sponsor, what is the reason kaya behind this?

asr-006774
07:08:54.980 --> 07:09:01.640
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, again, the reasoning behind the delay is because of the Middle East tensions

asr-006775
07:09:01.640 --> 07:09:07.600
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: and unfortunately po yun ang nag-cause ng delay but right now, DMW is catching up

asr-006776
07:09:07.600 --> 07:09:18.020
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: and we're committed to going back to the 30-day disbursement po ng assistance for our OFWs.

asr-006777
07:09:18.020 --> 07:09:24.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Just to put into record lang, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, can the DMW commit to ensure

asr-006778
07:09:24.820 --> 07:09:31.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: the expedient release of, or hindi lalagpas ng 30 days from today po?

asr-006779
07:09:32.240 --> 07:09:33.860
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Yes po, makakaasa po kayo.

asr-006780
07:09:33.940 --> 07:09:35.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po, no?

asr-006781
07:09:35.120 --> 07:09:47.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And finally, can the Distinguished Sponsor explain to us po, ano itong tinatawag nilang Abu Dhabi Dialogue at bakit ito mahalaga?

asr-006782
07:10:10.380 --> 07:10:17.660
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, the Abu Dhabi Dialogue was established in 2028

asr-006783
07:10:17.660 --> 07:10:23.220
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: at ito po ay isang voluntary inter-government consultative forum

asr-006784
07:10:23.220 --> 07:10:27.500
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: linking Asian countries of labor origin and destination

asr-006785
07:10:27.500 --> 07:10:40.520
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: and it aims to enable safe, orderly, and regular migration. Currently po, mayroon po siyang 10 member states including the Gulf States po.

asr-006786
07:10:41.280 --> 07:10:43.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At magkano po kaya ang nakalaan pondo para dito?

asr-006787
07:10:54.800 --> 07:11:00.860
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, currently wala po siyang allotment sa NEP.

asr-006788
07:11:01.320 --> 07:11:07.800
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: That's why nag-manifest po ang DMW ng kanilang request for 60 million pesos po

asr-006789
07:11:07.800 --> 07:11:17.900
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: to host at least three conferences po para sa Abu Dhabi Dialogue.

asr-006790
07:11:18.300 --> 07:11:19.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: 60 million pesos.

asr-006791
07:11:20.140 --> 07:11:23.200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And ang Pilipinas ang host po para dito.

asr-006792
07:11:23.200 --> 07:11:24.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po ba?

asr-006793
07:11:24.520 --> 07:11:24.780
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Yes.

asr-006795
07:11:25.260 --> 07:11:32.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kakalungkot no na host pa naman tayo pero wala tayong pondo para dito at napaka-importante po pala nito.

asr-006796
07:11:32.980 --> 07:11:39.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sinusuportahan ng representasyong ito ang paglalaan ng pondo para sa Abu Dhabi Dialogue.

asr-006797
07:11:39.640 --> 07:11:45.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mahalaga ang pondong ito upang maipagpatuloy ang mga programa para sa pagsasanay,

asr-006798
07:11:46.600 --> 07:11:54.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: proteksyon at mas maayos na kapakanan ng ating mga OFWs at iba pang migrant workers sa Middle East.

asr-006799
07:11:54.800 --> 07:12:01.460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And in closing, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, thank you for yielding into my questions.

asr-006800
07:12:02.100 --> 07:12:10.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nais kong muling ipahayag ang aking panawagan noong budget briefing na sa gitna ng umiiral na global conflict,

asr-006801
07:12:10.340 --> 07:12:22.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: mas higit nating kailangan ang matatag na DMW at OWA na may sapat na pondo upang matugunan ang pangangailangan ng ating mga overseas Filipino workers.

asr-006802
07:12:23.480 --> 07:12:24.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: I therefore manifest...

asr-006803
07:12:24.800 --> 07:12:29.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: I express my strong support for increasing the budget of the DMW and OWA,

asr-006804
07:12:30.560 --> 07:12:37.680
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: particularly with the repatriation program and assistance programs to distressed OFWs,

asr-006805
07:12:37.680 --> 07:12:49.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: with the guarantee na masiguro ng DMW ang mabilis, maayos at sapat na tulong sa ating mga kababayang OFWs sa oras ng pangangailangan.

asr-006806
07:12:49.960 --> 07:12:53.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nakikita natin ang epekto pag nagagawa ng isang ahensya,

asr-006807
07:12:53.880 --> 07:13:01.200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang kanilang mandato, which is evident sa mga nagagawa ng ating DMW Region 9,

asr-006808
07:13:01.700 --> 07:13:14.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: gaya ng pagtatayo ng First Regional OFW Airport Lounge outside na IA at First Regional Dedicated OFW Ward na sana ay magawa rin sa iba pang mga regyon.

asr-006809
07:13:15.300 --> 07:13:22.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Naniniwala ako na sa gabay at tinig ng ating distinguished sponsor, this August Chamber will favorably...

asr-006810
07:13:23.880 --> 07:13:30.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: consider and strengthen the department's budget, particularly for these vital programs.

asr-006811
07:13:30.380 --> 07:13:34.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po, Madam Speaker. Maraming salamat, Madam Sponsor.

asr-006812
07:13:34.660 --> 07:13:35.600
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-006813
07:13:37.420 --> 07:13:49.600
Rep. Arnan C. Panaligan: Madam Speaker, I move that we recognize Honorable Iris Montes, 4K Partylist, to interpelate on the proposed budget of the DMW.

asr-006814
07:13:51.500 --> 07:13:53.600
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Montes is recognized for her interpelation.

asr-006815
07:13:53.880 --> 07:13:56.100
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-006816
07:13:56.560 --> 07:14:02.640
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ilang katanungan lamang po mula sa kababaihan, kabalikatan para sa kapakanan at kaunlaran ng bayan.

asr-006817
07:14:03.920 --> 07:14:10.500
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Women consistently account for the majority of newly deployed land-based overseas Filipino workers,

asr-006818
07:14:11.060 --> 07:14:19.260
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: predominantly in domestic care work, a sector inherently prone to isolation, abuse, and labor exploitation.

asr-006819
07:14:20.020 --> 07:14:23.260
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Under the proposed 2027 budget,

asr-006820
07:14:23.260 --> 07:14:33.840
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: how much of the agarang kalinga at saklolo para sa mga OFW na nangangailangan or action fund is explicitly sub-allocated

asr-006821
07:14:33.840 --> 07:14:42.980
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: for immediate legal intervention, medical treatment, and physical rescue of abused female domestic workers?

asr-006824
07:14:52.500 --> 07:15:00.000
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, as of now po, ang action fund ay ready po na ma-

asr-006825
07:15:00.000 --> 07:15:08.980
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: The entire fund is ready to be used for any cases para po sa kahit sinong OFW na nangangailangan.

asr-006826
07:15:08.980 --> 07:15:16.840
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: So far po, over 50% ay actually nabigay po para sa ating mga kababaihan na OFWs.

asr-006827
07:15:16.900 --> 07:15:19.880
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: 50% po yung halos ang naibigay mo.

asr-006828
07:15:19.880 --> 07:15:20.640
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: More than 50%.

asr-006829
07:15:20.640 --> 07:15:23.320
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: More than. Kasi mas marami nga po sila.

asr-006830
07:15:23.320 --> 07:15:34.640
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: I remember during the last budget hearing, I specifically requested po talaga sa DMW to have a sex disaggregated data.

asr-006831
07:15:35.100 --> 07:15:42.320
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Isa po yan sa concern ko na talagang dapat ma-disaggregate yung data para alam po natin at magkano din po ang ilalaan.

asr-006832
07:15:43.000 --> 07:15:48.200
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kasi marami po talaga sila para natutugunan po natin yung pangangailangan nila.

asr-006833
07:15:49.200 --> 07:15:53.300
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: My next question po, under RA 9710.

asr-006834
07:15:53.320 --> 07:15:59.920
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: or the Magna Carta of Women, government agencies are required to protect women in specially difficult circumstances.

asr-006835
07:16:00.660 --> 07:16:08.340
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Out of the total operational budget of the migrant workers' offices and runaway shelters overseas,

asr-006836
07:16:08.880 --> 07:16:17.860
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: what specific line item is allocated to ensure that these shelters have trauma-informed female personnel,

asr-006837
07:16:19.340 --> 07:16:21.920
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: dedicated mental health professionals,

asr-006838
07:16:22.640 --> 07:16:22.860
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: and gender...

asr-006839
07:16:23.320 --> 07:16:24.940
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: gender-sensitive facilities?

asr-006840
07:16:25.480 --> 07:16:33.560
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Siguro po, kahit including mga gender-sensitive professionals din po, like yung mga gynecologists and the like.

asr-006841
07:16:47.800 --> 07:16:50.160
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006842
07:16:50.660 --> 07:16:52.160
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: ang pondo po na ginagamit,

asr-006843
07:16:52.160 --> 07:17:03.220
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: or specific line item po ay ang ating Migrant Workers Resource Centers at ang ating Labor Attachés Fund.

asr-006844
07:17:03.500 --> 07:17:05.180
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Yun po ang pinanggagalingan.

asr-006845
07:17:05.940 --> 07:17:09.880
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maraming salamat po, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-006846
07:17:10.880 --> 07:17:21.320
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Uso po ngayon, ang dami po ngayong mga digital job scams and human trafficking rings continue to target young, vulnerable women,

asr-006847
07:17:21.320 --> 07:17:28.860
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: especially in rural areas, ano, for illegal placement in cyber fraud hubs across Southeast Asia.

asr-006848
07:17:29.460 --> 07:17:35.520
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ano po, meron po, bawat direct budget allocation is set aside in the 2027 budget

asr-006849
07:17:35.520 --> 07:17:47.080
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: under the Illegal Recruitment Combat Directorates to expand anti-trafficking law enforcement and digital monitoring down to the LGU level.

asr-006850
07:17:49.180 --> 07:17:51.160
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006851
07:17:51.160 --> 07:18:02.300
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: so far po, para po sa mga illegal recruitment, meron po tayong 18 million po na pondo na nakalaan po para dito.

asr-006852
07:18:03.220 --> 07:18:04.240
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: 18 million, yes.

asr-006853
07:18:04.700 --> 07:18:08.380
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: 18 million lamang po ang pondo para dyan?

asr-006854
07:18:08.600 --> 07:18:08.900
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Opo.

asr-006855
07:18:10.020 --> 07:18:17.600
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Isang napakalaking problema po meron tayo ngayon tungkol dyan sa mga digital job scams na yan,

asr-006856
07:18:17.600 --> 07:18:21.140
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: tapos 18 million lang po ang nakalaan na pondo.

asr-006857
07:18:21.160 --> 07:18:34.800
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Siguro dapat po ay mahiling po natin na madagdagan po ang pondong iyan kasi napakalaki po ng hinaharap na problema ngayon ng DMW din tungkol dyan.

asr-006858
07:18:35.700 --> 07:18:40.640
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Yes po, kaya po kasama rin po sa manifestation ng DMW,

asr-006859
07:18:40.640 --> 07:18:50.800
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: ang additional funding po na hiningi nila for 2 billion pesos ay syempre po parte po ng mailalaan po para sa legal recruitment and illegal,

asr-006860
07:18:50.800 --> 07:18:52.500
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: or anti-trafficking efforts po.

asr-006861
07:18:53.020 --> 07:18:55.920
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you, Madam Chair, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-006862
07:18:56.900 --> 07:19:07.220
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: A major driver of repeated migration cycles among women is the absence of viable domestic economic opportunities upon returning home.

asr-006863
07:19:07.720 --> 07:19:11.640
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kaya nga po sila umaalis din dahil kulang dun sa economic opportunities.

asr-006864
07:19:12.040 --> 07:19:13.840
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ganun din po, pagbalik, ganun pa rin.

asr-006865
07:19:13.840 --> 07:19:19.840
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Under the DMW and Overseas Workers' Welfare Administration Joint Reintegration,

asr-006866
07:19:20.800 --> 07:19:30.100
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: budget for 2027, ano po ang proportion, what proportion of funds is directly earmarked for high-value skills training,

asr-006867
07:19:30.620 --> 07:19:42.800
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: siguro po sa technology, healthcare, specialization, kasi yun po ang medyo mas malaki ang demand sa ating mga returning female OFWs.

asr-006869
07:20:32.680 --> 07:20:35.240
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006870
07:20:35.440 --> 07:20:43.080
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Para po sa Balik Pinay Program, 45 million pesos po ang nakalaan para dito.

asr-006871
07:20:43.720 --> 07:20:50.360
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: At it's also worth mentioning po siguro na ang ating ERF or Emergency Repatriation Fund,

asr-006873
07:20:50.780 --> 07:20:53.980
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: 79% po nito ay nalaan para po sa kababaihan.

asr-006874
07:20:54.120 --> 07:20:59.760
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: So that's over 1 billion po na pondo na naiilaan po para sa kababaihan.

asr-006875
07:21:00.140 --> 07:21:03.420
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maraming salamat po, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-006876
07:21:04.000 --> 07:21:06.400
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Pag-huling katanungan na lamang po, ano?

asr-006877
07:21:07.060 --> 07:21:13.660
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: What quantifiable indicators and gender disaggregated baseline data

asr-006878
07:21:13.660 --> 07:21:18.240
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: does the DMW use in the 2027 budget proposal

asr-006879
07:21:18.240 --> 07:21:20.620
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: to track whether returning female

asr-006880
07:21:20.620 --> 07:21:21.820
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: migrants

asr-006881
07:21:21.820 --> 07:21:27.960
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: successfully transition out of precarious low-wage care work

asr-006882
07:21:27.960 --> 07:21:32.640
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: into sustainable domestic livelihoods or formal employment?

asr-006883
07:21:32.960 --> 07:21:35.740
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Meron po ba tayong indicators?

asr-006884
07:21:36.040 --> 07:21:38.300
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Meron tayong sistema ang ginagamit?

asr-006885
07:21:46.780 --> 07:21:50.460
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-006887
07:21:50.460 --> 07:21:56.300
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: meron po ng budget ng DMW every year ay nakalaan po para sa monitoring services

asr-006888
07:21:56.300 --> 07:22:03.640
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: para po makita natin kung saan po ba or enough po ba ang nalalaan para sa ating mga kababaihan.

asr-006889
07:22:03.640 --> 07:22:07.720
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: At meron din po tayong disaggregated data tungkol dyan.

asr-006890
07:22:08.340 --> 07:22:10.640
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Meron po. We can provide...

asr-006891
07:22:20.460 --> 07:22:27.920
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Sorry, I have the data here.

asr-006892
07:22:29.600 --> 07:22:38.200
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: For the Balikpinay Balikhanap Buhay Program,

asr-006893
07:22:38.200 --> 07:22:44.060
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: 79% po ng mga beneficiaries are female.

asr-006894
07:22:45.080 --> 07:22:48.760
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-006895
07:22:50.460 --> 07:22:55.480
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Sa panghuli, payagan niyo po akong ipahayag na alam naman po natin

asr-006896
07:22:55.480 --> 07:22:58.220
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: ang contribution ng ating mga OFWs.

asr-006897
07:22:58.300 --> 07:23:02.060
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Hindi natin po matatawaran ang ambag nila sa ating bayan.

asr-006898
07:23:02.920 --> 07:23:08.140
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Sila ang bumubuhay ng ating ekonomiya sa pamamagitan ng kanilang remittances.

asr-006899
07:23:08.680 --> 07:23:14.700
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Sila ang nagdadala ng dangal ng Pilipino sa iba't ibang lugar or panig ng mundo.

asr-006900
07:23:14.700 --> 07:23:19.060
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: At sila rin ang nagbabayad ng pinakamataas na halaga.

asr-006901
07:23:19.720 --> 07:23:20.300
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ang pagkakahiwan.

asr-006902
07:23:20.460 --> 07:23:25.960
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ang pagkakahiwalay sa pamilya at ang panganib sa kanilang kaligtasan.

asr-006903
07:23:25.960 --> 07:23:32.280
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kaya naman nararapat na ang Department of Migrant Workers ay bigyan ng mas mataas na pondo

asr-006904
07:23:32.280 --> 07:23:42.360
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: upang matiyak na ang proteksyon, suporta at reintegrasyon ng ating mga OFWs ay tunay na maisa sa katuparan.

asr-006905
07:23:43.400 --> 07:23:50.100
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Sa bawat pisong ilalaan sa DMW, nakataya ang buhay at kinabukasan ng milyong-milyong Pilipino

asr-006906
07:23:50.460 --> 07:23:51.280
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: sa bayong dagat.

asr-006907
07:23:51.620 --> 07:23:59.760
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kaya't hinihiling natin na ang 2027 budget ng DMW ay palakasin upang ang kanilang sakripisyo ay masuklian

asr-006908
07:23:59.760 --> 07:24:07.540
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: ng mas matibay na proteksyon, mas maayos na serbisyo at mas makabuluhang suporta mula sa pamahalaan.

asr-006909
07:24:08.200 --> 07:24:11.480
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-006910
