Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Para sa Fiscal Year 2027.

asr-007037
07:35:04.020 --> 07:35:06.620
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: This Fiscal Year 2027,

asr-007038
07:35:07.660 --> 07:35:09.240
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: humiling po ang NCIP

asr-007039
07:35:09.240 --> 07:35:13.380
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: ng kabuoang 3.608 billion.

asr-007040
07:35:14.420 --> 07:35:17.420
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Subalit, sa ilalim ng National Expenditure Program

asr-007041
07:35:17.420 --> 07:35:18.700
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: or NEP,

asr-007042
07:35:19.340 --> 07:35:22.480
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: 1.831 billion lamang ang inilaat,

asr-007043
07:35:23.440 --> 07:35:25.000
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: na halos kalahati lamang

asr-007044
07:35:25.000 --> 07:35:28.000
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: ng aktual na pangailangan ng ahensya

asr-007045
07:35:28.000 --> 07:35:29.280
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: para sa

asr-007046
07:35:29.280 --> 07:35:30.160
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: susunod na taon.

asr-007047
07:35:31.300 --> 07:35:32.820
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-007048
07:35:38.000 --> 07:35:39.080
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker.

asr-007049
07:35:39.780 --> 07:35:40.740
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-007050
07:35:41.580 --> 07:35:43.720
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, I move that we recognize

asr-007051
07:35:43.720 --> 07:35:45.540
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: the Honorable Dada Kiram Ismula

asr-007052
07:35:45.540 --> 07:35:46.920
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: to interpolate the sponsor.

asr-007053
07:35:48.080 --> 07:35:49.640
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Dada Kiram Ismula

asr-007054
07:35:49.640 --> 07:35:50.960
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: of Party-list Akbayan

asr-007055
07:35:50.960 --> 07:35:54.140
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: is hereby recognized

asr-007056
07:35:54.140 --> 07:35:55.280
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: for her interpolation.

asr-007057
07:35:59.280 --> 07:36:04.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Asalamu Alaikum Warahmatullahi Wabarakatuhu.

asr-007058
07:36:04.720 --> 07:36:05.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker,

asr-007059
07:36:05.820 --> 07:36:07.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: good sponsor,

asr-007060
07:36:08.920 --> 07:36:11.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: since karamihan ng mga ancestral domains

asr-007061
07:36:11.820 --> 07:36:14.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ay nasa mga regions,

asr-007062
07:36:14.020 --> 07:36:14.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: my plano bang investment

asr-007063
07:36:14.960 --> 07:36:16.500
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa mga regional

asr-007064
07:36:16.500 --> 07:36:18.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: or field offices

asr-007065
07:36:18.040 --> 07:36:19.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa 2027?

asr-007071
07:36:38.140 --> 07:36:55.560
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Madam Speaker, yes, since most ancestral domains and ICCs/IPs are located in the regions, we recognize that NCIP's capacity must also be strongest at the field level.

asr-007072
07:36:56.700 --> 07:37:12.420
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: For 2027, our direction is to strengthen our regional, provincial, and community service centers by providing the necessary technical personnel, field resources, and operational support.

asr-007073
07:37:13.780 --> 07:37:19.240
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Marami po sa trabaho ng NCIP ay ginagawa mismo sa communities.

asr-007074
07:37:20.380 --> 07:37:26.120
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Tulad po ng ancestral domain, delineation, census, and validation.

asr-007075
07:37:26.120 --> 07:37:44.220
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: This requires our personnel to actually reach the communities, including those in geographically isolated and disadvantaged areas.

asr-007076
07:37:45.900 --> 07:37:51.840
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: So, strengthening the field offices is not simply an administrative investment.

asr-007077
07:37:51.840 --> 07:37:54.840
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: It directly increases our capacity.

asr-007078
07:37:56.120 --> 07:38:02.900
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: To deliver the mandate of NCIP, where our ICCs, IPs, actually are.

asr-007079
07:38:04.040 --> 07:38:15.300
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Madam Speaker, we have submitted our Tier 2 proposal for creation of 10 provincial offices and 36 community service centers.

asr-007080
07:38:15.980 --> 07:38:23.700
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Unfortunately, it was not included in the 2027 NEP of NCIP.

asr-007081
07:38:26.120 --> 07:38:29.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-007082
07:38:29.080 --> 07:38:44.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa NEP po ng 2027, nakasaad na ang 2025 GAA, target para sa percentage increase ng ancestral domains or lands recognized and delineated ay 11%.

asr-007083
07:38:44.220 --> 07:38:48.260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ngunit ang actual performance ay 0%.

asr-007084
07:38:48.260 --> 07:38:52.140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa 2026, target muli ay 11%.

asr-007085
07:38:52.140 --> 07:38:55.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: As of today, ilang percent na po ba ang na-accomplish?

asr-007087
07:38:56.020 --> 07:39:04.880
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: It is a target based on the Actual Cases Program.

asr-007088
07:39:06.260 --> 07:39:12.500
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: There is states of processing, complexity, location, and the resources available for implementation.

asr-007089
07:39:14.020 --> 07:39:19.980
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: At the same time, the 113 represents only the funded annual target.

asr-007090
07:39:19.980 --> 07:39:25.980
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: It does not represent the total need or the total number of

asr-007092
07:39:26.420 --> 07:39:30.920
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: ancestral domain claims that NCIP still has to process.

asr-007093
07:39:32.060 --> 07:39:41.720
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Kaya po, ang gusto namin ipakita sa Congress is the distinction between the funded target and the actual mandate.

asr-007094
07:39:43.200 --> 07:39:54.680
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: The NCIP will deliver what is funded while continuing to present the remaining requirements so that, over time, it can address the larger backlog.

asr-007095
07:39:56.020 --> 07:39:59.460
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: The target should be realistic enough to be accountable.

asr-007096
07:39:59.460 --> 07:40:09.380
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: But the budget should also progressively respond to the actual universe of ancestral domains' claims that remain to be served.

asr-007097
07:40:11.380 --> 07:40:12.040
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Madam Speaker,

asr-007098
07:40:13.200 --> 07:40:23.800
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: CAGTI and CALTI processing is the legal recognition of ancestral domain and ancestral land rights.

asr-007099
07:40:24.140 --> 07:40:25.800
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: It is not an ordinary process.

asr-007100
07:40:26.020 --> 07:40:30.780
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: It is not an ordinary permit or simple administrative transactions.

asr-007101
07:40:31.680 --> 07:40:39.740
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Ang kinikilala po natin dito ay karapatan sa lupa na may intergenerational consequences.

asr-007102
07:40:41.040 --> 07:40:50.000
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Once recognized, it affects not only the present generation but also the generations that will come after them.

asr-007103
07:40:50.000 --> 07:40:55.440
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: That is why the process has to be thorough and evidence-based.

asr-007104
07:40:56.020 --> 07:41:17.040
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: It involves community participation, genealogical and historical research, census, survey and mapping, validation, resolution of boundary and overlapping claims, legal review, and ultimately, commission deliberations.

asr-007105
07:41:17.040 --> 07:41:25.740
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: May mga pagkakataon din na kailangan ng coordination with DNR, DAR, LRA.

asr-007106
07:41:26.020 --> 07:41:34.000
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: LGUs and other agencies, because land records, existing titles, surveys,

asr-007114
07:41:34.020 --> 07:41:36.820
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: And other claims have to be reconciled.

asr-007115
07:41:38.500 --> 07:41:42.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, ulitin ko po yung tanong ko.

asr-007116
07:41:42.320 --> 07:41:50.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ilang percent na ang na-accomplish na ADs and ALs ngayong 2026 po?

asr-007117
07:41:51.960 --> 07:41:53.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Or as of today?

asr-007118
07:42:04.020 --> 07:42:17.880
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Madam Speaker, the 11% is the annual target based on the resources provided for 2027.

asr-007119
07:42:17.880 --> 07:42:26.420
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: It does not represent the total number of ancestral domains and lands that still need to be processed.

asr-007120
07:42:27.320 --> 07:42:33.880
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: The 11% corresponds to the 30 ancestral domains or lands.

asr-007121
07:42:34.020 --> 07:42:43.440
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: For many years, the budget of NCIP has not been proportionate to the actual universe of its mandate.

asr-007122
07:42:44.820 --> 07:42:53.320
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Kaya po, ang target ay nakabatay sa kung ano ang kanyang pondohan, hindi sa kabuhuang pangangailangan.

asr-007123
07:42:54.940 --> 07:43:00.660
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: This is precisely why NCIP proposed a higher budget.

asr-007124
07:43:00.660 --> 07:43:03.660
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: So we can progressively increase our coverage.

asr-007125
07:43:04.020 --> 07:43:09.520
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: And process more ancestral domains and land claims.

asr-007126
07:43:10.200 --> 07:43:15.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sige po, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor, baguhin ko na lang ang tanong ko.

asr-007127
07:43:15.780 --> 07:43:24.140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ilan po ang na-accomplish na ng NCIP para mabigyan ng CalTee at CADTee for 2026?

asr-007128
07:43:28.140 --> 07:43:33.140
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: For 2026 po, ang approved is tatlo pong CAD-T at

asr-007129
07:43:34.020 --> 07:43:35.020
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: CAL-T.

asr-007130
07:43:38.480 --> 07:43:42.440
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Ang total po ay 529.

asr-007131
07:43:46.580 --> 07:43:49.140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Approved, CADTee and CalTee.

asr-007132
07:43:50.740 --> 07:43:52.140
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Approved po, approved.

asr-007133
07:43:52.980 --> 07:43:56.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor.

asr-007134
07:43:56.900 --> 07:44:01.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa NEP po ba ng 2027, target ulit po ay 11%.

asr-007135
07:44:01.900 --> 07:44:08.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ilan po ang tiyak na bilang ng ancestral domain na sakop ng target na ito?

asr-007136
07:44:09.540 --> 07:44:13.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At bakit po taon-taon 11% lamang ang target ng NCIP?

asr-007137
07:44:18.420 --> 07:44:28.040
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Sa 2027 po, Madam Speaker, ay 74 for 2027 ang target.

asr-007138
07:44:30.000 --> 07:44:31.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At bakit po kaya taon-taon?

asr-007139
07:44:31.880 --> 07:44:34.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At bakit po kaya taon-taon 11% ang target natin?

asr-007140
07:44:39.520 --> 07:44:50.260
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Madam Speaker, yung 11% po is the annual target based on the resources provided for 2027.

asr-007141
07:44:51.080 --> 07:44:58.500
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: It does not represent the total number of ancestral domains and lands that still need to be processed.

asr-007142
07:44:58.500 --> 07:45:00.638
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: The 11%

asr-007143
07:45:00.638 --> 07:45:06.580
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: corresponds to 30 ancestral domain or land claims.

asr-007144
07:45:07.640 --> 07:45:15.320
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: For many years, the budget for NCIP has not been proportionate to the actual universe of its mandate.

asr-007145
07:45:16.260 --> 07:45:25.000
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Kaya po, ang target ay nakabatay sa kung ano ang kanyang pondohan, hindi sa kabuang pangangailangan.

asr-007146
07:45:25.000 --> 07:45:29.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Naintindihan ko po ito, Madam Speaker, Good Sponsor.

asr-007147
07:45:30.180 --> 07:45:39.740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya dadako na lang po ako sa susunod na katanungan ko kasi paulit-ulit na lang po yung tanong ko, paulit-ulit din po yung nagiging sagot.

asr-007148
07:45:40.260 --> 07:45:50.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa indicator ng percentage increase ng bilang ng IPs assisted sa plan formulation, parehong 7% ang target para sa 2026 at 2027.

asr-007149
07:45:52.360 --> 07:45:54.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano po ang dahilan kung bakit hindi tumataas ang target?

asr-007150
07:45:55.000 --> 07:45:59.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At paano ito nakaka-apekto sa mga IP communities?

asr-007151
07:46:01.740 --> 07:46:10.020
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Madam Speaker, we have a universe of 999 ancestral domains.

asr-007152
07:46:10.920 --> 07:46:21.320
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Of these, 335 already have formulated ADSD PPS, leaving a gap of 664.

asr-007154
07:46:24.980 --> 07:46:37.920
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: For fiscal year 2027, the funded target is only 30 ADSD PPS, equivalent to about 4.5% of the remaining gap.

asr-007155
07:46:38.720 --> 07:46:42.640
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: After that, 634 would still remain.

asr-007156
07:46:44.020 --> 07:46:46.760
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: This illustrates the mandate coverage gap.

asr-007157
07:46:47.640 --> 07:46:54.820
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Our annual target is determined by available resources while the actual need is much larger.

asr-007158
07:46:54.820 --> 07:46:57.860
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Maraming salamat po.

asr-007159
07:46:58.160 --> 07:47:09.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Distinguished sponsor, can the NCIP confirm if it has a concrete plan to expedite the release of Certificate of Ancestral Domain title?

asr-007160
07:47:09.680 --> 07:47:20.760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Considering na mandato na ito ng komisyon mula pa noong na-enact ng IPRA, bakit tila nananatiling mabagal ang CAD-T issuance po natin?

asr-007161
07:47:21.560 --> 07:47:22.960
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Madam Speaker,

asr-007162
07:47:24.500 --> 07:47:29.800
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: We are addressing not only the internal processing of CADTs and CALTs,

asr-007163
07:47:29.900 --> 07:47:38.400
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: but also the interagency bottlenecks involving land records, registration, and overlapping claims.

asr-007164
07:47:38.400 --> 07:47:55.000
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: NCIP has already met with the Land Registration Authority to streamline CADT/CALT registration and address overlaps and interagency requirements.

asr-007220
07:47:56.280 --> 07:48:02.320
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: A technical working group was agreed upon to develop a clearer coordination mechanism.

asr-007221
07:48:03.060 --> 07:48:11.820
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: We are also engaging in broader land justice initiatives, including the Supreme Court's Land and Justice Summit,

asr-007222
07:48:12.600 --> 07:48:20.640
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: where systemic issues involving land disputes and overlapping claims can be addressed with the concerned institutions.

asr-007223
07:48:20.640 --> 07:48:29.420
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: The Supreme Court had identified the Land and Justice Summit as one of its justice sector initiatives.

asr-007224
07:48:30.460 --> 07:48:34.260
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: So, our approach is both operational and structural.

asr-007225
07:48:35.260 --> 07:48:42.720
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Expedite individual claims while addressing the policy fragmentation that causes recurring delays.

asr-007226
07:48:43.120 --> 07:48:48.980
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: The Admin Order there on the contracting out-of-survey services in delineation

asr-007227
07:48:48.980 --> 07:48:50.620
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: has been approved.

asr-007228
07:48:50.640 --> 07:48:52.480
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: It is approved and is up for publication.

asr-007229
07:48:53.660 --> 07:49:00.260
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: There is also an ongoing effort on digitization of our services and process

asr-007230
07:49:00.260 --> 07:49:05.620
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: for more efficient processing, monitoring, and record-keeping.

asr-007231
07:49:07.420 --> 07:49:14.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: For this year po, sa 2026, saan po yung mga CAD-TIS na issue?

asr-007232
07:49:15.620 --> 07:49:19.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano-anong mga regions at ano-anong mga tribes po?

asr-007233
07:49:20.640 --> 07:49:26.620
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Sa Region 3 po, meron tayong isa.

asr-007234
07:49:27.860 --> 07:49:30.220
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Region 12, meron pong apat.

asr-007235
07:49:31.140 --> 07:49:33.200
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Region 9, meron pong tatlo.

asr-007236
07:49:34.100 --> 07:49:36.580
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Region 6, meron pong apat.

asr-007237
07:49:37.380 --> 07:49:39.440
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: At Region 7, meron pong lima.

asr-007238
07:49:39.440 --> 07:49:47.440
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Or a total of 17 CAD-T in 2026.

asr-007239
07:49:48.160 --> 07:49:50.620
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: As of July 31, 2026.

asr-007240
07:49:50.640 --> 07:49:52.660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And ongoing pa po ito.

asr-007241
07:49:52.800 --> 07:49:53.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Good sponsor.

asr-007242
07:49:53.620 --> 07:49:54.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po?

asr-007243
07:49:56.200 --> 07:49:56.720
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Apo-apo.

asr-007244
07:49:57.400 --> 07:49:58.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-007245
07:49:58.720 --> 07:50:09.760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Now, last year, you committed to look into the 20-year CAD-T application of Sitio Marihangin in Bugso, Palawan.

asr-007246
07:50:10.420 --> 07:50:12.700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: What's the status of their application po?

asr-007247
07:50:14.820 --> 07:50:15.900
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Madam Speaker,

asr-007248
07:50:15.900 --> 07:50:19.100
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: the CAD-T application involving

asr-007249
07:50:19.100 --> 07:50:21.280
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: the Marihangin community

asr-007250
07:50:21.280 --> 07:50:24.840
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: is being actively addressed by NCIP.

asr-007251
07:50:26.040 --> 07:50:29.900
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: The community requested funding for the processing of its CAD-T

asr-007252
07:50:29.900 --> 07:50:33.420
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: under the 100 million funding allocation.

asr-007253
07:50:34.480 --> 07:50:35.940
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: The concerned field office

asr-007254
07:50:35.940 --> 07:50:39.400
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: has already submitted the work and financial plan

asr-007255
07:50:39.400 --> 07:50:41.460
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: for the CAD-T processing.

asr-007256
07:50:42.460 --> 07:50:45.680
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: There is also an existing boundary conflict

asr-007257
07:50:45.680 --> 07:50:48.920
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: involving overlapping ancestral domain

asr-007258
07:50:48.920 --> 07:50:49.080
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: claims,

asr-007260
07:50:49.600 --> 07:50:51.700
