asr-007508
08:00:00.000 --> 08:00:09.920
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, I move to recognize the Honorable Jose Joboy S. Aquino II from the Lone District, City of Butuan.

asr-007509
08:00:10.960 --> 08:00:16.960
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Joboy Aquino from Butuan City is hereby recognized for his interpellation.

asr-007510
08:00:18.140 --> 08:00:27.740
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Thank you, Madam Speaker, distinguished sponsor, my colleagues here in Congress, good afternoon.

asr-007511
08:00:27.740 --> 08:00:33.180
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: I would just like to make a manifestation, Madam Speaker.

asr-007512
08:00:34.760 --> 08:00:44.740
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: This representation would like to make a manifestation concerning the proposed budget of the National Commission on Indigenous People,

asr-007513
08:00:46.760 --> 08:00:56.040
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: given their glaring apathy and complete inaction during actual conflicts on the ground.

asr-007514
08:00:57.740 --> 08:01:18.380
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Mr. Speaker, this year in Butuan City, an 18-year Good Friday tradition, the Panaat Pilgrimage in Barangay Antikala, was intentionally disrupted by political theater.

asr-007515
08:01:19.060 --> 08:01:27.260
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Local indigenous groups were manipulated amid a clan power struggle.

asr-007516
08:01:27.740 --> 08:01:37.020
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Dating back to 2020, weaponizing a sacred cultural observance for political gain.

asr-007517
08:01:37.900 --> 08:01:56.160
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Rather than arguing in the media, my office initiated an immediate dialogue with local tribal leadership, barangay officials, the Philippine National Police, the Philippine Army, and the Red Cross,

asr-007518
08:01:56.160 --> 08:01:57.160
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: to have the...

asr-007519
08:01:57.740 --> 08:02:00.740
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: to have the resolution officially retracted.

asr-007520
08:02:01.340 --> 08:02:15.780
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: I must emphasize, Mr. Speaker, that this peaceful resolution was achieved completely without the intervention of the NCIP,

asr-007521
08:02:15.780 --> 08:02:23.840
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: who simply stood by and did nothing while tensions escalated.

asr-007522
08:02:25.800 --> 08:02:27.720
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: With this, I ask, does the...

asr-007523
08:02:27.740 --> 08:02:38.320
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Does the NCIP have a standard, funded protocol for facilitating immediate dialogue in these instances?

asr-007524
08:02:39.220 --> 08:02:48.380
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Or does it leave the responsibility entirely to the legislative and local government unit?

asr-007525
08:02:48.380 --> 08:02:48.460
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Thank you.

asr-007526
08:02:54.460 --> 08:02:57.260
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: We allocate millions.

asr-007527
08:02:57.740 --> 08:03:04.500
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: To the Ancestral Domains Program to protect IP territories.

asr-007528
08:03:05.640 --> 08:03:19.620
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: But tensions frequently arise over the balance of ancestral claims with vested rights and public access to shared thoroughfares.

asr-007529
08:03:19.620 --> 08:03:27.620
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Is there a dedicated budget allocation for a rapid response interagency

asr-007530
08:03:27.740 --> 08:03:28.140
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: mechanism?

asr-007531
08:03:28.140 --> 08:03:41.060
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: So the NCIP does not simply stand by and do nothing when these disputes erupt.

asr-007532
08:03:42.280 --> 08:03:49.380
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Therefore, Mr. Speaker, I leave it to this floor, to the agency concerned,

asr-007533
08:03:49.380 --> 08:03:57.380
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: how they would understand and appreciate my sentiments on this issue.

asr-007534
08:03:57.740 --> 08:04:21.700
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Sabi nga sa Bisaya, Madam Speaker, sa lugar namin, 'maulaw mo.' Sa mga Bisaya, naiintindihan ninyo 'yan. Kayo na mag-isip kung paano sa Tagalog 'yan. Thank you, Mr. Speaker and Mr. Sponsor.

asr-007535
08:04:21.700 --> 08:04:24.840
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-007537
08:04:27.740 --> 08:04:43.940
Rep. Munir N. Arbison Jr.: Madam Speaker, I move to recognize the Honorable Jesus Jardine Romualdo of the Lone District of Camiguin.

asr-007538
08:04:46.080 --> 08:04:53.520
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Jardine Jesus Romualdo of the Lone District of Camiguin is hereby recognized for his manifestation.

asr-007539
08:04:56.440 --> 08:04:57.580
Rep. Jurdin Jesus "JJ" M. Romualdo: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-007543
08:04:57.740 --> 08:05:06.140
Rep. Jurdin Jesus "JJ" M. Romualdo: Madam Speaker, Your Honor, I have really so many questions, Madam Speaker, Your Honor.

asr-007544
08:05:07.000 --> 08:05:22.120
Rep. Jurdin Jesus "JJ" M. Romualdo: However, when we're going to tackle my bill, in which I am the author to amend the indigenous people's charter,

asr-007545
08:05:22.120 --> 08:05:27.720
Rep. Jurdin Jesus "JJ" M. Romualdo: I'm listening also to the speakers before me.

asr-007546
08:05:27.740 --> 08:05:41.200
Rep. Jurdin Jesus "JJ" M. Romualdo: Madam Chair, but I will just make my manifestation that these questions I'm going to ask during when we tackle the bill.

asr-007547
08:05:41.980 --> 08:05:46.200
Rep. Jurdin Jesus "JJ" M. Romualdo: However, thank you for the time, Madam Speaker, Your Honor.

asr-007548
08:05:48.520 --> 08:05:55.340
Rep. Jurdin Jesus "JJ" M. Romualdo: I will just forego all the questions, interpolations for the NCIP.

asr-007549
08:05:55.620 --> 08:05:57.460
Rep. Jurdin Jesus "JJ" M. Romualdo: However, Madam Speaker,

asr-007550
08:05:57.740 --> 08:06:12.420
Rep. Jurdin Jesus "JJ" M. Romualdo: Madam Speaker, Mr. Speaker, Your Honor, at the proper time, I will propose to reduce the budget of the National Commission on Indigenous Peoples to 1,000, Mr. Speaker, Your Honor.

asr-007551
08:06:12.600 --> 08:06:14.020
Rep. Jurdin Jesus "JJ" M. Romualdo: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Your Honor.

asr-007552
08:06:16.400 --> 08:06:18.160
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Thank you, Honorable Romualdo.

asr-007553
08:06:18.900 --> 08:06:19.500
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Majority Leader?

asr-007554
08:06:19.600 --> 08:06:24.580
Rep. Munir N. Arbison Jr.: Mr. Speaker, I move to recognize the Honorable Sara Elago of the Gabriela Party.

asr-007555
08:06:25.320 --> 08:06:27.580
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: The Honorable Elago is recognized.

asr-007557
08:06:33.700 --> 08:06:35.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

asr-007558
08:06:36.940 --> 08:06:42.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Unang-una, maari ba nating malaman kung ano ang tindig ng NCIP hinggil sa Pax Silica Initiative,

asr-007559
08:06:43.660 --> 08:06:49.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lalong-lalo na sa magiging epekto nito sa mga kalupaan at kabuhayan ng mga katutubo?

asr-007560
08:06:57.740 --> 08:07:26.780
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: So, ngayon po, Madam Speaker, tayo ay nakikipag-coordinate pa po tayo sa BCDA.

asr-007561
08:07:27.740 --> 08:07:37.640
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: At sa mga IPs. Kasi pa nga po, wala pa pong klaro na itong Pax Silica nito.

asr-007562
08:07:38.920 --> 08:07:44.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin nito, Mr. Speaker, wala pa tayo ngayong datos kung anong mga lugar,

asr-007563
08:07:44.940 --> 08:07:50.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: gano'ng kalawak sa saklaw ng pagtatayuan ng Pax Silica ang may nakatirang mga katutubo?

asr-007564
08:07:50.160 --> 08:07:57.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: O meron na po bang datos dito ang NCIP? Kung ilang mga pamilya, individual, ang apektado?

asr-007565
08:07:57.880 --> 08:08:07.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kung ano-ano din ang mga potensyal na environmental risk at epekto o banta sa pamumuhay ng mga katutubo?

asr-007566
08:08:13.160 --> 08:08:22.160
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Madam Speaker, NCIP conducted a community dialogue on August 7, 2026,

asr-007567
08:08:23.880 --> 08:08:27.160
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: relayed the community's concerns to BCDA.

asr-007568
08:08:27.740 --> 08:08:31.640
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: And continues to coordinate with the community.

asr-007569
08:08:32.840 --> 08:08:39.020
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Their application is currently under review by the Provincial Delineation Team.

asr-007570
08:08:40.400 --> 08:08:48.640
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: The AITA-Hanggi Community in Sitio Sapang, Hawayan, Barangay Aranguren, Kapas, Tarlac.

asr-007571
08:08:50.700 --> 08:08:57.700
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: The August 2026 census identified

asr-007572
08:08:57.700 --> 08:09:01.900
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: 83 households with 950 individuals.

asr-007573
08:09:04.740 --> 08:09:11.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, maari po ba tayong makahingi ng kopya ng ulat na ito ng inyong naisagawa na validation?

asr-007574
08:09:11.860 --> 08:09:17.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa nabanggit niyo ko na ginawang dialog sa community noong nakaraang buwan,

asr-007575
08:09:18.420 --> 08:09:22.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ano-ano po yung mga nakalap ninyong mga hinahing mula sa AITA community?

asr-007576
08:09:27.740 --> 08:09:37.180
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Ano pa na?

asr-007577
08:09:39.180 --> 08:09:40.120
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Nabimigay na.

asr-007578
08:10:14.100 --> 08:10:16.480
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Sa ngayon po ay, Mr. Speaker, sila ay nangangamba sa kanilang katayuan.

asr-007579
08:10:16.480 --> 08:10:27.680
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Kaya po, baka sila ay mapaalis at nagtatanong sila sa status ng kanilang

asr-007580
08:10:27.740 --> 08:10:28.780
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Ancestral domain.

asr-007581
08:10:31.480 --> 08:10:44.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napakahalaga na ang concern na ito ng mga katutubong AITA, Mr. Speaker, na naipaabot tungkol sa kanilang lupa, tungkol po sa issue ng displacement.

asr-007582
08:10:45.620 --> 08:10:56.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon po, sinabi rin ng NCIP sa kanilang pahayag noong magkaroon po kayo ng dialogo nga sa TARLAC nitong August 8, 2026.

asr-007583
08:10:56.420 --> 08:10:58.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: And I quote,

asr-007584
08:10:58.280 --> 08:11:01.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi mababaliwala ang mga hinahing na ito.

asr-007585
08:11:01.840 --> 08:11:12.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ipapaabot ito sa Basis Conversion and Development Authority, kasama ang kahilingan para sa sapat at malinaw na impormasyon tungkol sa Paxilica Project.

asr-007586
08:11:12.820 --> 08:11:13.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: End of quote.

asr-007587
08:11:13.800 --> 08:11:25.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mula po ba sa inyong pahayag na ito, meron na bang ginawang aksyon ang NCIP tungkol sa hinahing ng mga katutubo na paabot na sa BCDA?

asr-007588
08:11:25.080 --> 08:11:25.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay.

asr-007589
08:11:26.420 --> 08:11:35.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagpapaabot, meron na po ba kayong ginawang interventions para naman matugunan ang mga nilapit na hinahing sa atin?

asr-007606
08:11:48.600 --> 08:12:04.500
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Nakipag-meeting po ang NCIP noong August 7, 2026 at September 3, 2026 sa Sitio Binyayan

asr-007620
08:12:04.500 --> 08:12:10.600
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: upang ipaabot ang concerns ng komunidad.

asr-007637
08:12:23.800 --> 08:12:33.600
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: At pinanindigan po ang kanilang karapatan sa BCDA.

asr-007640
08:12:38.200 --> 08:12:41.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron po bang asagot na dito ang BCDA?

asr-007641
08:12:41.100 --> 08:12:45.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At mahalaga ito, Mr. Speaker, dahil isang ayon din po sa mga katutubo,

asr-007642
08:12:45.600 --> 08:12:51.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi lamang buhay at kabuhayan nila ang nanganganib sa pagtatayo ng site ng Paxilica Initiative,

asr-007643
08:12:52.000 --> 08:12:54.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kundi pati ang kanilang kultura at kasaysayan.

asr-007644
08:12:54.780 --> 08:13:03.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kabilang na ang libingan ng kanilang mga ninuno o mga ancestral graves na maaaring makukay sa proseso ng konstruksyon.

asr-007645
08:13:04.400 --> 08:13:09.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Anong masasabi dito ng NCIP at ano ang mga hakbang na balak gawin?

asr-007646
08:13:09.480 --> 08:13:22.680
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Ngayon po ay patuloy ang konsultasyon sa BCDA at sa mga IPs na apektado po itong project na ito.

asr-007647
08:13:22.680 --> 08:13:33.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang mahalagang hakbang dito, Ginong Speaker, hindi lang matapos sa konsultasyon,

asr-007648
08:13:33.660 --> 08:13:42.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pero paano natin titiyakin na yung mga nakuha natin na mga issues, concerns, mga hinain mula sa ating mga katutubo,

asr-007649
08:13:43.020 --> 08:13:51.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay matiyak natin na may agarang aksyon, matitiyak natin na maiimpluensyahan talaga nila kung ano man yung mga desisyon,

asr-007650
08:13:51.660 --> 08:13:52.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na may kinalaman.

asr-007651
08:13:52.680 --> 08:13:54.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At may kinalaman dito sa Paxilica.

asr-007652
08:13:54.980 --> 08:14:01.820
