Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Matiyak natin kung ano mismo yung kanilang pagtingin, yung kanilang posisyon.

asr-007829
08:22:46.880 --> 08:22:48.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dating po sa MOU na ito.

asr-007830
08:22:48.720 --> 08:22:52.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya nga po, mahirap po na napirmahan na.

asr-007831
08:22:52.700 --> 08:23:03.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero hindi po, kumbaga, narinig yung boses ng most affected peoples, areas, and communities na ating mga indigenous peoples.

asr-007832
08:23:03.980 --> 08:23:16.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman po, pagdating po sa pag-aaral na tungkol po sa situation ng pag-commit sa right to education.

asr-007833
08:23:16.880 --> 08:23:20.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Quality and accessible education ng mga indigenous peoples.

asr-007834
08:23:21.660 --> 08:23:33.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron na po ba kayong datos kung paano po matitiyak yung access sa education at all levels ng ating indigenous peoples?

asr-007835
08:23:34.740 --> 08:23:39.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At paano po kayong nakikipagtulungan halimbawa sa DepEd?

asr-007836
08:23:39.280 --> 08:23:42.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron po silang last miles schools program.

asr-007837
08:23:42.680 --> 08:23:46.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang CHED din po, may particular na programa.

asr-007838
08:23:46.360 --> 08:23:53.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para sa paggamit ng higher education ng mga students na IPs.

asr-007839
08:23:54.060 --> 08:24:10.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pwede po ba kayong magbahagi sa atin kung ano yung mga initiatives ng NCIP para mapunan ang education gap at masolusyonan ang inaccessibility pa rin ng learning at education sa ating bansa?

asr-007840
08:24:16.360 --> 08:24:22.180
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Sa PAMANA po, 1,372 beneficiaries.

asr-007841
08:24:30.900 --> 08:24:35.560
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Sa SAP, 2,080 po ang beneficiaries.

asr-007842
08:24:37.040 --> 08:24:38.380
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Labing apat po yung project.

asr-007843
08:24:40.000 --> 08:24:45.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, hingin po natin ang datos na yan, ang lahat ng mga detalye.

asr-007844
08:24:45.120 --> 08:24:45.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Gayun din po.

asr-007845
08:24:45.740 --> 08:24:59.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagdating sa trabaho, kabuhayan, pati na rin sa sektor ng agrikultura, mahalaga po yan kasi napapansin po natin sa maraming mga budget proposals at sa mga tinatalakay natin ngayong mga programa.

asr-007846
08:24:59.620 --> 08:25:08.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lagi pong naiiwan yung pagtitiyak na ang mga servisyo ay abot kamay din sa ating mga indigenous peoples.

asr-007847
08:25:08.920 --> 08:25:15.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, hingin po natin ang datos na yan at challenge, hindi lang po sa NCIP.

asr-007848
08:25:15.740 --> 08:25:34.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kapulungan na ito, natitiyakin sa lahat po ng oras ay hindi lang po included, pero matiyak natin, hindi lang yung inclusivity, pero dapat meron ding priority sa lahat po ng mga nananatili, na underserved ng mga communities dito sa ating bansa.

asr-007849
08:25:34.860 --> 08:25:38.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker. Maraming salamat sa ating distinguished sponsor.

asr-007850
08:25:40.180 --> 08:25:42.780
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Thank you, Honorable Ilago. Majority Leader.

asr-007851
08:26:07.800 --> 08:26:14.000
Rep. Arnan C. Panaligan: I would like to suspend for a few minutes.

asr-007851-split-2
08:26:14.000 --> 08:26:14.900
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Session suspended.

asr-007852
08:26:32.800 --> 08:26:36.400
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Session is resumed. Majority Leader.

asr-007853
08:26:36.500 --> 08:26:44.600
Rep. Arnan C. Panaligan: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Antonio Tinio.

asr-007854
08:26:45.740 --> 08:26:53.680
Rep. Arnan C. Panaligan: of the Partylist Act Teachers to interpelate on the proposed budget of the NCIP.

asr-007855
08:26:54.220 --> 08:27:00.620
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: The Honorable Antonio Tino of Partylist Act Teachers is recognized. Please proceed.

asr-007856
08:27:19.810 --> 08:27:23.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. Um,

asr-007858
08:27:25.900 --> 08:27:30.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, Mr. Speaker, tanong natin sa NCIP, ano po ang magiging involvement?

asr-007859
08:27:30.620 --> 08:27:35.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Or kasalukuyang involvement ng NCIP sa Paxilica?

asr-007860
08:27:53.900 --> 08:28:00.060
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Ang ginagawa po natin ay coordination po sa mga IPs para po,

asr-007861
08:28:00.620 --> 08:28:02.800
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: nilang social safeguards.

asr-007862
08:28:03.840 --> 08:28:07.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Social safeguards. Ano pong ibig sabihin nun?

asr-007863
08:28:08.180 --> 08:28:12.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, ilinaw po natin bakit natin natanong ang Paxilica?

asr-007864
08:28:12.400 --> 08:28:17.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil alam natin isang mahalagang component, malaking component ng Paxilica,

asr-007865
08:28:17.700 --> 08:28:23.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ayon na rin sa paliwanag ng gobyerno, ay yung critical minerals.

asr-007866
08:28:24.680 --> 08:28:29.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, merong aspeto ng advanced manufacturing, sabi nila,

asr-007867
08:28:30.620 --> 08:28:33.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung mga semiconductors, AI-related,

asr-007868
08:28:34.880 --> 08:28:39.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pero isang component din yung critical mineral supply chain.

asr-007869
08:28:40.740 --> 08:28:47.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At alam natin, ang ibig sabihin yan sa konteksto ng Pilipinas ay mining.

asr-007870
08:28:48.380 --> 08:28:48.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

asr-007871
08:28:50.120 --> 08:28:52.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At alam naman natin, pag sinabing mining,

asr-007872
08:28:52.260 --> 08:28:54.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay kadalasan,

asr-007873
08:28:55.340 --> 08:28:59.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: masasaklaw o mahahagi po nito,

asr-007874
08:28:59.480 --> 08:29:01.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang mga lupang ninuno.

asr-007875
08:29:02.040 --> 08:29:02.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi po ba?

asr-007876
08:29:03.260 --> 08:29:09.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya ang sinasabi nyo, ang papel ng NCIP ay pagtiyak ng,

asr-007877
08:29:09.660 --> 08:29:10.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ano yung sabi nyo kanina?

asr-007878
08:29:12.500 --> 08:29:13.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano po yung term na ginamit nyo?

asr-007879
08:29:16.900 --> 08:29:18.280
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Social safeguards po.

asr-007880
08:29:18.660 --> 08:29:20.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Social safeguards.

asr-007881
08:29:21.040 --> 08:29:22.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, tama po bang intindi ko?

asr-007882
08:29:22.820 --> 08:29:27.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ibig sabihin, kung yung lupain nila, lupang ninuno,

asr-007883
08:29:27.100 --> 08:29:33.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay yan ang magiging target ng pagbimina NCIP.

asr-007884
08:29:33.520 --> 08:29:38.400
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Tutubo po ang magdi-desisyon kung papayagan o hindi ang proyekto.

asr-007885
08:29:39.120 --> 08:29:39.920
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Okay.

asr-007886
08:29:40.120 --> 08:29:45.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, kaya nga po, napakahalaga nung free prior informed consent.

asr-007887
08:29:46.280 --> 08:29:46.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po?

asr-007888
08:29:47.240 --> 08:29:47.580
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Tama po.

asr-007889
08:29:48.000 --> 08:29:49.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At kung hindi pumayag,

asr-007890
08:29:51.320 --> 08:29:51.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi tuloy.

asr-007891
08:29:52.520 --> 08:29:53.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

asr-007892
08:29:53.100 --> 08:29:54.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil legal requirement,

asr-007893
08:29:55.520 --> 08:29:56.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung FPIC,

asr-007894
08:29:56.540 --> 08:29:57.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: tama po?

asr-007895
08:29:57.840 --> 08:29:58.380
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Okay.

asr-007896
08:30:00.000 --> 08:30:13.640
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Hindi po tatalikura ng NCIP ang mandato sa pagpapatupad ng FPIC kung ang proyekto ay nasa loob po ng lupaing ninuno.

asr-007897
08:30:14.600 --> 08:30:17.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi pa payag. Paano po? Pakiulit po.

asr-007898
08:30:18.920 --> 08:30:26.540
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Hindi po tatalikura ng NCIP ang mandato sa pagpapatupad ng FPIC

asr-007899
08:30:26.540 --> 08:30:31.720
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: kung ang proyekto po ay nasa loob ng lupaing ninuno.

asr-007900
08:30:32.060 --> 08:30:33.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Thank you for that.

asr-007901
08:30:33.620 --> 08:30:48.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Nung February 4 po, 2026, ay nilagdaan ng gobyerno ng Pilipinas,

asr-007902
08:30:49.120 --> 08:30:54.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: particular ng DNR at saka ng United States,

asr-007903
08:30:54.620 --> 08:31:01.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: represented by the Undersecretary of State, Jacob Helberg.

asr-007904
08:31:03.440 --> 08:31:13.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At sa Pilipinas naman, ay dating nung panahon yun, siya pa yung Secretary of Environment and Natural Resources,

asr-007905
08:31:14.340 --> 08:31:16.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: si Rafael Perpetuo Lutila.

asr-007906
08:31:16.620 --> 08:31:17.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Si Rafael Perpetuo Lutila.

asr-007907
08:31:17.840 --> 08:31:23.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tinirmahan po nila yung Philippines-US Memorandum of Understanding

asr-007908
08:31:23.620 --> 08:31:25.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: on Critical Minerals.

asr-007909
08:31:26.520 --> 08:31:27.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba yun?

asr-007910
08:31:33.740 --> 08:31:35.500
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Tama po. Pinirmahan po.

asr-007911
08:31:36.240 --> 08:31:37.160
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Tama po. Okay.

asr-007912
08:31:38.160 --> 08:31:48.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, kasama po sa mga probisyon nung understanding yung number three regarding permitting,

asr-007913
08:31:48.020 --> 08:31:52.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the participants are taking measures to accelerate,

asr-007914
08:31:52.740 --> 08:31:53.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: streamline,

asr-007915
08:31:53.620 --> 08:31:59.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: or deregulate permitting timelines and processes,

asr-007916
08:32:00.340 --> 08:32:07.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: including obtaining permits for critical minerals and rare earth mining,

asr-007917
08:32:08.220 --> 08:32:15.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: separation and processing within their respective domestic regulatory systems consistent with applicable law.

asr-007918
08:32:16.400 --> 08:32:21.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi isa yun sa mga probisyon nung Memorandum of Understanding.

asr-007919
08:32:21.780 --> 08:32:23.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So yung pagpapabilis daw po,

asr-007920
08:32:23.620 --> 08:32:25.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng permitting,

asr-007921
08:32:25.700 --> 08:32:26.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pagkuhan ng permit,

asr-007922
08:32:27.340 --> 08:32:28.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: para nga matuloy yung mine.

asr-007923
08:32:28.580 --> 08:32:30.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasama po ba sa prosesong ito,

asr-007924
08:32:31.860 --> 08:32:35.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung pag-obtain ng FPIC?

asr-007925
08:32:37.700 --> 08:32:38.520
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Hindi po.

asr-007926
08:32:39.080 --> 08:32:39.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi po?

asr-007927
08:32:39.700 --> 08:32:40.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi po.

asr-007928
08:32:40.920 --> 08:32:45.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So baka kakuha ka ng permit kahit walang FPIC, ganun po ba?

asr-007929
08:32:48.000 --> 08:32:49.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Walang consent?

asr-007930
08:32:50.240 --> 08:32:51.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Walang katibayan ng consent?

asr-007931
08:32:51.740 --> 08:32:52.520
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Hindi po.

asr-007932
08:32:52.640 --> 08:32:52.980
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Hindi po.

asr-007933
08:32:53.620 --> 08:32:54.500
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Hindi.

asr-007934
08:32:54.820 --> 08:32:55.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi makakakuha.

asr-007935
08:32:55.900 --> 08:32:56.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi po.

asr-007936
08:32:56.400 --> 08:32:58.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi nga po.

asr-007937
08:32:58.980 --> 08:32:59.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So no permit.

asr-007938
08:33:00.680 --> 08:33:02.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No consent, no permit.

asr-007939
08:33:02.840 --> 08:33:03.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po.

asr-007940
08:33:04.380 --> 08:33:05.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So kasama sa proseso.

asr-007941
08:33:06.300 --> 08:33:12.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasama sa proseso ng permitting na tinatawag sa section 3 na ito,

asr-007942
08:33:13.780 --> 08:33:20.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung permitting timelines and processes.

asr-007943
08:33:20.700 --> 08:33:21.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-007944
08:33:22.280 --> 08:33:23.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Obtaining permits.

asr-007945
08:33:23.620 --> 08:33:26.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For critical minerals and rare earth mining.

asr-007946
08:33:26.720 --> 08:33:27.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So kasama po yan.

asr-007947
08:33:28.540 --> 08:33:29.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa mga kailangan.

asr-007948
08:33:30.480 --> 08:33:31.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sino mang gusto magmina,

asr-007949
08:33:32.600 --> 08:33:34.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: maraming dadaanan.

asr-007950
08:33:34.320 --> 08:33:35.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meron sa DNR, alam natin yan.

asr-007951
08:33:36.700 --> 08:33:38.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa LGU, kailangan mo.

asr-007952
08:33:38.340 --> 08:33:42.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero kailangan din sa indigenous communities

asr-007953
08:33:42.520 --> 08:33:45.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: through the FPIC.

asr-007954
08:33:45.440 --> 08:33:45.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

asr-007955
08:33:47.680 --> 08:33:50.940
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Kung nasa loob po ng ancestral domain,

asr-007956
08:33:52.500 --> 08:33:53.500
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: ay kailangan.

asr-007957
08:33:53.620 --> 08:33:57.740
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: At hindi po maaaring isakripisyo ng ang FPIC

asr-007958
08:33:57.740 --> 08:34:00.400
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: bilang substantive rights

asr-007959
08:34:00.400 --> 08:34:04.620
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: na makatutubo para sa pagpapabilis ng permit.

asr-007960
08:34:04.940 --> 08:34:05.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-007961
08:34:05.980 --> 08:34:07.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So ito po nilagdaan noong Pebrero.

asr-007962
08:34:08.520 --> 08:34:13.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: February 4, 2026.

asr-007963
08:34:13.780 --> 08:34:16.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Signed in Washington, February 4, 2026.

asr-007964
08:34:17.840 --> 08:34:22.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At kasama nga po yung binasa kong provision

asr-007965
08:34:22.160 --> 08:34:23.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: on permit.

asr-007966
08:34:23.460 --> 08:34:23.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So ito po nilagdaan noong February 4, 2026.

asr-007967
08:34:23.600 --> 08:34:25.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Permitting the participants,

asr-007968
08:34:25.820 --> 08:34:27.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: meaning the Philippine government,

asr-007969
08:34:28.140 --> 08:34:30.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: are taking measures to accelerate,

asr-007970
08:34:30.560 --> 08:34:31.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: streamline,

asr-007971
08:34:31.720 --> 08:34:34.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: or deregulate permitting timelines and processes.

asr-007972
08:34:34.980 --> 08:34:35.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-007973
08:34:35.680 --> 08:34:37.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, naging kontrobersyal po

asr-007974
08:34:37.820 --> 08:34:42.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na nag-issue kayo ng revised guidelines

asr-007975
08:34:42.060 --> 08:34:44.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: on FPIC.

asr-007976
08:34:44.860 --> 08:34:45.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

asr-007977
08:34:53.600 --> 08:35:04.720
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: So yung po'ng 2026 FPIC guidelines,

asr-007978
08:35:04.940 --> 08:35:09.460
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: it went through along an extensive process

asr-007979
08:35:09.460 --> 08:35:11.780
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: of review and consultation.

asr-007980
08:35:13.160 --> 08:35:16.140
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: The review started as early as 2016.

asr-007981
08:35:17.380 --> 08:35:19.220
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Based on our records,

asr-007982
08:35:20.220 --> 08:35:22.600
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: there were 32 documented

asr-007983
08:35:23.300 --> 08:35:29.500
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: consultation and engagement activities,

asr-007984
08:35:29.500 --> 08:35:34.700
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: including 20 Commission en banc review and deliberation sessions,

asr-007985
08:35:34.700 --> 08:35:37.800
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: and major stakeholder consultations

asr-007987
08:35:37.800 --> 08:35:41.300
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: in Mindanao, Luzon and Visayas.

asr-007989
08:35:41.300 --> 08:35:44.300
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Hindi po ito minadali.

asr-007997
08:35:44.300 --> 08:35:47.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes, I am aware of that, Mr. Speaker.

asr-007998
08:35:47.400 --> 08:35:49.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ginoong sponsor, dahil sine-search ko po sa internet

asr-007999
08:35:49.500 --> 08:35:51.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at may mga nakita nga tayong mga dokumento,

asr-008000
08:35:51.700 --> 08:35:53.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa internet.

asr-008006
08:35:53.280 --> 08:35:55.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na nga tayong mga dokumento, ng mga draft

asr-008007
08:35:55.540 --> 08:35:56.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: revisions,

asr-008008
08:35:57.320 --> 08:35:59.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dating, ah yung nakita ko,

asr-008009
08:35:59.320 --> 08:36:01.180
