asr-008416
08:52:24.600 --> 08:52:31.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito nga po, yung application na ito, yun po ang coverage. Pero sinasabi ninyo, hindi.

asr-008417
08:52:31.340 --> 08:52:32.660
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: 2022 po.

asr-008418
08:52:33.600 --> 08:52:36.800
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Nag-amend ang Santa Lucia.

asr-008419
08:52:37.100 --> 08:52:40.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, nag-amend. So, ano, inalis na po yung Santa Lucia?

asr-008420
08:52:42.060 --> 08:52:42.600
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Opo, opo.

asr-008421
08:52:42.920 --> 08:52:48.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, okay. Anyway, pero yung mga ibang ito ay may application. Tama po?

asr-008422
08:52:50.180 --> 08:52:51.020
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Pahagi po yun.

asr-008423
08:52:51.020 --> 08:52:54.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pahagi. Ano po ang status ng application?

asr-008424
08:52:56.440 --> 08:53:05.840
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: The claim remains under processing due to overlapping claims with BCDA titled areas.

asr-008425
08:53:07.080 --> 08:53:20.160
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Funding requirement for CADT processing, incomplete supporting evidence, requiring further validation, and internal community issues that need to be resolved.

asr-008426
08:53:21.020 --> 08:53:33.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. So, may mga issues pa po. So, may conflicting claims ang grupo ng ITA na ito with BCDA itself. Tama po ba?

asr-008427
08:53:34.320 --> 08:53:37.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos may mga iba pang issue na binanggit kayo. Tama po?

asr-008428
08:53:38.820 --> 08:53:39.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-008429
08:53:39.540 --> 08:53:40.240
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Tama po, tama po.

asr-008430
08:53:40.240 --> 08:53:50.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero ngayon, yung subject na, yung gusto nilang, yung ina-applyan nila, yun mismo, yung area na sasaklawin ng Paxilica Project.

asr-008431
08:53:51.020 --> 08:53:51.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

asr-008432
08:53:52.400 --> 08:53:53.340
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Tama po, tama po.

asr-008433
08:53:53.400 --> 08:53:59.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: O, yun na nga. Kahit yung Santa Lucia, yung sinasabi nyo, merong ibang application eh.

asr-008434
08:54:02.540 --> 08:54:05.000
Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Ang tinanggal po yung mga residential areas.

asr-008435
08:54:05.320 --> 08:54:11.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Opo. Pero ang point po natin, meron po mga ITA dyan. At maaring sabihin, eh wala pa.

asr-008436
08:54:11.540 --> 08:54:19.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pending pa yung CADT application nila. In the meantime, pinapaalis na nga po.

asr-008437
08:54:21.020 --> 08:54:30.720
