Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: si Apong Pet, ayan, nakikita ko po. Kilala po ba yan ng NCIP?

asr-008454
08:56:04.180 --> 08:56:11.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Opo. Ayan, si Chieftain Petronila C. Mu?oz, CADT representative, no.

asr-008455
08:56:11.940 --> 08:56:20.240
